<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JER" style="id">Jeremiah</book>
  <para style="h">Jeremiah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jeremiah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jeremiah</para>
  <para style="mt">Jeremiah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi thubu sia Benjamin ngam sungah a om Anathoth khua pan thiampite khat ahi, Hilkiah ii tapa Jeremiah ii thu sonte a kitepteena ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amon ii tapa Josiah sia Judah kumpi a sua zawk kum sawm le kum thum a cin kum in Topa in Jeremiah paupui hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciang Josiah ii tapa Jehoiakim kumpi a sua ciang Topa in Jeremiah paupui leleau hi. Tuasia zawkciang, Josiah ii tapa Zedekiah kumpi a sua zawk kum sawm le kum khat dong Topa in ama tamvei mama paupui hi. Tua kum a tha ngana ciang Jerusalem mite ngamdang ah sal tang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in kei tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Nuntakna kong piak ma in kong tealtuam zo a, na nu sung pan na sua ma in minamte tungah kamsaang khat tu in kong teal hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Vaanglianpipa Topa awng, kei thusonzia tu he bong; moi lei lai ing,” ci in ka zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang Topa in kei tungah, “Kei ka moi leih hi ci heak in, kong paisakna mun, mite kungah pai in, son tu a kong thupiak theampo amate tungah son siat in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate kiita heak in, banghang ziam cile keima in nangma hong dal tu in kong ompui tu hi, Topa, keima in kong son zo hi!” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in a khut hong thaakin, ka mukte hong tham a, tuaciang kei tungah, “Ngai in, na pau tu kammalte na kam sungah ka koi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Minamte le kumpi ngamte a longhkeak tu le a kaikeak tu, a susia tu le a lawnthal tu, a sa tu le a suan tu in thu neina, tuni in nang kong pia hi” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in, “Jeremiah awng, bang na mu ziam?” ci in kei hong dongh hi. Keima in, “Almond thingbaak khat ka mu hi,” ci in ka zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in, “Maan ni hi, tuaciang keima kammalte a taangtung tu sia en nginge khi hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Topa in, “A dang bang na mu ziam?” ci in kei hong dongh leleau hi. Keima in, “Sak sangah tuibeal a so khat, hi sangah hong puk dektak khat ka mu hi,” ci in ka zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in kei tungah, “Hi ngam sungah a teang mihingte theampo tungah saksang panin tuiso bangin siatna hong tung tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />banghang ziam cile saksang ah a teang minamte theampo hong pai tu in ka sam hi. Amate ii kumpite in a kumpi tokhumte uh sia Jerusalem kongpite le, luphung kiimkot ah ahizong, Judah khuapi dangte ii kiimkot ah ahizong phut tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keima in ka mite daan ka pia tu hi, banghang ziam cile amate in mawna khialna vawt zo uh hi; amate in kei hong nusia zo uh a, pathian dangte tungah biakpiakna pia in, milim vawtin bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jeremiah awng, kithoai in; va pai ta'n a, amate na son tu a kong thupiak theampo va son ta'n. Tu in amate kiita heak in, na kiita ahile amate taw na omkhop ciang kong kiitasak vaial tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jeremiah awng, ngai in! Hi ngam sungah om mihing theampo — Judah kumpite, uliante, thiampite le mipite — in nang hong langpan tu uh hi. Ahihang tuni in amate na nalh zawk natu in thahatna kong pia tu hi; nangma in kulh taw a ki uum khuapi khat bang, thik khuam khat bang le taau luphung khat bang na hi tu hi. Amate in nang hong zo ngawl tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile nang hong dal tu in kong ompui tu hi. Topa keima in ka son zo hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Jerusalem khua sungah a om mihingte theampo tungah hi thu thangsak tu in kei hong sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Na khangno lai in na thumaanna ih kiteen sawng lai a kei nong itnate ka phawk hi; sennealngam, an kicing ngawl leitang kaantanin kei nong zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel awng, nang in keima aa bek na hi a; nangma in a thiangtho ka neisa na hi hi. Nang hong nasak mihingte theampo tungah tuasiatna le ngimna ka tungsak hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />No Jacob ii suan le paalte, Israel minam teng awng, Topa ii hong thuhilna ngai vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in: “Na taanghpupite in kei hong langpanin bang hong mawsiat ziam? Kei kung pan amate a puapialsak sia a bang ziam? Amate in a man nei ngawl milimte bia in amate mama a man nei ngawl suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima in amate Egypt ngam pan suatakin duisung ngampa: sennealngam le dumkhuk sung, lei kongaw a, kuama teen ngawl, a lau huaina mun le kuama khual zongh a haw ngawl natu mun kaantanin amate keima in lampui hi napi amate in kei, hong awlmawk ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima in amate thaw an laaknate le a dang a phate a nga natu in leiphana mun ka thetpui hi. Tua hi napi amate in ka ngam siasak zaw a; amate ka piaksa ngam ninsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thiampite in, ‘ Topa koisung om ziam?’ ci in zongh dongh ngawl uh hi. Keima ii thiampite mama in kei hong he ngawl uh hi. Ngam ukte in kei hong langpan uh a; kamsaangte in Baal min suangin thuson uh a, tuaciang bangma kimanna a nei ngawl milimte bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tua ahikom keima, Topa in ka mite ka mawsak kik tu hi. Amate ii suan le paalte tungah thu ka vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nitumna sang Cyprus tuikulh ah pai in, tuaciang khat po nisuana sang Kedar ngam ah paisak in. Nidangin hi bang thu piang ngeingawl cisia na mu tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Minam dangte kuama in a pathiante uh sia pathian tatak ahi ngawl hang kheal ngeingawl uh hi. Ahihang ka mite in amate vaang a pia Pathian, keima sia, amate atu bangma a vawtsak thei ngawl pathian taw hong theak zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahikom keima in van sia launa taw in a liin natu, lamdang a kisak thei mama natu in thu ka pia hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />banghang ziam cile ka mite in mawna khialna nam nii vawt zo uh hi; amate in a thiangtho ciktui, keima kung pan puapial zo uh hi, tuaciang amate in tui a cing thei vet ngawl a kektham tuikhukte to uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Israel sia sal hi ngawl hi; sal nam in piang ngawl hi. Tua ahile banghangin a ngalte in zuizen uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in tawpi bangin ama hawk san uh hi; amate in ama ngam sennealngam suaksak zo hi, a khuate siasak zo a, kinusia cip zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hi hi, Memphis le Tahpanhes mite in ama lu ngu sutham zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel awng, hi teng na tungah na thengsak hi! Nang lam kong pui laitakin nangma in Topa na Pathian, keima nong nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Egypt ngam ah pai in Nile nguntui neakna taw bang phatuamna nga tu ki um ni ziam? Assyria ngam ah pai in Euphrates nguntui neakna taw bang phattuamna nga tu ki um ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangma siatna in nangma daan hong pia tu a, kei nong nungngatna in nang hong puavawk tu hi. Topa na Pathian, keima hong nusia a, kei tungah thumaanin na om nawn ngawl tu sia bangzata in sia in khaa a, khial ci sia na tel tu hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa, Vaanglianbelpa in ka ci zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Israel awng, nidang lai pekin ka thuneina nong nial hi; ka thu ni ngawlin nong bia bua hi. Mual saangna theampo tung le thingkung hing theampo nuai ah ta nei theina pathiante na bia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A ci phabel sung pan deiteal sapitkung khat taw kibangin nang kong suan zo hi. Ahihang bang suak zo ni ziam en in! A muatcip, kimanna nei ngawl sapitkung taw na kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Satpia phabel taw na kisil zongin na mawna a baang sia ka mu lai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangbangin nangma le nangma ka kininsak bua a, Baal ka bia ngei bua na ci thei tu ziam? Munkuam sungah mawna khialna na vawt hi; na vawt sate mu in. Nang sia a zual ngawl kalaoh huuk khat taw na kibang a, leetai kawkoai in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />sennealngamsung na zuan hi. A huuk laitakin, akua in uk zo tu ziam? A ngeam nuam a tal khat atu in hanciam kul ngawl a; a huuk hunin nga thei tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel awng, pathian dangte ii nung na delna taw in na peang toisak heak in a, na dangkosak heak in. Ahihang nangma in, ‘Hi ngawl hi! hong heak kik thei ngawl tu khi hi. Keima in ngamdang pathiante ka it a tuate nung ka zui tu hi,’ na ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa in, “Nguta khat a kimat ciang a maimawl bangma in, no Israel mite theampo — na kumpite le uliante, na thiampite le kamsaangte hong maimawlsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thingkung khat sia ka pa hi, suangtum khat sia ka nu hi a cite — no teng na mai uh zum tu hi. Keima kung hong zuan ngawl a puapial na hi uh kom hi thu piang tu hi. Ahihang ngimna na thuak uh ciang hong hun tu in hong pai ta'n ci in nong ngen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Noma atu na vawt sa uh pathiante koisungah om ziam? Ngimna na thuak uh ciang amate in hunsak ve vun — amate in hi thei ahile! Judah awng, khuapi na neiza ma in pathian tam mama na nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na phunna uh sia a bang hi kabel ziam? Banghangin kei hong langpan nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Keima in no, daan kong pia hi, ahihang bangma phatuam ngawl hi; keima ii no kong puua tu nuam ngawl nu hi. Tawpi kitom khat bangin, na kamsaangte uh na thatlum zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Israel mite awng, ka kampauna hong ngai tavun. Kei sia note atu in sennealngam khat bang ka hi ngei ziam, khuazing le a lauhuai ngam khat bang ka hi ngei ziam? Tua ahile, banghangin, ka uk bang po in ka ngamta tu uh a, nang kung kong zuan ngei nawn buatu uh hi na ci thei uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ngaknu khat in a kizepna suang manphate, ahibuale mothak khat in a mopuante mangil thei ziam? Ahihang ka mite in a kisim zo ngawl ni tam mama sung hong mangil zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lawm zonna zia na thiam mama uh hi. Numei a siabel zongh in no kung panin thiamna hong sin thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na puante uh sia inn phuulte ii chisan baang ngawlin, mizawngte le mawna nei ngawlte ii chisan baang hi. “Ahihang, hi bang teng hi napi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />nang in, ‘Mawna ka nei bua hi; ka tungah Topa thin uuk nawn ngawl takpi hi’ na ci hi. Ahihang keima, Topa in, mawna ka nei bua hi na ci hu in, daan kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Minam dangte ii pathiante kung na zot hu in nangma le nangma in na man na kisulhsak zo hi. Assyria te ii na thin hong kiamsak bang keak ma in, Egypt te in na thin hong kiamsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Nang in Egypt ngam panin maizumna taw lu kun sa in na heak kik tu hi. Topa, keima in na muan mite ka nial zo hi; amate tung panin bangma phattuamna na nga buatu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in, “Pasal khat in a zi khul a, tua nu in ama nusia in ngualdang khat ii zi a suak le, ama in tua nu la kik thei ngawl tu hi. A la kik ahile a ngam ninsak siat tu hi. Ahihang Israel awng, nang in lawm tam mama na nei zawkciang tu in ka kung nong zuan kik nuam hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mualdawnte ento in. Pumpi kizuak khat bang a na ngamtat ngawlna mun a om ziam? Arab mite in a suam tu mite sennealngam sungah a pan bangin nang in lam dung ah lawm na pang hi. Na pumpi kizuakna taw in ngam na ninsak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua hu in nguatui hang a, khuapi nguazu ngawl hi. Numei kizuak khat taw na kibang hi; maizumna na nei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Tu in kei tungah, ‘Nangma in ka pa na hi a, ka no lai pan kipan kei nong it zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei tungah nong thin uuk tawntung buatu a; kei tungah na thin nong ngam tawntung buatu hi’ nong ci hi. Israel awng, tua in nangma ci hi a, ahihang a sia na vawt thei theampo na vawt hi” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Josiah, kumpi in a maan lai in, Topa in kei tungah, “Tua a thumaan ngawl numei, Israel ngamtatna na mu zo ziam? Ama in kei hong taisan zo a, mual saangna theampo tung le thingkung hing theampo nuai ah pumpi kizuak numei khat bangin ngamta zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in hi teng theampo a vawt siat zawkciang, kei kung hong zuan kik nanak tu in ka ngaisun hi. Ahihang ama hong heak kik ngawl a, a thumaan ngawl ama ii suapuinu Judah in tuate theampo mu siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel sia keima kung pan tai zo a, pumpi kizuak numei khat suak zo ahi hu in ama khul a, ka nawkeakna thu sia Judah zongh in mu hi. Ahihang Israel ii a thumaan ngawl a suapuinu Judah sia lau ngawl hi. Ama zongh pumpi kizuak khat suak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a maizum ngawl het hi. Ama in ngam ninsak hi, suangtum le thingkungte a biakna taw in palngul khialna vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi bang teng zawkciang Israel ii a thumaan ngawl, a suapuinu Judah in ka kungah heak kik tu in hong kinei theam bek a; a thin tatak taw hi ngawl hi. Topa, keima in ka son zo hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in kei tungah, Israel sia ama kung pan heak kik ahitazong, a thumaan ngawl Judah sangin phazaw ngawp lai hi, ci in hong son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in kei tungah Israel te kung pai in hong sawl a, “Thumaan ngawl Israel awng, ka kungah hong pai kik ta'n. Keima in ka hesuak thei a, ka thin uuk ngawl tu hi; nang tungah a tawntungin ka thin a uuk buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na khialna le Topa na Pathian na langpannate thiang takin pualaak po in. Thingkung hing theampo ii nuai ah ngamdang pathiante na thangaina taw kong thupiakte na nit ngawlnate pualaak in. Topa keima in ka son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Thumaan ngawl mite awng, hong pai kik tavun; keima ii neisa na hi uh hi. Khuapi sim panin khat tek le bee le phung sim panin nii tek kong la tu a, Zion mual ah kong puak kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka thu hong ni ngamukte kong pia tu a, amate in pilna le telthiamna taw note hong uk tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaciang tua ngam sungah pungin mihing na tam zawk uh ciang, mihingte in ka Thuciamna Thingkuang ii thu son nawn ngawl tu uh hi. Amate in tua thu ngaisun nawn ngawl tu a, zongh phawk nawn ngawl tu uh hi; amate in kul zongh sa ngawl tu uh a, a dang vawt tuan ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua hun hong thet ciang, Jerusalem sia ‘ Topa ii Kumpi Tokhum,’ kici tu a, minam theampo tua munah keima bia tu in kikhawm tu uh hi. Amate in a thin puina le a thin siatnate ii sawlna bangin seam nawn ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel sia Judah taw kikop tu uh a, amate in a saltanna ngamsung saksang pan hong paikhawm tekin, na taanghpupite ii a kip a kho in a nei top tu a piaksa ngam ah cia kik tek tu uh hi,” va ci ta'n, ci a hong sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in, “Israel awng, nang sia ka tapa bangin kong saang nuam a, leitung theampo sung pan a et hoibel ngamnuam khat kong pia nuam hi. Kei sia pa nong nak tu le ka kung pan na tai kik ngei nawn ngawl tu ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahihang a thumaan ngawl zi khat bangin, kei tungah nong thumaan bua hi. Topa keima in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mualdawnte ah awnging khat kiza hi: tua in Israel mite kaana le thuumna aw ahi hi, banghang ziam cile amate nuntakna sia mawna khialna taw kidimin Topa a Pathian uh a makngil hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa kung pan a puapial note theampo awng, heak kik tavun; ama in note hong damsak tu a, thumaan hong suaksak tu hi. Note in, “Hi hi, ama in ih Pathian ahi manin eite Topa kungah ih pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mualdawn ah ih doai biakna in ei hong hu vet ngawl hi. Israel te atu huna sia Topa ih Pathian kung pan bekin hong pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahihang maizumna pathian, Baal biakna in, ih tuu honte le khui honte, tapate le tanute — taanghlai pan kipan ih taanghpupite ii a thalaw sa theampo hong sumsisak siat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Eite maizum in, lum in ih maimawlna in hong seal tahen. Eima le ih taanghpupite sia Topa ih Pathian tungah ih khial tawntung zo hi; ama ii thupiakte ih zui ngei bua hi,” ci nu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in, “Irsael mite awng, na kiheak nuam uh le, kei kungah hong heak kik tavun. Ka tungah nong thumaan a, ka ngaimawk milimte na vawk uh le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ka min suang a na kiciam tu uh sia no atu in a maan hi tu hi. Tuasia ciang minam theampo in amate thupha ka piak natu hong ngen tu uh a, kei hong pok tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in Judah mite le Jerusalem khua mite tungah, “Na thaw ngawl lai uh lote tho vun; ling kawm sungah na anciite poai heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />No, Judah mite le Jerusalem khua mite awng, na Topa ahi keima taw na vawt uh thuciamna sia keamcing vun a, ka tungah hong ki aap tavun. Tuabangin na hi bua uh le, a siate na vawtna uh hu in ka thin uukna sia mei bangin kuang tu hi. Tuasia kuangin tua meikuang a mit tu kuama om ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngamsung theampo ah lemle tum vun! A nging le a kitelthiangin au vun! Judah mite le Jerusalem khua mite tungah a muanhuai khuapite ah a tai natu son vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zion paina lampi hil vun! Na suatak natu in tai vun! Haisaang heak vun! Topa in saksang panin tuasiatna le suksiatna lian hong puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tawpi khat in a bukna mun pan hong pai bangin, ngamte a siasak tu khat hong kuan zo hi. Judah susia tu in ama hong pai hi. Judah ngam khuapite a siacip in kinusia tu a, kuama teang ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahiciang khau-ip puan silh in, kapin tau vun banghang ziam cile Topa thin uukna sia Judah panin puapial ngawl lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in, “Tua ni ciang kumpite le uliante a thin kiam tu uh hi; thiampite ingh dimdum tu uh a, kamsaangte in lamdang sa mama tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuasia ciang keima in, “Vaanglianpipa Topa awng, Jerusalem mite theam vawk zo ni hi! Kilemna om tu hi ci zo ni hi, ahihang amate ii longtawl ah namsau khat na tuuk nginge hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vui a sa mama khat sennealngam panin Jerusalem mite sangah hong va tu hi cina thu sia Jerusalem mite tungah a kison tu hun hong theng zo hi. Tua vui sia anvaaite a mut keak vui bang bek hi ngawl tu a —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa ii sawlna taw a va vui sia tuasia sangin thahat zaw tu hi! A mite tungah thukhenna a pia sia Topa ama mama ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />En vun, meeite bangin ngal hong pai hi. Amate ii siphu ngalleangte sia suumpei taw kibang a, a siphute sia muvanlaite sangin ngang zaw uh hi. Ei a lel ih hi hi! Ei a lal ih hi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jerusalem awng, na thinsung panin ngitlona silthiang in, tua hile nang hong kingum thei tu hi. Na thinsung ah maw nopna thin bang tanvei ngaisun tu ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dan khuapi le Ephraim mualte tung pan hong pai kamtaite in thusiate zasak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A khuala ngam khat panin ngalte hong paina thu, Jerusalem tungah son tu le minamte kidop natu hilkhol tu in amate hong pai uh hi. Hi ngalte in Judah ngamsung khuapite ausan tu uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />mihingte lo hung bangin Jerusalem kiim uum tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile a mite in Topa a langpan hang ahi hi. Topa in ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Judah awng, na nuntakna zia le na nasepna sate taw in hi thu nangma tung ma na then hi. Na mawna in hi thuakna piangsak zo a; tua in na lungtang hollet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na hi! A na ka thuak zo bua hi! Ka lungtang! Ka lungtuk ngam vasat hi! Thim khipkhep in ka ommuang thei bua hi; lemle aw le ngal simna aw ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuasiatna khat zawkciang khat hong theng a; ngamsung buppi kisia siat hi. Thakhat thu in ih bukte kilalsak hi; a puankhaite ki eaukeak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bang tanvei ngal kisim lialua ka mu lai tu ziam, bang tanvei lemle tum ka za lai tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in, “Ka mite mawmaw uh hi; amate in kei hong he ngawl uh hi. Amate sia patang mawmawte bang hi uh a; tel theina bangma nei ngawl uh hi. Amate a sia vawt tu thiam a, a pha vawt thei ngawl uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Leitung ka en a — tulin kolh thong hi; van ka en a — khuavak om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mualliante ka en a — tuate liing hi, tuaciang mualnote kivei kawkoai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khua ka et le mihing kuama om ngawl a; vacimte ngawngawn leang siat zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lo ngam leiphana teng sennealngam suak zo a; Topa ii thin uuk mama na hu in a khuapite kisia cip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />( Topa in leitung buppi duisung ngampa suak tu hi ci hi, ahihang siacipsak ngawl tu hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Leitung sia naangin kap tu a; van sia zing vanuai tu hi. Topa ii sonsa hi a, a thin kheal kik ngawl tu hi. Ama in a khensat sa hi a, kheal kik ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Siphu ngalkapte le thal toai ngalkapte ii ngin a zaak uh ciang mihing theampo tai keak tu uh hi. Pawlkhat sia ngam tawnghtol sungah tai tu a, a dangte suang kawm ah kaato tu uh hi. Khua theampo a hawm nguakin kinusia tu a, tua khuate sungah kuama teang kik ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jerusalem awng, nang a lal na hi hi! Banghangin puansan silh ni ziam? Banghangin suangmanpha kizepnate aw in na mitte ngelh ni ziam? Nangma le nangma a hoi a na kizepnate luithawthong hi! Na lawmngaite in nang hong nial zo a nang hong that nuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Numei khat nautun a, a kap bang aw khat ka za hi, taciil a suak numei khat ii cik-au taw kibang hi. Tua in Jerusalem ii hu sam saa a, a kaana ahi hi, a khut zan in, “Kei a lal hi ing! Keima that tu in amate hong pai hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem mite awng, na lamdungte zui in tai vun! Na kiim na paam khuadakin en vun! Noma tatak ma na mu vun. Vanh zuakna munte zong vun! A maan a ngamta le Pathian tungah thumaan tu a hanciam mihing khat na mu thei uh ziam? Na mu thei uh ahile Topa in Jerusalem ii mawna maisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa ka bia tu uh hi na ci uh hangin, na thin tatak uh taw na ci uh hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in thumaanna zong takpi hi. Ama in no hong saat hi, ahihang no in phamaw na sa bua uh hi; ama in no hong hualcip hi, ahihang thuhilna na ngai tuan bua uh hi. Na thin uh pui in na mawnate uh panin na kikheal bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuasia ciang keima in, “Hite sia a zawng bangma a he ngawlte bek hi. Amate in a mawmawthuai in ngamta uh hi; amate sia a Pathian ii a kat sia he ngawl a, Topa ii a sepsak nop sia zongh he ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihingte kungah vaangletna taw ka pai tu a, amate taw thu ka son tu hi. A tatakin ci leang amate in a Pathian ii a kat sia he takpi a, amate ii a sep tu, Topa deina sia he uh hi,” ci in ka ngaisun hi. Ahihang amate theampo in Topa ii thuneina nialin, a thu ni nuam ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua hu in ngam tawnghtol sung pan tawpite in amate petlum tu uh hi; sennealngam pan ngia te in amate laitham tu a, pawlbeamte in a khua sungah vak kawkoai tu uh hi. Tua mihingte a pusuak uh le kibaltham tu hi, banghang ziam cile a mawna uh tam mama a, Pathian kung pan pial nithi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in, “Ka mite ii mawnate banghangin maisak tu khi ziam? Amate in kei hong nusia in pathian tatak ahi ngawlte bia zo uh hi. ka mite sia a ngilva dong ka vaak a, ahihang amate in palngul khialna vawtin pumpi kizuakte taw a hun zangh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate sia a innpaamte ii zite a lamnai, a pha tak a kivaak siphu tal lante bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi thute hangin amate daan pia ngawl, hi bang minam tungah phula ngawl tu khi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka mite ii sapithuante ah a nguite saattan tu in ngalte ka paisak tu hi, ahihang a vekpi in ka susiasak buatu hi. A baakte heu in ka sawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile a baakte sia kei aa hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel mite le Judah mite in kei hong leeheak cip zo uh hi. Topa keima in ka son zo hi,” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa ii mite in ama nial in, “Ama in bangma vawt takpi ngawl tu hi. Ih haksatna hunte om ngawl tu hi; ngal ahibuale kialpi ih thuak buatu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kamsaangte sia vuibung bang hi lel uh a, Topa kung pan thupuak tu bangma nei ngawl uh hi amate in ci uh hi. Vaanglianbelpa Topa Pathian in kei tungah, “Jeremiah awng, hi mihingte in tuabang thute son ahikom ka kammalte sia na kam sungah mei bang ka hisak tu hi. Mihingte in thing bang hi tu a, tua mei in amate kaanghtum tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel mihingte awng, ngam khuala pan no hong sim tu in Topa in minam khat hong paipui hi. Tua minam sia a thahat le taanghlai minam khat hi a, a kam na heak ngawl uh minam khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A thal toai te sia kuama hesuak ngawlin mihing a that, a thahat ngalkapte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in na ankungte le na an uhte hong khawnsak tu uh a; na tapate le na tanute thatlum tu uh hi. Amate in na tuu le na khuihonte ngo tu uh a, na sapitkungte le na thei kungte susia tu uh hi. Na muan mama uh kulh taw a ki uum khuapite a ngalkapte in susia tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in, “Ahihang tuasia hun ciang ngawngawn zongin ka mite ka susia cip siat buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hite theampo banghang vawt khi ziam ci in amate in hong dok ciang Jeremiah awng, amate in kei kung pan puapial a, a ngam sungah ngamdang pathiante atu a sep bangma in, amate ii ngam ahi ngawl ngamsung khat ah ngamdangmite atu na seam tu uh hi, ci in amate son ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in, “Jacob ii suan le paalte le Judah mite tungah son in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />No, a ngaisun thei ngawl a nangh mi mawmawte, mit nei napi a mu thei ngawlte, bil nei napi a za thei ngawlte awng, ngai vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Keima in Topa ka hi hi; banghang hong kiita ngawl nu ziam? Banghang ka mai ah liing ngawl nu ziam? Tuipi ii ngamngi tu in sen ka koi a, tui ii kaantan zawk ngawl a tawntung a kho ngamngi ahi hi. Tuipi a kilok hial zong kaantan zo ngawl tu a; tuihualte a hawk ngawp zong phultan zo ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahihang no mihingte! Na thin uh pui in nong langpan uh hi; Kei nong pial uh a nong nusia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Keima in a hun ciangin tuuk ngua le khaal ngua hong zusakin kum simin anlaak hun hong pia hi napi in kei zatak tu na ngaisun ngei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na mawna, na khialnate uh in hi naphate na nga tu uh hong khaktan hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Mi ngilote ka mite ii sungah teang uh hi; Amate in ngeen taw vacim thaang a sia mite bangin mihingte man tu in thaangsia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Savaipa khat in a bawm dimteak vacim a khum bangin amate ii a sutol vanhte taw a inn dimh zo uh hi. Tua ahikom amate sia thahat in hau a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />ankhamin thau uh hi. Amate in ngitlona lam ah ciangtan nei ngawl uh hi. Amate in tangate ii a nga tu a kilawmte pia ngawl, ahibuale a kinengcip te tungah thukhaikimna lak ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Tua ahikom, keima Topa in, hi thute hangin amate daan ka pia tu hi; hi minam tungah phu ka la tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A lauhuai le thin patauhuai thu khat ngam sungah piang zo hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />kamsaangte in leilot thu bek son uh hi; thiampite in kamsaangte thupiakna bangin uk uh a, ka mite in nalh ngawl uh hi. Ahihang a tawpna hun a thet ciang amate in bang law tu uh ziam,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Benjamin mite awng, na kihuuk natu uh in tai vun! Jerusalem khua panin kisuatak tavun! Tekoa khua ah lemle tum vun a, Beth Haccherem khua ah kiheaksakna mei thut vun. Tuasiatna le suksiatna sia saksang pan hong pai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zion khuapi et hoi hi, ahihang kisusia tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />kumpite in a ngalkap honte uh taw tua munah ngiaphual saat tu uh hi. Amate in khuapi kiimkot ah a puanbukte uh sa in, a uuk na tek po ah ngiak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in, “Jerusalem sim tu in kithoai vun! Kinging vun! Sunkim laitakin ih sim tu hi!” ci tu uh hi. Ahihang amate ma in, “Hai lei zo hing, ni tum dektak zo a, nitak limhte sau zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zan ciangin ih sim tu a; khuapi dalna kulhte ih susia tu hi,” ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in Jerusalem uumci natu in thing kungte phukin leivumte a vawt natu in hi kumpite thupia hi. Ama in, “Keima in hi khuapi daan ka pia tu hi, banghang ziam cile hi khuapi sia kizawthawkna taw kidim hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuikhuk in a tui a thiansak tawntung bangin, Jerusalem khua in a siatna thaksua tan hi. Khua sungah ngoltolna le suksiatna thu ka za a; ci natna le liamnate vive ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem mite awng, hi ngimnate sia na kidop natu uh hi tahen, tua ahibuale no kong nusia tu hi; na khuapi sia kuama ii ten ngawlna mun sennealngam ka suaksak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in keima tungah, “Israel sia sapitnga a kilo siat sa sapithuan khat bangin kithiangsak tu hi. Tua ahikom hun om lai in mihing na suatak thei theampo suatak hamtang in,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima in, “Amate tungah kidop natu thu ka son hial zong akua in hong ngai nuam thong tu ziam? Amate a thinpui a, na thupuak ngai nuam ngawl uh hi; son tu a, nong sawlte amate nuiza bek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate ii tungah na thin uukna sia keima sung zongh ah meisa bang hi a, Topa awng, ka thuak zo nawn bua hi,” ci in ka zo hi. Tuaciang Topa in, keima tungah, “Ka thin uuk nate lampi ah om patangte tung le tangvalte kikhopna munah buak in. A pasalte le a zite kila tu a, a huai mama te ngawngawn zongh kikhe ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A innte sia midangte kipia tu a, a lote le a zite uh sia tuabang ma in midangte kipia tu hi. Hi ngammite daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A kuama po, a lian a no in a thumaan ngawlin sum zon tu hanciam uh hi; kamsaangte le thiampite ngawngawn zongh in mite theam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka mite ii liamna mate sia a vuntham bak bang bekin amate in ngaisun uh hi. Pha siat ngawl napi, ‘Pha siat hi,’ ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi a kiihuai nate a vawt uh hu in amate a maizum ziam? Hi ngawl hi, maizum dek ngawl a; maizum natu zia zongh he ngawl uh hi. Tua ahiciang midangte ii puk bangma in amate puk tu uh hi; amate daan ka piak ciang, amate bona hi tu hi. Keima Topa in ka son zo hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in a mite tungah, “Lamkaa bom ah dingin khuadak vun. Taangh lampite le a phabel lam sia koisung ziam ci in dongh vun. Tuasia tawn vun, tua hile thinnuamin na om tu uh hi,” ci hi. Ahihang amate in, “Hi ngawl hi, ko tawn ngawl tu khu hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaciang kidop natu lemle aw ngai tu in Topa in ngalvilte koi hi. Ahihang amate in, “Ngai ngawl tu khu hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahikom Topa in, “No minamte awng, ngai vun, ka mite tungah bang thu piang tu ci sia he vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leitung awng, ngai in! Amate in ka thuhil na nial a, ka kammalte mang ngawl ahikom, hi mite ii sawm nate theampo taw kiphu in daan piakna ahi siatna ka tungsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate ii kei atu Sheba ngam panin ngimnamtui hong puak sia, ahibuale ngam khuala pan hel namtui hong puakte bangma ka awlmawk bua hi. Amate ii hong piakte ka saang buatu hi, ahibuale a biakpiaknate taw lungkim ngawl tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahikom hi mite lutu in ka puksak tu hi. Nu le pate le a tate a thi uh bangma in innpaamte le lawm le ngualte thi tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in, “Saksang ngam khat panin mite hong pai hi; a khuala na pan a thahat ngam khat sia ngal sim tu in kithawthoai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate in a thal le a namsaute toai zo a; ngilo in ngual hesuakna thin nei ngawl uh hi. Amate in a siphu tung tek a to uh ciang, tuipi hawk bangin nging hi. Amate in Jerusalem sim tu in a kinging sa in om uh hi.” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jerusalem khua mite in, “Tua thute ih za zo hi, tuaciang ih khutte zaw hi; thinngimna in hong lencip in nau tun numei khat bangin na ih sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ngamsung teng ah ih pai ngam bua a lampi tung zongh ah ih vak ngam bua hi, banghang ziam cile ih ngalte in hiamh toai a, ih kiim ih paam theampo lauhuai siat hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa in a mite tungah, “Khuangai in, Khau-ip puan silhin vut sungah kilumliik vun. Tapa khat a nei sun sia in a thi san hu in thitui luang in kap vun, banghang ziam cile no hong susia tu hong pai pa in thakhat thu in hong sim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jeremiah awng, leisung sumpiang na sit tu bangin, ka mihingte sit in a, amate bang taw kibang ziam cisia telthiang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate a vekpi in a thinpui, ngaltho nuamte hi a, a thin uh sia taau le thik bangin sak uh hi. Amate sia a ngamtat sia siat uh a, vak kawkoai in heltuana laklaw thu poai kawkoai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pummei sia nasia takin kuang ahihang thik eak sia tuitham ngawl hi. Ka mite a thiantho natu sit suak lai tu sia luithawthong hi, banghang ziam cile a tatsia mite a kila keak bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amate sia a mannung ngawl thik eak kici tu hi, banghang ziam cile keima, Topa in amate ka nial zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in kei sia Judah mite ii biakpiakna nei tu in a tumna Biakinnpi kongpi ah hong puak hi. Ama in tua munah ding ta'n a, Israel te ii Pathian, Vaanglianbelpa Topa ii amate tungah a son nop hi thute taangko tan: “Na nuntak zia uh le na ngamtatnate uh kikheal vun, tua hile hi munah kong teang suaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />‘Ei ngammuang zo hing! Hisia Topa ii Biakinnpi ahi hi, hisia Topa ii Biakinnpi ahi hi, hisia Topa ii Biakinnpi ahi hi!’ a ci tua theamna kammalte um nawn heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Na nuntakzia uh kheal vun a, na sep na vawt uhte tawlnga vun. Khat le khat a pha in kivawt vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Noma phattuam natu in ngamdangmite, tangate le meingongte zothaw nawn heak vun. Hi ngam sungah a mawbaang ngawl mite that nawn heak vun. Pathian dangte bia nawn heak vun, banghang ziam cile tua in noma hong lalsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na kikheal uh le, na taanghpupite tungah a nei top tu ka piaksa hi ngam sungah kong teang suaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“En vun, leilot thute um nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Note in nguta, ngual that, palngul mawna vawtin, leilot thu taw kiciam nu hi, Baal tungah biak piaknate pia a, nidang a na heak ngeingawl uh pathiante na bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi ka huasaakte na vawt uh a, tua zawkciang ka Biakinnpi sungah pai in, keima mai ah na ding uh a, ‘Ei ngammuang zo hing!’ na ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka Biakinnpi sia misuamte, inn phuulte bukna in ngaisun nu ziam? Keima in na vawt uhte kong mu zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keima nong biak natu mun a, ka teal maksak phit ahi Shiloh ah pai tavun a, Israel ka mite ii mawna khialnate hu in tua khua tungah ka vawtte en tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi mawna khialnate theampo na vawt siat zo uh a, kong papau kong hihil hangin nong ngai bua uh hi. Kong sam ciang nong zo nuam bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahikom, Shiloh tungah ka vawt bangin note ii muan, hi keima ii Biakinnpi tungah ka vawt tu hi. Na taanghpupite uh le noma kong piaksa hi mun tungah Shiloh tungah ka vawt bang keak ma in ka vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na mealheakte uh ahi, Israel mite ka nawkeak bangma in kong mu thei ngawlna munah note kong notkeak tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in, “Jeremiah awng, hi mihingte atu in thungetsak heak in. Amate taangin kap heak in a, thungen heak in; kei tungah hesuakna hong ngen heak in, banghang ziam cile nong thuumna hong ngai ngawl tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in Judah ngam khuapite sung le Jerusalem khua lampite ah bang teng vawt ci sia mu ngawl ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Patangte in thing tomin, pasalte in meithut a, numeite in Vantung Kumpi nu a ci uh numeipathian atu in moh beang, moh em in om uh hi. Ka thin nat natu in, amate in pathian dangte tungah biakpiakna in sapittui buak si uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahihang amate ii thin a natsak sia, keima tatak ka hi ziam? Hi ngawl hi, amate le amate kivawtin a na hi a, maizum kipia ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahikom Vaanglianpipa Topa keima in, hi Biakinnpi tungah ka thin uuk mama na sia ka buak tu hi. Mihingte le nganhingte, tuaciang thingkungte le ankungte tung ngawngawn zongh ah a kibangin ka thin uuk tu hi. Ka thin uukna sia kuama sukmit thei ngawl meikuang bang hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Ka mite awng, biakpiakna pawlkhat sia biaknatau tungah haltumin, pawlkhat sia ne thei nu hi. Ahihang Topa keima in, a vekpi ma zong ne thei nu hi kong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Egypt ngam panin na taanghpupite ka laak lai in meihal biakpiakna le a dang tuatuam biakpiakna taw kisai thupiakna ka nei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahihang keima in amate ii Pathian ka hi natu le amate sia keima ii mite ahi natu in ka thu a nit natu thu ka piak ma ahi hi. Tuaciang ka thupiak bangin a nuntak thei natu in amate tungah ka son hi, tua hile amate a maivang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahihang amate in ka thu ni ngawl, nadon ngawl uh hi. A thinpuina le a thin ngitlo nate ii sawl bangin seam zaw ahikom, amate phazaw ngawlin sia vaial zaw uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na taanghpupite Egypt ngam pan a pusua ni pan kipan tuni ciang dong ka naseam kamsaangte kong puak tan viuveu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahihang kuama in thu ngai ngawl, nadon ngawl uh hi. Na taanghpupite uh sangin na thin uh pui zaw in langpan kan zaw nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Tua ahikom, Jeremiah awng, ka mite tungah hi thute theampo son tu ni hi, ahihang amate in hong ngai ngawl tu uh hi; amate na sam tu a, ahihang hong zo ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate Topa Pathian, keima ii thu hong ni ngawl minam hi a, kihil in daan a kipiak hang tel thei tuan ngawl uh hi ci in amate tungah son in. Thumaanna bo a, son zongh in kinei nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Jerusalem mite awng, kap vun; Na sam uh at tan vun a, vawk vun. Mual dawnah mithi vuina lasa vun, banghang ziam cile keima Topa ka thin uuk a, ka mite ka nial zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Judah mite in thusia khat vawt zo uh hi. Amate in ka huasaak a milimte ka Biakinnpi sungah koi in ka Biakinnpi ninsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A tapate le a tanute mei hal biakpiakna in a nei thei natu in Hinnom Kuam sungah Topheth kici, biaknatau khat amate in sa uh hi. Hi sia vawt tu in amate thu ka pia bua hi — tuasia ngaisut zong ka nei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ahikom, tua mun sia Topheth ahibuale Hinnom Kuam a kici nawn ngawl tu hun hong theng tu a, Kithalupna Kuam kici zaw tu hi. Mithi phum natu mundang om ngawl tu ahikom amate in tua munah mithi phum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mithi luangte sia vacimte le ngamsate ii an suak tu a, tuate a beng tu kuama om ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ngam sia sennealngam suak tu hi. Judah ngam khuapite sung le Jerusalem khua lampite tungah thinnopna le lungdamna awte le mopoai lungdamna awte ka bosak tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tua hun ciang Judah ngam kumpite le uliante, thiampite, kamsaangte le a dang Jerusalem ah a teang mihingte ii a ngute sia a thaan sung pan kila keak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ngute khawmtua a, kiphumsak tu ci thada, lei ah eak vawk bangin pheang om tu hi. Tuate sia a it le a na a sepsak, thu a dok le a biak uh ahi ni, tha le aksite mai ah kipheangpha tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi a ngilo minam sung pan a nungta lai sun, ka thethaangna munah a teang teng in a nuntak tu sangin thi nuam zaw tu uh hi. Kei Vaanglianbelpa Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in ama ii mihingte tungah hi bangin son tu in kei hong sawl hi, “Mihing khat a pu ciang, tho kik hi ngawl ziam? Mihing khat lam a khial ciang, heak kik hi ngawl ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahile, ka mite awng, banghang kei kung pan puapial in hong heak kik nawn ngawl nu ziam? Na milimte uh ma len lingleng in hong heak kik nuam ngawl nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pha tak ma in ka ngai hi, ahihang thumaan na son bua uh hi. Na seksolna uh hu in khat zongh na khuangai bua uh hi; ‘Bang khialna vawt ka na khi ziam’ ci in khat zongh in na dongh bua uh hi. Siphu khat ngal sim tu a nawtai bangin, a kuama theampo a uuk bang po ngamta tan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Stork vacimliante ngawngawn in a heak kik tu hun he uh hi; vakhute, pialpiate le vaphitte in mun dangah a tai tu hun he uh hi. Ahihang ka mite awng, no kong ukna thukhamte na he bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Note in ko ka ciim uh a, na thukhamte ka he uh hi, bangbangin ci thei tu nu ziam? En vun, thumaan ngawl thukham hilte in thukhamte kheal uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na mipilte uh mai zumin om hi; amate lungmangin a ci a law he ngawl uh hi. Amate in ka kammalte nial zo hi; tu in amate in bang pilna nei uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahikom a lote sia ngual lo nei thak te ka pia tu a, a zite sia pasal dangte ka pia tu hi. A lian a no a vekpi in thumaan ngawlin sum vawt sawm uh hi. Kamsaangte le thiampite ngawngawn ngualtheam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka mite ii liammate sia a vuntham bak bang bek, amate in sua uh hi. Pha siat ngawl napi amate in ‘Pha siat hi!’ ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka mite awng, hi a kiihuai nate na vawt uh manin na mai uh a zum ziam? Hi ngawl hi, na mai uh zum vet ngawl hi; maizum natu zia zongh na he bua uh hi! Tua ahikom midangte puk bangma in na puk tu uh hi; daan kong piak ciang na bona uh hi tu hi. Keima Topa in ka son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Anlapa in a lo an a kaikhop bangma in, keima in ka mite ka kaikhawm nuam hi; ahihang amate sia a nga nga ngawl sapitkung khat bang, a nga nga ngawl theikung khat bang ahi hi; a teete ngawngawn vul zo hi. Tua ahikom, hi ngam a la tu in a puasang mite thu ka pia zo hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian ii mite in “Banghangin to lalai hi ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi. Hong pai tavun, a muanhuai khuapite ah tai in tua munah ih thi tu hi. Ih Topa Pathian in ei sia a thi tu in hong see zo hi; ama in ih neak tu nguu hong pia zo hi, banghang ziam cile eima in ama tungah ih maw zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kilemna le ciidamna hun khat ih lamen hi, ahihang bangma kimanna om ngawl a; launa hong theng zaw pumsai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dan khuapi sungah ih ngalte hong theng zo uh hi; a siphute ii a naak thin uh ih za hi. A siphute a haam uh ciang ngam buppi liing hi. Ih ngam le ih ngamsung a, a om na theampo, ih khuapi le khua mite theampo susia tu in ih ngalte hong pai zo uh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in, “Kidawm vun! No sungah a nguu nei, a kizual thei ngawl ngulte kong tha tu a, amate in no hong tu tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka khuangaina kidamsak thei ngawl hi; ka thin na mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai vun! Ngamsung mun theampo ah ka mite ii kaana aw ka za hi, “Zion khua ah Topa om nawn ngawl ziam? Zion ii kumpipa tua munah om nawn ngawl ziam?” ci in kap uh hi. Amate ii kumpipa ahi, Topa in zo kik a, “Banghangin na milimte na biakna le a man nei ngawl na ngamdang pathiante na paaina uh taw in kei hong thin uuksak nu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mihingte in, “Khuakhaal hun bo zo in, an kila siat zo a, ahihang ei hong kingum ngawl lai hi,” ci in kap uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka mite thuakna hangin ka thin na hi; hee in ka kap hi; ka thinkiam dikdek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gilead ah zatui om ngawl ziam? tua munah syavuan te om ngawl ziam? Tua ahile banghangin, ka mite kidamsak ngawl thong ziam?
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka lu sia tuikhuk hi hen a, ka mitte thitui ii naak khat hi le uuk ing, tua hi thong le a kithatlum ka mite atu in a sun a zanin ka kap zo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka mite taisan thei in sennealngam sungah om natu mun khat nei leng ka uuk hi. Amate sia a thu maan ngawl vive, ngual a leeheak honkhat hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate sia leilot thu son tu in kinging tawntung uh hi; thumaanna taw sangin thumaan ngawlna taw ngam uk zaw uh hi. Topa in, “Ka mite in thusia khat zawkciang khat vawtin kei sia a Pathian bang zongh in hong sim bua uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kuama po in a lawmpa tungtaang a kikep kul tu hi, kuama in a suapuipa muang thei ngawl hi; banghang ziam cile suapui theampo sia Jacob bangin ngualtheam thei a, a kuama po in a lawmte sonsia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate theampo in a lawmte lampui khial uh a, kuama in thumaan son ngawl hi; amate in a leeite uh leilot thuson hil uh a mawna khialna a vawt uh sia thasua peuma ngawl tu hi. Amate in ngoltol ngamtatna khat zawkciang khat vawt uh a; theamna taw a ngamtatnate khat zawk khat kizom hi. A mite in ama nial hi Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom Vaanglianbelpa Topa in, “Ka mite leisung sumpiang bangin ka thiangsak tu a, ka sittel tu hi. Ka mite in a sia vawt zo a — amate bang law tuan thei tu khi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate ii leeite sia thi theina thaltangte bang ahi hi; leilot thu veu son uh hi. mi simin a innpaamte tungah kamthiam pau hi, ahihang thaang siana kam hi nginge hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi thute hu in amate daan pia ngawl tu khi ziam? Hi bang minam khat tungah phula ngawl tu khi ziam? Keima Topa in ka son hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima in, “Mualte atu in khuangai a mau in, ngamsung lohingna munte atu in ka kap tu hi. Banghang ziam cile tua munte kongaw a, kuama khualhawin kaantan ngawl hi, ngannote haamna aw kiza nawn ngawl hi; vacimte le ngamsate tai siat zo hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in, “Jerusalem khua sia na a sia te kholna le, ngiate teenna mun ka suaksak tu hi; Judah ngam khuapite sia kuama ii teen ngawlna sennealngam suak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keima in, “ Topa awng, hi ngam sia kuama khualhaw ngawl natu in banghangin kisia cip a sennealngam bangin kongaw ziam? Akua in hi bang thute a tel thei tu za in ciim tu ziam? Midangte tungah sonsawn thei tu in akua tungah na thiang son zo ziam?” ci in ka dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in, “Ka mite in ka piak hilcianna taisan ahikom hi thu piang hi. Amate in ka thu hong mang ngawl, ka ci bangin ngamta ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua kawmkaal ah, a thin uh pui in a taanghpupite ii hil bangin Baal milimte bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom, Vaanglianbelpa Topa Israel ii Pathian, keima ii vawt tu sia ngai in: Ka mite neak tu in a khaa thingno kungte ka pia tu a, a dawn tu in nguu tui ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate ahizong a taanghpupite ahizong ii a zaak ngeingawl minamte sungah amate ka thethaang tu a, amate ka siatcipsak siat matengin a do tu in ngalkap honte ka puak tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in, “Bang piang ziam ngaisun vun! A kapte hong pai natu in sam vun, mithi vuina late a sa numeite sam vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi honpi in, “Ih mittangte thitui taw a kidim mateng le, ih mitkhute kaana taw a kawt mateng amate hong manlang in, mithi vui la ei hong sak natu son vun,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zion khua sung a kaana aw ngai vun; “Ih lalcip hi! Hong kimaimawl cipsak hi! Ih ngam ih nusiat kul tu hi ih innte hong suksiatsak hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keima in, “ Topa thu ngai vun, no numeite awng, a kammalte nadon vun. Na tanute sia kaa tu dan hil vun a, na lawmte sia mithi vuina lasak zia hil vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thina sia ih khelkite tawnin hong pai a, ih kumpi inn sung hong tum hi; Thina in lampite ah patangte le sumbukte ah tangvalte vaatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mithi luangte sia, lo sungah eak vuum bang, anlate in taang at a, a nusiat bangin, kuama ii laak ngawl ankung bangin, mun theampo ah kithethaang kawkoai hi. Hi thu son tu a Topa ii kei hong sawl ahi hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in, “Miciimte in amate ii ciimna, mi thahatte in amate ii thahatna, mihaute in amate ii haunate kisakthei pui heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mihing khat pawpo in a kisathei nuam ahile, keima hong heakna le hong telna kisakthei pui tahen, banghang ziam cile ka itna in kipin kho a, thumaan le thutang ka seam hi. Hite sia ka thin hong nuamsakte ahi hi. Topa keima in ka ci zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa in, “A sam uh a tomin a meet Egypt, Judah, Edom, Ammon, Moab mite le sennealngam ah a teang mite daan ka piak tu hun hong theng tu hi. Hi mite theampo a vun uh ki at hi napi, vunteap ki atna taw kisai zui tu thuciamna zui ngawl uh hi. Hi mite le, Israel mite kuama in ka thuciamna zui ngawl uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mite awng, note atu in Topa ’ thupuak sia ngai vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “Minam dangte omzia zui heak vun; minam dangte in van ah a lamdang a kimute kiita in lau hikale note in na thin nawngkaisak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi mite ii biakna sia mannung ngawl hi. Duisung ah thingkung khat kiphuk a; tua sia thingngel thiampa in a hiamh zakte taw sui in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ngunn le khamh taw zeam hi. A puk ngawl natu in thikpim taw kilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua milimte sia tangmai lo sungah lohunnate taw kibang hi; tua milimte pau thei ngawl a; lampai thei ngawl ahikom puak kul hi. Tuate kiita heak vun: Na siat natu uh bangma vawt thei ngawl a, na phat natu bangma vawt thei ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa awng, nang taw a kibang kuama om ngawl hi; nang na thahat a, na min lian in vaang nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Minam theampo ii kumpipa ahi nang sia, akua in zakta ngawlin a om tu ziam? Nang sia zatakna piak tu in na kilawm hi. Minamte ii mipilte theampo sung pan hikale amate ii kumpite sung pan hikale nang taw a kibang kuama om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate theampo ngoai in mawmaw uh hi. Thing taw kivawt milimte kung pan amate in bang sin thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A milimte sia Spain ngam pan a piang ngunn taw, Uphaz ngam pan a piang khamh taw kituam a, limsuai thiamte ii vawt veu hi siat hi; tuate sia thiamtak thiamte ii a taa puan sandupciik le puan sandupte kisilhsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahihang Topa , nangma in Pathian tatak na hi a, a nungta Pathian le tawntung kumpipa na hi hi. Na thin uuk ciangin leitung liing a; minamte in na thin uukna thuak zo ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />(Lei le van a vawt ngawl pathiante sia kisiacipsak tu hi ci in no mihingte in amate son tu nu hi. Amate sia leitung koima ma ah om nawn ngawl tu hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in a vaangletna taw leitung vawt a; a ciimna taw leitung bitphua in vantungte zalh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama ii thupiakna taw in van ii tungsia ah a om tuite hawk hi; ama in leimong panin meeite hong paipui hi. Ama in nguatui sungah khualeng sakin a vanh kholna sung panin vuivasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hi thu a mu uh ciang, mihingte mawmaw kisa in lung amh uh hi; tua milim a vawtte in a maan sia mu uh hi; banghang ziam cile amate vawt pathiante maan ngawl a, nuntakna nei ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuate sia mannung ngawlin kinomu tu hi; Amate thukhenin Topa hong pai ciang amate kisusia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jacob ii Pathian sia amate bang hi ngawl hi; ama in na theampo a vawt pa hi a, ama mi tatak tu in Israel mite teal zo hi. Ama min sia Vaanglianbelpa, Topa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jerusalem mite awng, note sia hong ki uumci hi! Na neisate uh kaikhawm vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in hi ngamsung pan note hong lawnthal tu hi; khat zongh kikhe ngawl dongin hong sucip tu hi. Topa in ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem mite in, “Nasia takin ih liam hi! ih liammate dam ngawl tu hi. Hite sia ih thuak zawk tu khat po hi vak ci in ih ngaisun hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ih puan bukte kisia zo a; a sawmna khaute tattan zo hi. Ih tate uh le tai siat zo a; ih puan bukte hong saksak kik tu kuama om nawn ngawl hi; A kongkha puante uh a khaisak tu kuama om ngawl hi,” ci in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keima in, “Ih lampuite mawmaw a; lamlak tu in Topa thu dongh ngawl hi. Tuasia hu in amate nguallelin, ih mite kithethaang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngai vun! Thu khat hong theng zo hi! Saksang ngam khat sungah buaina lian khat om hi; a ngalkaphon in Judah ngam khuapite sia ngiate teenna sennealngam suaksak tu hi,” ci in ka zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa awng, kuama in ama ii maisang nuntakna a zeak thei ngawl hunlam ka he hi; kuama in ama nuntakna uk ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa awng, na mite hong puua ta'n; ahihang a nasia lei in hong hi heak in, tua hibuale na thin uuk ciang daan hong pia heak in; tuabang nong hi le thi tu khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na thin uukna sia nang hong bia ngawl minamte tung le nang hong nial mite tungah tungsak in. Amate in na mite that a; ko hong susia cipin ko ngam a sia sa in nusia uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in kei tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Hi thuciamna thute ngai in. Judah mite le Jerusalem khua mite tungah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />hi thuciamna a zui ngawl mi sim ii tungah Israel te ii Topa Pathian keima in haamsiatna ka tunsak sia son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi thuciamna sia pummei lingh taw a kibang Egypt ngam pan amate ka paipui lai in, a taanghpupite taw ka vawt uh thuciamna ahi hi. Ka thu hong nit natu le ka thupiak theampo vawt tu in amate ka son hi. Ka thu hong ni uh le, amate sia ka mite hi tu uh a keima in amate ii Pathian ka hi tu hi ci in amate ka son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuabangin ahi uh le tu a amate ii neisa ngamhoi ngampha sia kong pia tu hi ci a, a taanghpupite tungah ka piak kamciam sia keima in ka taangtungsak tu hi,” hong ci hi. Keima in, “Hi hi, Topa awng,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in keima tungah, “Judah ngam khuapite le Jerusalem khua sung lampite ah va pai ta'n. Tua munah ka thu thangsak ta'n a, thuciamna thute ngai in, a zui natu mihonpite tungah son ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A taanghpupite Egypt ngam pan ka paipui lai in, ka thu hong nit natu in amate nasia takin ka hil a, tuni dong ma a kidop natu in ka hihil lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang amate in ka thu hong ngai ngawl, hong ni ngawl uh hi. A vekpi in a ngei ma ngei in a thin uh pui a, ngilo veve uh hi. Thuciamna a zui tu in thu ka pia zo hi, ahihang hong nial uh hi. Tua ahikom thuciamna sungah a om daan theampo amate tungah ka tungsak hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in kei tungah, “Judah mite le Jerusalem khua mite in kei hong thasawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in ka thu hong nial, a taanghpupite ii mawna khialna teng ma vawt kik uh hi; Amate in pathian dangte bia uh hi. Israel le Judah mite in a taanghpupite taw ka vawt khop thuciamna paltan zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahikom tu in, keima, Topa in amate tungah siatna ka tunsak tu le kuama a suatak ngawl natu in thu ka sonkhol hi. Amate kapin huna hong nget ciang zong ka ngai buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Judah mite le Jerusalem khua mite sia a piakkhiatna taw a biak a pathiante kungah pai tu a, huna ngenin kap tu uh hi. Ahihang tua pathiante in hi siatna hun a thet ciang amate hun ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Judah mite in a khuapi a nei zaza ma milim pathian tam mama nei uh a, Jerusalem khua ah a teang mite in khuapi sungah om lampite za ma in a kiihuai Baal pathian biaknatau tam mama vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jeremiah awng, hi mihingte taangin kei tungah thu hong ngen heak in a, hong pakaai heak in. Amate sia ngim nga in a hu tu in kei hong sap ciang amate ka ngai buatu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in, “Ka it mihingte in a sia vawt uh hi. Ka Biakinnpi sungah a om natu bang thu nei thei nawn tu ziam? Amate in kamciam piakna le sangaw biakpiakna taw in tuasiatna khaam thei tu in ki um uh ziam? Tuasia in amate lungdamsak tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khatvei lai in amate sia a nga pha nga thiam a, tee a hau olive kung khat taw ka sontee hi; ahihang tu in, keima in vanto bangin hawkin a teete mei taw halin a baakte ka thiaktan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Keima, Vaanglianbelpa Topa in Israel le Judah ka phut hi; ahihang tu in kong tuasiasak tu hi ci in ka tawng hi. Hi siatna sia amate tungah amate ma in a tungsak ahi hi, banghang ziam cile amate in khialna vawt uh hi; Baal tungah biakpiakna a piak hu in amate in kei hong thin uuksak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka ngalte ii kei hong thasawmna thu Topa in kei hong son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thalup tu a, a kipaipui a tote a muang tuuno khat bang ka hi a, amate ii a sia hong sawmnate ahi hunlam ka he bua hi. “Thingkung a nga thiam laitakin phuktan tawng; ama sia kuama ii a phaw nawn ngawl natu in thatlum tawng,” amate in ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaciang keima in thungen in, “Vaanglianbelpa Topa awng, nangma in thutang a khen thukhenmang khat na hi hi; mihingte ii ngaisutna le thinsung na sittel hi. Na khut sungah ka thu kong aap zo hi; tua ahikom hi mihingte tungah phu na laakna sia hong ensak ta'n,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anathoth mite in kei sia hong kithatlum le hong oai hi, tuaciang Topa ii thu na thangsak lai le kong thatlum tu hi hong ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Vaanglianbelpa, Topa in, “Amate daan ka pia tu hi! A tangvalte ngal sungah kithatlum tu a; a patangte sia ngilkialin pukthi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anathoth mite tungah tuasiatna ka tunsak tu hun ka khensat zo hi. Tuasia hun a thet ciang, kuama suakta ngawl tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“ Topa awng, nang taw ka thu ih kinial ciang, nang na maan zaw tu hi. Ahihang nang tungah thukhaikimna thu huvau kong dongh tu hi. Banghangin mi seksolte nuamsa ziam? Banghangin thu maan ngawl mite a tup uh taangtung ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangma in amate na suan a, amate in zung tha uh hi; amate khangto in a nga nga uh hi. Amate in a kam in nang hong phat son tawntung uh hi, ahihang a thinsung tatak uh taw nang hong thusim ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang, Topa awng, kei nong he a; ka nasepna le bang zata nang kong it zia na mu hi. Tuute ngaw tu a, a kikaikeak bangin hi mi ngilote kaikeak in; amate a kithalup tu hun dong keamcing in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ih ngam sia bang tanvei kongaw tu a, lo theampo sungah lopate bang tanvei kongaw tu ziam? Nganhingte le vacimte thi dektak uh hi, banghang ziam cile ih mite ii seksolna hang hi a, ih mite in ‘Pathian in ih sep ih vawtte hong mu ngawl hi’ a ci uh hang ahi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in, “Jeremiah awng, mihingte taw tai kidem a, toi na hi thong le, bangbangin siphu taw tai kidem thei thong tu ni ziam? leikolna ngam ah na dingto thei bua zen le, Jordan ngun hui duithuk sungah bangbangin vaihawm zo thong tu ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na suapuite le na innkuan puite ngawngawn in nang hong leeheak zo hi; amate sia nang hong dote taw kikop hi. Amate in kamthum taw hong paupui uh zong um heak in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in, “Israel ka nusia zo hi; ka tealsa minam ka nial zo hi. Ka it mihingte a ngalte khut sungah ka pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka tealsa mite in kei hong langpan uh hi; dui sungah a om tawpi khat bangin amate in kei hong hawksan zo hi, tua ahikom amate ka ensan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka tealsa mite sia muthite ii a kiimkot pan a tuk siasua vacim khat taw kibang hi. Poai siim tu in ngamsate sam vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hong uk ngamdangmi tam mama in ka sapithuan siasak uh hi, amate in ka lote tuanhcil zo uh hi; a dei huai ka leitang sennealngam suaksak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in ka ngam sia ngam tawngtol suaksak uh a; ka mu tangin ngamkhing mun suak hi. Ngam buppi sia sennealngam suaksak a, kuama in awlmawk ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sennealngam mun saang na theampo kaantan in hong sut tu in mihingte hong pai zo hi. Ngam buppi susia tu in ngal ka piangsak zo hi; kuama thinnuam thin muangin om thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka mite in zungtaang ciing uh a, ahihang lopa bek kaikhawm uh hi; amate nasep hanciam mama ahi uh hang bangma nga ngawl uh hi. Ka thin a uuk mama hu in a ankungte sia hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in, “Israel ka mite tungah ka piaksa ngam a siasak Israel ii ngam paamte thu taw kisai son tu thu pawlkhat ka nei hi. Keima in tua mi seksolte sia a kizunglok keak thingkung khat bangin amate ii ngam panin ka la keak tu a, amate khut sung pan Judah mite ka suatak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang amate ka laak zawkciang amate ka hesuak tu hi; a minam simin amate ii leitang tung le a ngam tek ah ka paipui kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in khatvei lai in ka mite Baal min taw kiciam tu in a hil bangma — amate in a thin theampo uh taw ka mite ii biakna saang thei tu a, ‘ Topa a nuntak bangma in’ ci in a kiciam uh le — amate zongh keima mi ma hi tu a, a ma vangin nuamsa tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahihang minam khat pawpo in thu a mang bua ahile, tua minam sia ka zunglok tu a ka lalsak tu hi. Keima Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in va pai ta'n a, puanneal ngoaipuan tom pawlkhat lei in, teang paih ta'n; ahizong tuidia heak in hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahikom tua ngoaipuan tomte lei in ka teang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in kei hong paupui leleau a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Euphrates ngun ah pai in, suanghawng khat sungah tua ngoaipuan tomte phual in,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahikom ka pai a Euphrates ngun hui ah tua ngoaipuan tomte ka phual hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khuangei dingdeng zawkciangin Topa in Euphrates ngun ah pai kik ta'n a, ngoaipuan tomte va la ta'n hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hong sawl bangin ka pai kik a, ka phualna mun ka thet ciang puante sia zo a, pha nawn ngawlin ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in kei hong paupui leleau hi. Ama in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Judah ii kiphatsak na le Jerusalem ii kiphatsakna lian mama sia hi bangin ka siasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi mi ngilote in ka thu hong ni nuam bua uh hi. Amate sia a ngei bangma in a thin uh pui in seksol uh a, pathian dangte bia in a na seam uh hi. Tua ahikom, amate sia a kizangh thei nawn ngawl, hi ngoaipuan tomte bang suak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngoaipuan tomte in kawng ah a belh cinten bangma in Israel le Judah mite theampo in keima hong bel cinten tu ka dei hi. Hi bang a ka vawtna in amate sia ka mi a sua thei natu, hong pok thei in ka min a pataak thei natu ka deina ahi hi; ahihang amate in ka thu hong ni ngawl uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa Pathian in keima tungah, “Jeremiah awng, sapit thambeal theampo sapittui kidimh tu hi, ci in Israel mite son in. Sapit thambeal theampo sapittui a kidip tu sia he khu hi ci in amate in hong zo tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaciang keima Topa in hi ngam sungah a om mihingte theampo: David ii suan le paal kumpite, thiampite, kamsaangte le Jerusalem khua mite theampo sapittui a kham dong ka piak tu sia amate son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciang a huai a khang a kibangin thambealte khat le khat kitaih in a kisukthap bangin amate ka susia tu hi. Khuangaihuai sakna, ciliapna ahibuale hesuakna te in amate ka thalup tu hong khaam zo ngawl tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel mite awng, Topa in son zo hi! Na thin uh neamsakin a thu ngai vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in khua a zinsak ma mualte tungah na lutu uh ma in; na lam et uh khuavak sia khuazing bikbek a suasak ma in, Topa na Pathian uh patoai vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka thu nong ngai bua uh le na kiphatsak na uh hangin ka kap ku tu a; thitui luangin nasia takin ka kap tu hi, banghang ziam cile Topa ii mite sia ngalmatte bangin kipaipui zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in kei tungah, “Kumpipa le a nu sia a kumpi tokhumte tung panin a tuaksuk natu in son in, banghang ziam cile amate ii a hoi mama a kumpi lukhute a lu tung uh panin taaksuk zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judah ngam thangsang khuapite sia ngalte in uumci zo a; a sungah kuama tum thei ngawl hi. Judah mite theampo a saltanna munah kipaipui siat zo hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jerusalem awng, en in! Na ngalte uh sia saksang pan hong paisuk uh hi! Nangma ii kep tu a hong kipia mihingte, na kiphatsak pui ahi na mite koisungah om ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na lawm na ngual a na ngaisut mihingte kekeak in nangma hong zo in hong uk ciang bang na ci tu ziam? Nausuak tu numei khat taw kibangin nasa in na om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Banghangin, hi thute theampo na tungah hong piang ziam — banghangin na puante hong kileamkeak sakin, hong kibuan a, hong kikhialpui ziam ci in na dongh le — na mawna a nasiat lei lawlawm hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mihing civom pa khat in a civom sia theak thei tu ziam, pawlbeam khat in a pawlna vawk thei tu ziam? A theak thei uh ahile siatna simngawl vawt dang a nei ngawl no zongh in a pha vawt tu sin thei tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sennealngam pan a hong va vui in taangphaw a muutkeak bangin Topa in note hong thethaang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tusia note ii thuak tu ma ahi hi, ama in ci hi. Hisia sia noma taw kisai in ama ii a vawt tu a, a khensat sa hi, banghang ziam cile noma in ama na mangil zo uh a, pathian maan ngawlte na muang zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa ama mama in noma puante hong hawkeaksak tu a, a maizum tu in hong pholaak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama ii huasaak nate na vawt uh sia ama in mu zo hi. Pa khat in a innpaampa ii zi a khialpui nop bang, ahibuale siphu tal lan khat ii anu khat a zuzui bangin doai biakna mualtung ah hikale, lo sungah hikale pathian dangte na zot uh sia ama in hong mu zo hi. Jerusalem mite awng, a lal hi nu hi! Bang hun ciangin thiangtho ngei tu nu ziam?
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nguatui hanna taw kisai in Topa in kei tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Judah kap in om a; a khuapite bo dedek hi, a mite khuangai in lei ah bok uh a, Jerusalem in huna ngenin au hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sumhau mite in a naseamte tui toai tu in sawl a; amate tuikhukte ah a pai uh le, tui om ngawlin a bealhawm nguak taw heak kik uh hi. Thinkiam lungmangin, amate in a mai uh seal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nguazu ngawl ahikom leiko ngawp a, lothote lungmang mama in, a mai uh seal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A neak tu lopa om ngawl ahikom ngam sungah sangaipui in a no suaktuung sia nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngam laate in mualte dawn ah dingin ngam uite bangin husamh in hu diik vahut uh hi; a neak tu lopa om ngawl ahikom a mitte khuamu thei ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka mite in kei hong oksan in, ‘Ka mawnate uh in ko maw hong suan ahitazong, Topa awng, nong kamciamsa bangma in kote hong hu ta'n. Kote in nang kung pan tamvei ma ka puapial zo uh a; nang tungah kong maw zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangma bekma Israel ii lametna na hi a; nangma bekma in kote tuasiat natu pan hong ngum pa na hi hi. Banghangin ka ngamsung uh ah khualmi khat bangin na om a, zan khat bek a taam khualhaw pa bangin om ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Banghangin muanmawk khol ngawl patauna nei mihing khat bangin, kuama a hu zo ngawl ngalkap khat bangin om ni ziam? Topa awng, a tatakin, nang in ko taw nong omkhawm hi! Kote in na mite ka hi uh hi; hong nusia heak in’ a ci uh hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi mihingte taw kisai in Topa in, “Amate in kei kung pan tai nuam uh a, tuaciang amate le amate ki uk zo ngawl tu hi. Tua ahikom amate tungah ka lungkim ngawl hi. Khialna a vawt nate ka ciamtee tu a, a mawnate hu in amate daan ka pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in kei tungah, “Hi mihingte hu tu in kei tungah huna hong ngen heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate an a tang hial zonghin hu ngenin a auna aw ka ngai buatu hi; meihal biakpiakna le antang taw biakpiakna te hong piak uh hang zong, amate ii tungah ka lungkim ngawl tu hi. Amate sia ngal sungah ahizong kialpi tunna le natna taw ahizong ka thatlum zawsap tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaciang keima in, “Vaanglianpipa Topa awng, kamsaangte ii hi ngam ah ngal kidona ahibuale kialpi tunna om ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile nangma in ih ngam sungah kilemna bek om tu in hong kamciam ci in mipite tungah a son sia na he hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang Topa in, “Tua kamsaangte sia keima min suangin leilot thu son uh hi; amate ka sawl bua a, amate tungah thupiak ka nei bua hi, amate kam khat beak zongh ka paupui bua hi. Amate ii a son mukholna sia kei kung pan hi ngawl hi; mailam thu piang tu a sonkhol thute sia amate ngaisut tawm, kimanna a nei ngawl thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima, Topa in ka sawl ngawl bulin ka min suangin hi ngam ah ngal kidona le kial tung ngawl tu hi ci a, a son kamsaangte tungah bang law tu khi ziam ci sia no tungah kong son hi — ngal kidona le kialpi taw amate ka thatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate ii hi thute a sonna mihingte, hi bangma in kithatlum tu hi. A luangte sia Jerusalem khua lampi tungah kilawn thal tu a, a phum tu kuama om ngawl tu hi. Hi thu sia amate a vekpi — a zite, a tapate le a tanute theampo tung zongh ah tung tu hi. Amate ii seksolna thaman amate in ka thuaksak tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in ka khuangaina thute mipite tungah hi bangin son tu in kei hong sawl hi: “Sun zong zan zong ka thitui luang tahen, tawp hun nei ngawlin kap ka tong, banghang ziam cile ka mite nasia tatakin kiliamsak a, na sa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lote sungah ka pai ciangin, ngal kisimna a, a kithat mithi luangte ka mu hi; khuate sungah ka pai ciangin a pukthi mite ka mu hi. Kamsaangte le thiampite in amate ii nasep tek seam uh ahihang, amate in bang seam ci zongh he meal ngawl uh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa awng, Judah te nialcip zo ni ziam? Zion mite ngaimaw ni ziam? Banghangin a dam zo nawn ngawl tuza dongin ko hong liamsak ni ziam? Thinnopna ka zong uh hi, ahihang phatna bangma hong piang bua hi, ciidam tu ka lamen uh hi, ahihang launa bek hong tung zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa awng, nang tungah kong maw zo uh hi; koma ii mawnate le ka taanghpupite ii mawnate kong pualaak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nong kamciamnate phawk in a, kote hong ngaimaw heak in; na minthanna tokhum omna mun Jerusalem mindaisak heak in. Ko taw na vawt thuciamna sia paltan heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Minamte ii milimte in nguazusak thei ngawl hi; van in ama ii thu taw nguazusak thei ngawl hi. Topa kote Pathian awng, hite a vawt pa nangma na hikom nang sungah lametna kong nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in kei tungah, “Moses le Samuel ngawngawn hi munah dingin ka tungah hesuak hong ngen hial zongh in, hi mihingte tungah hesuakna ka nei tuan buatu hi. Amate paisak vun; ka muna ah omsak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Koi sungah pai tu khu ziam ci in amate in nang hong dongh uh le, hi bang ka ci teng son in: Pawlkhat sia natna taw thi tu in kisee a — tua mun sia amate pai natu mun ahi hi! A dangte sia ngal sungah thi tu in kisee a — tua mun sia amate pai natu mun ahi hi! Pawlkhat sia pukthi in thi tu in kisee a — tua mun sia amate pai natu mun ahi hi! A dangte sia thongtaakte bangin a kipaipui tu in kisee a — tua mun sia amate pai natu mun ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima, Topa in, a lauhuai thu nam li amate tungah tung tu in ka khensat zo hi: Ngal sungah amate kithatlum tu hi; a luangte ui in kaikeak a; vacimte in ne tu hi, tuaciang a om laiteng ngamsate in ne tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hezekiah ii tapa Manasseh in Judah ngam ah kumpi a sep laitakin Jerusalem khua ah a vawt thute huu in tuate taw leitung mite theampo ka liinglawngsak tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in, “Jerusalem mite awng, akua in no hong hesuak tu ziam, akua in no hong khuangai pui tu ziam? Na om zia uh hong dongh tu in akua in hong ngak man tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />No, mihingte in kei nong nial zo uh a; nong nungngat zo uh hi, ka thin uukna ka iip na in toi zo ka hikom ka khut zalh in kong susia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngamsung khua sim ah taangphaw bangin vui sungah note kong lawn hi. Ka mite awng, note kong susia hi, Na ngitlo ngamtatnate uh na kheal ngawl uh hu in na tate uh ka thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuipi hui ah sennealte sangin note ngam sungah meingong tamzaw hi. Na tangvalte uh a khan saan laitakin ka that a, a nute in ka thuaksak hi. Thakhat thu in amate tungah thin natna le launa ka thengsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A tate sali ii a thi sanh a nu sia butthi in a husamh hi, ama ii sun khuavak sia khuazing suak a, ama sia maimawl in a thinna sa hi. No sung pan a nungta laiteng na ngalte in kong thatlumsak tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A lungdam ngawl pa sia keima ka hi hi! Banghangin ka nu in leitung ah kei hong hing ziam? Ngam sungah mihing theampo taw kihau in thu kinial tu ka hi thong hi. Sum ka pukthaak bua a sum ka pu bua hi; tua hi napi ngual theampo in kei hong haamsiat veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa awng, nangma ii na pha takin ka seam bua le, ka ngalte ngim nga a natna satna a thuak laitakin amate taangin nangma tungah hesuakna ka ngetsak buale amate ii hong haamsiatnate theampo taangtung tahen. (
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kuama in thik, a tuan in saksang pan hong pai taau taw kihel thik sia thiaktan zo ngawl hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in keima tungah, “Ngamsung theampo ah mawna khialna a vawt hu in amate daan pia tu in ka mite ii nei le lamh sum le vanh manphate a laaksak tu ngalte ka puak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A thu a la a heak ngeingawlna ngam ah a ngalte ii na ka seamsak tu hi, banghang ziam cile ka thin uukna sia mei taw kibangin a tawntungin kuang tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuasia ciang keima in, “ Topa awng, tel ni hi. Hong phawkin hong hu ta'n. Kei hong vawtsiate tungah phu hong lasak ta'n. Amate ii kei hong thalup nop sia a taangtut natu in, amate tungah na thin sausak lei heak in. Nangma hangin kei hong kiselno ahi sia phawk in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangma in nong paupui a na kammal theampo kong ngai hi. Topa , Vaanglianbelpa, Pathian awng, keima in nangma aa ka hi a, tua ahikom na kammalte in ka thin hong nuamsak a hong lungdamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keima in midangte taw nui khawmin ngualnop hun ka zangh bua hi. Nong thupiak ka nitna in keima nguakin ka om a, thin uukna taw ka kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Banghang ngim thuathuak lai khi ziam? Banghangin ka liammate kibawl thei ngawl ziam? Banghangin dam ngawl tu ziam? Khuakhaal sung luitui kang bangin thin kiamsak tu hong sawm ni ziam?” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hi thu taw kisai in Topa in, “Nong heak kik ahile kong la kik tu a, ka naseampa na suak kik tu hi. Thu mannung ngawl po na son sangin thu manpha thu taknei na son le, ka kamsaang na suak kik tu hi. Mipite sia nang kung hong zuan kik tu a, amate kungah nang na pai kul ngawlzaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hi mite taw na kizopna ah taau ciitak taw a kivawt khua uumna dal taw kong kibang sak tu hi. Amate in nang hong sim uh hangin hong zo buatu hi. Nang hong dal tu le hong keamcing tu in nang taw kong omkhawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi seksolte le mi ngoltolte ii khut sung panin nang kong suatak tu hi. Keima, Topa in kong son hi,” ci in hong zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in hi bangin kei hong paupui leleau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Hi bang munah zi zongh ta zongh nei heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi munah a piang tate tung le a nu a pate ii tungah bang thupiang tu cisia na tungah kong son tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate a lauhuai natnate taw in thi tu uh hi, kuama in amate kaa ngawl tu, phum ngawl tu hi. Amate ii luangte lei ah eaklei bangin kithu tu hi. Amate sia ngal sungah kithat tu a, ahibuale ngilkial pukthi in thi tu hi, a luangte sia vacimte le ngamsate ii an hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Mithi kikaana inn sungah tum heak in. Kuama khuangai pui heak in. Ka mite sia thinnopna thupha ka pia nawn buatu a, itna le hesuakna ka lak nawn buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi ngam ah a hau le a zawngte thi tu uh a, kuama in amate phum ngawlin, kaa ngawl tu hi. A khuangaina a lak natu in kuama in ama le ama nam taw ki at ngawl tu a, a sam uh meet ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A it khat a thi ciang heenepna in, kuama in ama tui le an neak pui ngawl tu hi. A pa ahibuale a nu a thite ngawngawn kuama in khuangai pui ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Anneakpoai vawtna inn sungah tum heak in. Anne tuidawn tu in amate taw tokhawm heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa Israel te ii Pathian keima ii ka son tu thute ngai in. Ngualnopna awte, lungdamna le mopoai ngualnopna awte ka thimsak tu hi. Hi lai ah a om mihingte, hi thupiang sia mu tu in nungta tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Hi thu teng amate tungah na son ciang, amate in, banghangin keima in daan nasia mama piak tu in khensat khi ziam ci sia nangma hong dongh tu hi. A khialna lian sia a bang hi a, Topa, a Pathian tungah bang mawna khialna vawt ziam ci sia amate kidongh tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Topa ii hi bangin a ci sia amate tungah va son ta'n hong ci hi, ‘Na taanghpupite in kei kung pan puapial a ngamdang pathiante bia in a na seam uh hi. Amate in kei hong nusia a ka hil thute ni ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihang no sia na taanghpupite uh sangin a sia zaw vawt nu hi. Na vekpi in a thinpui le a ngilote na hi uh hi, ka thu nong ni bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahikom hi ngam panin noma le na taanghpupite ii heak ngeingawlna ngam ah kong notkeak tu hi. Tuasia ciang tua munah a sun a zanin pathian dangte ii na na seam tu uh a, keima in no kong hesuak buatu hi.’ ”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in, “Egypt ngam pan Israel mite a paipui, a nungta Pathian ka hina bangin keima min taw mihingte a kiciam nawn ngawl hun hong theng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in, saksang ngam pan le amate ka thethaangna ngamdang theampo panin Israel mite hong paipui, a nungta Pathian, keima min taw kiciam zaw tu uh hi. A taanghpupite tungah ka piaksa amate ngam ah ka ciasak kik tu hi. Keima Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in, “Ngasa mante tam mama hong pai natu in ka vaitha tu a, hi mite ka mansak tu hi. Tua zawkciang savaite tam mama ka vaitha tu a, muallian mualno tung theampo le suangkawm suanghawngte sungah amate ka vaisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate vawt theampo ka mu hi. Ka mai ah a kiseal bangma om ngawl hi; amate ii mawna khialnate ka mu ngawl, bangma om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate ii mawna khialna le seksol nate hu in a zaa nii ka liausak tu hi, banghang ziam cile mithi luangte bang a nuntakna a nei ngawl milimte taw amate in ka ngam ninsak uh a, amate ii a maan ngawl pathiante ka ngamsung kidimsak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa awng, nangma in kei hong dal a thahatna hong pia pa na hi hi; ka ngim nga laitakin nong hu hi. Leimong panin minamte nang kungah hong pai tu uh a, “Ka taanghpupite in pathian maan ngawlte le kimanna a nei ngawl milimte simngawl bangma dang nei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mihingte in aituam pathiante vawt thei tu ziam? Vawt thei ngawl tu hi, a vawt a ahile, tuate in pathian tatak hi ngawl tu hi,” hong ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in, “Tua ahile, tawntung atu in khatvei ka vaangletna le ka thahatna sia minamte in ka hesak tu hi; amate in Topa ka hi sia he tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in, “Judah mite awng, na mawna uh sia thik laikung taw ki at hi; tuasia na lungtang tungah diamond dawn taw kikhen a, na biaknatau kingte tungah kikhuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na mite sia numeipathian Asherah atu in ngamsung thingkung hing theampo ii kung, mualno dawnte
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />le mual liante tungah, a kiphut limte biaknataute ah bia uh hi. Na ngamsung theampo ah na vawt uh mawna khialnate theampo hu in na nei na lamh le na sum na paaite na ngalte in kong sutsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kong piaksa ngam na taan tu uh a, na heak ngeingawl uh ngam khat ah na ngalte ii na kong seamsak tu hi, banghang ziam cile ka thin uukna sia mei bang hi a, a tawntungin kuang tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in, “Kei kung pan a puapialte le mihing a muang, a thithei mihing ii thahatna a suangte sia ka puavawk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate sia sennealngam ah a po bangma dang a po ngawl kongaw ngam, lei alna ah a khang, sawlpaangte bang ahi hi. Amate tungah thupha bangma piang ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ahihang kei hong muangte ahile thupha ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate sia luihui ah a po luitui sungah zung a tha thingkungte bang ahi hi. A teete hing tan ahikom khuakhaal nisat hun hong thet ciang phamaw sa tuan ngawl hi; ngua a zu bua hial zonghin amate in thinngim tuan ngawl hi; a nga nga tan hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Akua in mihingte thinsung tel thei ziam? tuabangza a ngualtheam thei dang bangma om ngawl hi; a natna sia nasia leih ahikom dam thiang zo ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima, Topa in, mihingte ngaisutna ka kan a, a thinsung uh ka sittel hi. Ama nuntakzia le a sepzia taw kizui in khat sim tungah ka vawt hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thu maan ngawl a sum nga pa sia ama ii tuui ngawlbul tuui dang a op vacim khat taw kibang hi. A khan tungto laitak ma in a haunate taan tu a, ama sia a tawpna ah bangma ahi ngawl a mawmaw khat suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ih Biakinnpi sia a kipatciil pan ma in mualsaang khat tungah a ding a minthang kumpi tokhum khat taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa awng, nangma in Israel mite ii lam et pa na hi a; nang hong nusia mihingte theampo a mai uh kizumsak tu hi. Amate sia leivui sungah min ki at te bangin bomang tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile amate in ciktui thiangtho ahi Topa nangma, hong nusiat hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa awng, hong damsak ta'n, tua hile ka dam thiang tu hi; hong suatak ta'n, tua hile ka ngammuang tatak tu hi; kong pok pa sia nangma bek na hi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mite in kei tungah, “ Topa ii ei hong tawnnate koi sungah om ziam? Tu in tuate hong tungsak tahen!” hong ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang, Topa awng, amate tungah tuasiatna na thetsak tu kong sawl ngei bua a; amate ii ngim a thuak tu ka deisak bua hi. Topa awng, nangma in hi thu na he hi; ka sonsa sia na he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang sia ka launa hong hi heak in; ngimna hong thet ciang ka ngammuanna mun na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei hong vawtsiate a maimawlsak in a, ahizong Topa awng, kei hong pengsak ta'n. Amate launa taw kidimsak in, ahihang kei hong lausak heak in. Amate tungah tuasiatna tungsak in a amate a bebekin susia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in kei tungah, “Jeremiah awng, va pai ta'n a Judah ngam kumpite ii khuapi sung tumna le pusuana, Mipite ii Kongpi ah ka thu taangko ta'n; tuaciang Jerusalem kongpi dangte theampo ah va pai ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kumpite le Judah mite theampo, tuaciang Jerusalem khua sungah a teangte theampo le hi kongpite pan a tumte theampo in ka thuson a ngai natu in son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A nuntakna uh a it le Sabbath ni in vanh pua heak hen ci in amate tungah son in; Jerusalem kongpite kaantan in bangma tumpui peuma heak hen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ahibuale Sabbath ni in a inn uh pan bangma pusua pui heak hen. Sabbath ni in amate naseam ngawl het tu hi; a taanghpupite thu ka piak bangin ni thiangtho khat in tang nanak tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A taanghpupite in ka thu hong ngai ngawl, hong nadon ngawl hi. Amate a thin pui a; ka thu hong ni zaw ngawlin ka hilnate saang nuam ngawl pumsai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka thu piak theampo a zui nanak natu in hi mite tungah son in. Amate in Sabbath ni in hi khuapi kongpite kaantan in bangma tumpui ngawl het tu hi. Amate in Sabbath sia ni thiangtho khat in tang tu a, na bangma seam ngawl het tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaciang a kumpite le a kumpi tapate in Jerusalem kongpite ah tum tu uh hi, tuaciang David ii nei kumpi vaangletna nei tu uh hi. Judah mite le Jerusalem mite taw amate siphu leang tung le siphu tungah tokhawm tu uh a, Jerusalem khuapi sia mihing dim tawntung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mihingte sia Judah khuate le Jerusalem ii a kiim a paam khuanote panin hong pai tu uh hi; amate sia Benjamin ngamsung pan, mualpeangte pan, mualte pan le Judah ngam thangsang panin hong pai tu uh hi. Amate in ka Biakinnpi ah meihal biakpiaknate, sangaw biakpiaknate, antang le paaknamtui taw biakpiaknate le lungdamko biakpiaknate zongh hong paipui tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahihang amate in ka thu hong nit kul tu a Sabbath sia ni thiangtho khat in a tan uh kul tu hi. Tua ni in amate Jerusalem kongpite kaantan in vanh bangma pua ngawl het tu uh hi. A pua uh ahile Jerusalem kongpite mei taw ka hal tu hi. Mei in Jerusalem khua kumpi innte kaanghtum tu a, kuama in phel zo ngawl tu uh hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in kei tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Beal seakpa ii inn ah haw in a, tua munah thu kong son tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahikom tua munah ka pai a, beal seakpa sia bealseakna muipei sia taw naseam in om ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Beal a seak ciang a tungman a pha tak bua ahile tua tungman sia nadang khat in vawt kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in kei tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Beal seakpa in tungman taw a dei babang a vawt bangma Israel mihing note tungah ka dei babang vawt theina thu nei hi ngawl khi ziam? Beal seakpa khut sungah a om tungman bangin note in ka khut sungah na om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hun khat pawpo ciang minam khat ahibuale kumpi ukna ngam khat sia a zung pan longh tu khi hi, thiaktan tu khi hi, ahibuale susia tu khi hi ci ka hi ta zong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tua minam in ngitlona panin a kikheal kik a ahile vawt tu ka ci sa sia ka vawt buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahitazong, minam khat ahibuale ngam khat ka phut tu, ka sa tu hi ka ci zawkciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tua minam in ka thu hong ni bua a, a sia a vawt veve le tua minam tungah phatna ka vawt tu ka ci sate ka vawt nawn buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahikom tu in, Judah mite le Jerusalem mite kungah amate siatsak tu tupna nei a daan pia tu in a kinging sa in ka om sia son in. Mawna khialna vawtin a nuntaknate a kheal natu — a omziate le a nasepte a lai natu in amate tungah son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in, ‘Hi ngawl hi, banghang khealin laih tu khu ziam? Koma uuk bangin mihing a thinpui le a ngilo ma hi tu khu hi,’ ci in zo tu uh hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in, “Nidang in tuabang thu a piang ngei zo ziam, minam theampo tungah dongh vun. Israel mite in a cizathuai na khat vawt zo uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lebanon suangmual saangte vuuk in tuam ngawlin om ngei ziam? Mualtung pan hong luang a vot luite kang ngei ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang ka mite in kei hong mangil zo uh a; milimte kungah ngimnamtui hal uh hi. A tot natu lampi ah lutu zo a, lamluite zui nawn ngawl hi; a kisial ngawl lamzinte tawn uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in hi ngam sia a tawntung a kinomu tu in a lipkhaphuai ngam suaksak uh hi. Tua mun a kaantan mihingte theampo in tua ngam a mu uh ciang a thin patau tu uh a, lamdang sa in a lu pei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keima in ka mite sia a ngalte mai ah, nisuana sang vui ii leivui a seamkeak bangin ka thethaang tu hi. Amate ka nungngat tu a; tuasiatna hong thet ciang ka hu buatu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaciang mite in, “Jeremiah taw kisai in na pawlkhat seam sin tawng! Hong hil tu in thiampite, ngaisutna hong pia tu in miciimte le Pathian ii thupuak a thangsak tu in kamsaangte om tawntung tu hi. Ama tungah thu ih vawt tu a, ama thuson peuma ih ngai buatu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaciang hi bangin thu ka ngen a, “ Topa awng, ka sawsonte hong ngai ta'n a kei thu taw kisai in ka ngalte ii sonnate ngai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A pha sia, a sia taw lo kik tu ahi ziam? Tua hi napi amate in ka taaksuk natu in leidum khat to zo uh hi. Na kungah kong pai a, na thin uukna taw amate na vawtsiat ngawl natu in amate luangin kong son sia phawk in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahihang tu in Topa awng, a tate ngilkial in pukthisak in; amate ngal sungah thalup thuaksak in. Nupite a pasalte le a tate in thi sansak in; pasalte sia natna taw thisak in, tangvalte ngal kisimna ah thalup thuaksak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hil khol ngawlin a ngilo nuam honkhat amate inn phuul tu in paisak in; amate lau in ausak in. Amate in ka taak natu in dum khat to uh a, hong mat natu in thaang hong sia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahihang Topa awng, amate ii kei hong thasawmnate theampo na he hi. Amate ii ngitlona ahibuale a mawna maisak heak in. Na thin uuk laitak ma in amate nguallelcipsak in” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in thambeal khat lei tu in va pai ta'n hong ci hi. Ama in ulian pawlkhat le thiampi sung pan a uhaam zawhiat pawlkhat paipui in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuaciang Bealtamh Kongpi kaantan in Hinnom Kuam ah va pai ta'n, hong ci si hi. Tua munah hong son tu thupuak a thangsak tu ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in hi bangin son tu in kei hong sawl a, “Judah kumpite le Jerusalem khua mite awng, keima, Vaanglianbelpa Topa Israel mite ii Pathian, ii kong son tu thu na ngai vun. Hi munah tuabang tuasiatna khat ka thengsak tu a tua thu a za theampo ingh keikoi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi bangin ka vawt tu hi, banghang ziam cile mihingte in kei hong nusia zo uh a, hi mun sia pathian dangte biakpiakna taw in ninsak zo uh hi — tua pathiante sia amate, a taanghpupite, Judah kumpite ii a thu a heak ngeingawl pathiante ahi uh hi. Amate in hi mun sia a mawbaang ngawl mihingte ii chi taw kidimsak uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuaciang amate in biakpiakna in a tate sia mei sungah halin Baal a biak natu in biaknatau vawt zo uh hi; hisia a vawt natu thu ka pia ngei bua hi; ka thinsung zongh ah ka ngaisun tha ngei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom hi mun sia Topheth ahibuale Hinnom Kuam a kici nawn ngawl tu hun hong theng tu hi. Tua mun sia Kithalupna Kuam kici zaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hi munah Judah le Jerusalem mite ii ngealnate theampo ka khak tu hi. A ngalte in ka zosak tu a ngal kidona ah ka thatlumsak tu hi. A luangte sia vacimte le ngamsate ii an tu in ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi khuapi tungah tuabang a lauhuai mama siatna ka tungsak tu a, tua khua a kaantan pawpo ingh liangin lamdang sa mama tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngalte in khuapi kiim uum tu a, a mite thalup tu hanciam tu uh hi. Ngalte uumcina in lauhuai leilam ahikom khuapi sung sangah a om mihingte sia khat le khat a sa uh kine a, a tate ii sa ngawngawn ne tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaciang keima taw a paikhawm mihingte mai san ah thambeal saattham tu in Topa in keima hong sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaciang Vaanglianbelpa Topa in, “Hi mihingte le hi khuapi ka susia tu a, a kipua kik thei nawn ngawl a tamhtham hi thambeal taw kibang tu hi. Mithi phum natu mun dang om nawn ngawl ahikom mite in a thite sia Topheth ngawngawn ah phum tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keima in hi khuapi le khuapi sungah a teangte Topheth taw kibangin ka vawt tu sia kong kamciam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem khua a innte, Judah kumpite ii innte, a tatakin ci leang inn theampo ii khuvumte tung pan aksite atu ngimnamtui hal biakna a kipiakna innte le pathian dangte tungah biakpiakna sapittui a kibuakna munte — tua teng theampo Topheth bangza ma in a nin suak siat tu uh hi,” a ci sia amate tungah son tu in keima hong sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in ama thupuak thangsak tu a hong sawlna mun Topheth ka nusia hi. Biakinnpi huang sungah pai in, ka ding a, mi theampo tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa, Israel ii Pathian in, “Ka tungsak tu hi ka ci sa daan theampo sia hi khuapi le a naina khua theampo tungah ka tungsak tu hi, banghang ziam cile no na thinpui in kong son thu na ngai buatu uh hi,” a ci sia ka son hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi thute ka thansak sia Biakinnpi ukpa Immer ii tapa thiampi Pashhur in a zaak ciang ama in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />kei hong kisaat natu le thikkol hong bulin Biakinnpi sung Benjamin Kongpi tungnung hui ah hong koi natu thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A zingsang ciang, Pashhur in kol hong suut zawkciang, keima in ama tungah, “ Topa in nang sia Pashhur ci in min hong phua ngawl hi, ‘Mun theampo ah Launa’ ci in min hong sam zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa mama in ‘Nang sia nangma le nangma a kilausak tu le na lawmte a lausak tu in kong vawt tu a, a ngalte ii namsau taw na lawmte a thalup siat na mu tu hi. Keima in Judah mihingte theampo Babylon kumpipa khutnuai ka then siat tu hi; pawlkhat a ngam ah thongtaak tu in ciapui tu a, a dangte thatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi khuapi ii hauna theampo, a nei a lamh le a vanh theampo, Judah kumpite ii sum le vanh manphate dongin a ngalte in ka suttolsak tu a, a khawng a kheakin Babylon ah ka paipuisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pashhur awng, nang na hile, nangma le na innkuanpuite theampo zongh hong kiman tu a, Babylon ah hong kipaipui tu hi. Tua munah na thi tu a, na theam zazaan bul na lawmte taw hong kiphum khawm tu hi,’ ci hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa awng, nangma in kei nong theam a, keima theam ka thuak hi. Nangma in kei sangin na hat zaw a, kei nong zo zo hi. Mihing theampo in kei hong nunau uh a; sunkhuateakin amate in kei hong selno uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thu ka son simin, ka au keak kul a, “Ngoltolna! Kisuksiatna!” ci in ka au hi. Topa awng, nangma thupuak ka thansak hu in a tawntungin simmawk vawtna le zawnsakna ka thuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang, “ Topa ka mangil tu a ama min suangin thu ka son nawn buatu hi,” ka ci ciangin, na thupuak sia mei bangin ka sung tawngh ah kuang hi. Ka hi thei za iip tu ka hanciam hangin, ka iip zo nawn bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihing theampo kihuau a, “Mun theampo ah launa om hi! Tua ahikom thu neite tungah ama khia tawng!” a ci ka za hi. Ka itbel ka lawmte ngawngawn zongh in ka puk tu bek ngak uh hi. “Kitheam zo tha tu hi; tuasia ciang ih man thei tu a, phu ih lam tu hi,” amate in ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang Topa awng, nangma in keima sangah nong pang a, na thahat in na vaanglian hi, Kei hong vawtsiate sia ngallel tu uh hi. Amate a min kipaansak tawntung tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile amate taangtun zo ngawl hi. Amate ii minpaanna sia kimangil ngeingawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihang, Vaanglianbelpa, Topa awng, mihingte sia a maan takin na sittel a; amate ii thinsung le a ngaisutna na he hi. Tua ahikom ka ngalte tungah phu na laakna hong musak ta'n, banghang ziam cile na khut sungah ka vai teng kong aap zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa tungah lasa vun! Topa pok vun! Ama in mi ngilote khut sung panin a kizothaw te suatak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka sua ni haamsiat in! Ka nu sung pan ka sua ni mangil in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tu a sia pano hi! Tapa khat nei ni hi!” ci a ka pa kungah kamtai a, ka pa a lungdamsak pa haamsiat in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama sia Topa in hesuak ngawlin, a suksiat tua khuapite bang hi tahen. Ama in zingsang in bot a sate ii kaana aw le sun in ngal patauna aw za tahen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />banghang ziam cile ama in ka pian ma in hong thatlum ngawl hi. Hong thatlum hi thong le ka nu ngilsung sia ka thaan hi zo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Banghangin piang khi ziam? Ngimna le heena khuangaina bek thuakin maizumna taw ka nuntakna bosak tu in a piang khi ziam?
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah kumpi Zedekiah in Malchiah ii tapa Pashhur le Maaseiah ii tapa thiampi Zephaniah te ka kungah hong puak a, hi bangin hesuak hong ngensak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nong hesuakna taw ko atu in Topa hong paupuisak ta'n, banghang ziam cile Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar le a ngalkaphonpi in khuapi uumci hi. Topa in ama ii nalamdang laknate khat ko atu in hong vawt tahen a, Nebuchadnezzar nungkin kik natu zawthawk thu zangh tahen,”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in kei hong paupui a, Zedekiah ii kei kungah hong sawl mihingte munah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa Israel ii Pathian in hi bangin a ci teng Zedekiah tungah son kik in ka sawl hi, “Zedekiah awng, Babylon kumpipa le a ngalkaphonpi a sim, na ngalkapte ka zo tu hi. Na ngalkapte ii ngalhiamte khuapi laizang ah ka seng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima in ka tha neina, ka thin uukna, ka thin vei laakna le ka thinsona theampo taw nang kong sim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi khuapi sungah a teang mihingte theampo ka thatlum tu hi; mihing le nganhing a kibangin natna ngilo taw thi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang, nangma, na khutnuai a uliante le ngalsung, kialpi le natna ngilo pan a, a suakta mite sia — no hong that nuam Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa le na ngalte in na vekpi in kong mansak tu hi. Nebuchadnezzar in no hong thatlum tu hi. Ama in note hesuakna le deisakna hong nei ngawl tu a khat zongh hong khoaikhe buatu hi. Keima Topa in ka ci zo hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in mihingte tungah hi bangin son tu in kei hong sawl hi, “Ngai vun! Keima, Topa in khat sasang na teal tu in nuntakna lampi le thina lampi kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khuapi sungah a om a kuama po sia ngalte thalup ahibuale pukthi in ahibuale natna taw thi tu hi. Ahihang tu laitakin khuapi hong sim Babylon mite kungah pai in a ki aap pawpo kithat ngawl tu hi; amate in a nuntakna beak suatak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi khuapi sia khe tuan ngawlin suksiat tu in ka thin ka khensat zo hi. Babylon kumpipa khut sungah kipia tu a, ama in mei taw haltum tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka ci zo hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in David ii suan le paal, Judah kumpi innkuan tungah hi thu son tu in kei hong sawl hi: “Keima, Topa ii ka son sia ngai vun. Ni simin thukhaikimna omsak vun. Ngualtheam a thuak pa sia a theam pa khut sung panin dal vun. Tuabangin na hi bua uh le, thusia na vawt sia in a kimit thei ngawl meikuang khat bangin ka thin uukna nasia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem awng, nang in leikuamte tungsia, zaangtam ii tung a saangna ah suang dokto khat bangin na to hi. Ahihang kei hong sim zo ngawl tu a, ka kidalna te hong sutham zo ngawl tu hi ci ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang na sepnate taw kizui in nang daan kong pia tu hi. Na kumpi inn mei taw ka hal tu a, a kiim a paam a om na theampo tua mei in kaanghtum tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka ci zo hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in David suan, Judah kumpipa inn ah va pai ta'n a, tua munah a kumpipa, a khutnuai a uliante le Jerusalem mite kungah Topa thusonte ngai tu in son ta'n, ci in kei hong sawl hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in, “Keima, Topa in thumaan le thutang na vawt vun ci in no thu kong pia hi. Theamna a thuak pa sia a theam pa ii khut sung panin dal vun. Ngamdangmite, tangate ahibuale meingongte vawtsia heak vun; hi a thiangtho munah a mawbaang ngawl mihingte that heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kong thupiak sa bangin na seam takpi uh le, David ii suan le paalte sia kumpi suak tawntung tu uh hi. Tuaciang amate sia, a khutnuai a uliante le a mite taw in, siphu ngalleang le siphu tungah to in hi kumpi inn kongpite pan kaantan tawntung tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang kong thu piakte nong ni bua uh le, hi kumpi inn sia siacip tu hi ci in ka kiciam hi. Keima, Topa in ka ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Kei atu in, Judah ii kumpi inn sia Gilead ngam le Lebanon Mualte bangin hoi hi; ahihang kuama ii ten ngawlna a ngamkhing mun kolh khat ka suaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua kumpi inn a susia tu in mihingte ka puak tu hi. Amate in a hei uh tek hong keng tu uh a, cedar thing khuam phate phukin meikhuk sung denna in nei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tua zawkciang ngamdangmite tam mama in kaantan tu uh a, tuaciang keima, Topa in banghangin hi khuapi lian tungah hi bangin vawt ziam ci in khat le khat kidongh tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuasia ciang na Pathian, keima taw na kiciamna uh nusia in pathian dangte bia in a na na sepsak uh hang hi, ci in amate in zo tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judah mite awng, Josiah kumpipa kaa heak vun; ama ii a thi hangin khuangai in kap heak vun. Ahihang a tapa Joahaz atu in nasia takin kap vun; ama sia hong heak kik nawn ngawl tu le a pianna ngam mu kik ngei nawn ngawl tu in amate in paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Judah kumpipa ahi a pa ii za a lai Josiah ii tapa Joahaz taw kisai in Topa in hi bangin ci hi, “Ama in hi mun panin pai zo a, hong heak kik nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama sia a paipuina ngam ah thi tu a, hi ngam mu kik ngei nawn ngawl tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thumaan ngawlna taw a inn a sa pa, a inn a peam pa; a ngammite a thawthong in a na seamsak a, a thaman a pia ngawl pa in siatna thuak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Inndawl tungnung ah a inndoi zaite taw inn khat keima ma in ka sa tu hi,” a ci pa sia siatna thuak ahi hi. Tua hi a, ama in a inn sungah khelkite thua a, a zepna in cedar thingpheak siikli neite belh thua in a san in zut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Midangte inn sangin a phazaw cedar thing taw innte na sak ciang in kumpi phazaw khat hong suaksak ziam? Na pa sia a khan zo in nuamsa hi. Ama sia a tawntung maan a pha hi, a sepna theampo ah a maapai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in mizawngte tungah a pha in thukhen a, tuaciang ama atu in na theampo a pha suak hi. Tuabang ahi theina in Topa a heak hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahihang nang sia nangma kaangsung tu bek na mu thei hi; a mawbaang ngawlte na thatlum a na mite nasia takin na zawthawk vawt hi. Topa in ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahikom, Topa in Judah kumpipa, Josiah ii tapa Jehoiakim thu taw kisai in hi bangin ci hi, “Ama thi hu in kuama khuangai ngawl tu hi, ahibuale ‘Bangza lauhuai ziam, ka lawm awng! Bangza lauhuai ziam!’ ci ngawl tu hi. ‘Ka topa! ka kumpipa awng!’ ci in kuama thitui taakin kap ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Laa khat a thi ciang a kiphum bangin ama luang kikaikeak in Jerusalem ii kongpite pua sangah kivawk tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jerusalem mihingte awng, Lebanon ngam ah pai vun a au vun, Bashan ngam ah pai vun a kap vun; Moab mualtung panin au vun banghang ziam cile na pawlpuite theampo kizo siat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na nopsak uh laitakin Topa in no hong paupui hi, ahihang na ngai bua uh hi. Na nuntak uh sung theampo tuabang vive hi nu hi; Topa thu na ni ngei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na lampuite uh sia vui in seamkeak tu a, na pawlpuite uh sia ngalmat thongtaakte suak in, na khuapi sia a min kidaisak in kimaizumsak tu hi, banghang ziam cile a sia teng na vawt uh hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lebanon pan a na laak uh cedar thingtaam sungah thin muangin om nu hi; ahihang numei khat nau a tut ciangin na a sak bangin natna ngimna na thuak uh ciang bangzata in hesuakhuai tu nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa in Judah kumpi Jehoiakim ii tapa Jehoiachin kumpipa tungah, “A nungta Pathian ka hi bangma in, nang sia ka ziatsang khut tungah min tupna khutzungbu na hi hial zongh in, kong suut keak tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />na kiitak mihingte le nang hong thatlum nuam mihingte tungah kong aap tu hi. Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar le a ngalkapte tungah kong aap tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Saltaang tu in nangma le na nu kong not tu hi. Na pianna uh ahi ngawlna ngam ah na pai tu uh a, tua munah na thi khawm tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hi ngam sia na mu kik nuam tu uh hi, ahihang na heak kik ngei nawn buatu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Keima in, “Jehoiachin kumpipa sia kuama ii a dei ngawl, a kivawksa thambeal tamh khat bang suak zo ziam? Tua hu in ama le a tate sia amate heak ngeingawlna ngam ah saltaang tu in kipaipui ahi ziam?” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aw ka ngam, ka ngam, ka ngam ka lei awng! Topa sonna sia ngai vun:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Hisia pa sia ma a tun ngeingawl tu le, a tate a khuaisua tu in a kiningkhiin sa hi. Ama in David ii za laihte bangin, Judah ngam a uk tu in suan le paal nei ngawl tu hi. Keima Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ama mite suksiatsak a, a thethaangsak ngam uk uliante tungah Topa ii thukhenna in bangza in lauhuai tu ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama mihingte keamcing tu a, a kingaisun ngamukte taw kisai in Topa, Israel ii Pathian in hi bangin ci hi: “Ka mihingte nong kepcingsak bua uh hi; na thethaang zo a na hawlkeak uh hi. A sia na vawt uh hu in tu in daan kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka mihingte a taanglai teng ka thethaang na ngamte panin ka kaikhawm tu a, a ngam ah ka ciasak kik tu hi. Amate in ta tam mama nei in pung mama tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate a khoi a keam tu in ngamukte ka koi tu hi. Ka mihingte sia lau nawn ngawl patau nawn ngawl tu a, daan ka pia kik buatu hi. Keima, Topa in ka ci zo hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in, “David suan a thumaan khat kumpi tu in ka teal tu hun hong theng tu hi. Tua kumpipa in ciimna taw ngam uk tu a thumaan thutang sia seam in a ngam buppi uk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama kumpi a sua ciang, Judah mite ngam muang tu a, Israel mite kilemna taw thinnuamin om tu uh hi. Ama sia ‘ Topa, Eite Ngupna’ “Jehovah Tsidkenu” kici tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in, “Egypt ngam pan Israel mihingte a pusua pui a nungta Pathian, keima min taw mihingte ii a kiciam nawn ngawl hun hong theng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in saksang ngam pan le amate ka thethaangna ngamdang theampo panin Israel mite a pusua pui, a nungta Pathian, keima min taw kiciam zaw tu uh hi. Tua zawkciang amate sia a ngamsung ma ah teang tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka thin kitamhtham in ka liing hi. Topa hang le ama ii kammal thiangthote hangin, sapittui tam ne leih in a kham pa khat taw ka kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ngam sia Topa tungah a thumaan ngawl mihingte taw kidim hi; amate sia a seksol nuntakna taw nungta in a vaang neina uh zangh khial uh hi. Topa ii haamsiatna hangin hi ngam sia khuangai in om a, ngamsung lonote kongaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in, “Kamsaangte le thiampite Pathian sel uh a; ka Biakinnpi sung mama ah a tatsiat laitak ka man zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate ii tot lampite sia naalin khuazing tu hi; amate ka lutusak tu a, ka puksak tu hi. Amate ii tungah tuasiatna ka thengsak tu a; amate ii daan thuak tu hun hong theng tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Samaria kamsaangte ii mawna ka mu zo hi: amate in Baal min suangin thuhil uh a ka mite lam pialpui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang Jerusalem khua a kamsaangte in a sia zaw lai a vawt ka mu hi: amate in nupa kipalngul in leilot thu son uh hi; mihingte ii ngitlo ngamtatna pan a kheal ngawl natu in mihingte khial natu panpui uh hi. keima muna ah amate sia Sodom le Gomorrah mite bangma in sia siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tua ahikom, Jerusalem khua a kamsaangte taw kisai in, keima, Vaanglianbelpa Topa in hi bangin ka ci hi: A neak tu in a khaa thingno kungte ka pia tu a a dawn tu in nguu ka pia tu hi, banghang ziam cile amate in Pathianzia bang ahi ngawlna thu sia ngam buppi ah zelsak uh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in Jerusalem mite tungah, “Kamsaangte ii thusonte ngai heak vun; amate in a maan ngawl lam etnate hong dimh uh hi. Amate in keima ii ci ahi ngawl, amate ii ngaisut tawmte no tungah hong son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka ci bang hong ngai nuam ngawl mihingte tungah na theampo amate atu in pha tu zam ci tan lai uh hi. Amate in mihing thinpui khat sim tungah tua siatna in ama thutha ngeingawl tu hi ci in son uh hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keima in, “Hi kamsaangte kuama in Topa ii ngaisutna thuku te he ngeingawl uh hi. Amate kuama in Topa ii thupuak sia za ngeingawl, tel ngeingawl ahibuale a ci sia ngai ngeingawlin nadon ngeingawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama ii thin uukna sia vuipi nguapi bangin mi seksolte ii lu tungah puaktham tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />ama ii tupna teng a vekpi a vawt siat mateng in a thin uukna thai ngawl tu hi. Mailam sangah a mite in hi thu telthiang tu uh hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in, “Hi kamsaangte ka puak bua hi, ahihang amate pai veve uh hi. A son tu thu ka piak ngawl ahihang ka min suangin thuson veve uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate in ka ngaisutna thuku te he hi thong ka pole ka thupuak sia ka mite tungah thangsak zo tu uh a, nuntakna siate le a seksol ngamtatna te nusiasak siat zo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Keima in mun khat bek ah a om hi ngawlin mun theampo ah a om Pathian ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka mu thei ngawl tu in a buu thei tu kuama om ngawl hi. Vantung leitung mun theampo ah ka om hunlam he ngawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate mang sungah ka thupuakte hong pia zo hi ci a keima min suangin leilot thu a son kamsaangte ii thusonte ka he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua kamsaangte in amate phuatawm leilot thute taw ka mite bang tanvei lam khialsak tu uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A taanghpupite in kei hong mangil a Baal kung a zot bang keakin, ka mite tung a son, a mangmatte in kei hong mangilsak tu hi ci in um uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua mangman kamsaang pa in hi thu sia mang bekma hi ci tahen a, ahihang ka thupuak a za kamsaang pa in ka thupuak sia maan takin thangsak tahen. Taangphaw le zungtaang tang teengat tu pha ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Keima thupuak sia mei taw kibang a, suangtum a bebekin a sutham thei sek taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khat le khat a kammal uh kila a, keima ii thupuak hi ci a, a thangsak kamsaangte ka langpan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Keima kung pan hong pai hi ci a, amate ii aituam kammalte a son kamsaangte zongh ka langpan si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Keima, Topa ii ka ci sia ngai vun! Leilot thu nguaktang ahi amate ii mangte a son kamsaangte ka langpan hi. Amate in hi mangte sonin a leilotnate le a kisaktheina uh taw in ka mite lam khialpui uh hi. Amate ka paisak bua a, thu zongh ka pia bua hi, mihingte atu in amate kimanna nei vet ngawl hi. Keima Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Topa in keima tungah, “Jeremiah awng, ka mite khat ahibuale, kamsaang khat ahibuale thiampi khat in ‘ Topa ii thupuak sia bang ziam’ ci in nang hong dok ciang, nangma in ama tungah ‘Nangma in Topa atu in vanhngit khat na hi a, ama in nang hong heam tu hi,’ na ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka mite khat ahibuale kamsaang khat ahibuale thiampi khat in, ‘ Topa ii Vanhngit’ ci kammal a zangh zezen ahile ama le a inn kuanpuite daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuasia luangin, khat simin a lawmte le a mealheakte tungah ‘ Topa in bangbangin hong zo ziam? Topa in bang ci ziam?’ dongh zaw tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate in ‘ Topa ii Vanhngit’ ci kammalte zangh nawn ngawl tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile khat pawpo in a zangh ahile, ka thupuak sia ama atu in vanhngit takpi khat ka suaksak tu hi. Mihingte in amate ii Pathian, a nungta Pathian, Vaanglianbelpa Topa ii kammalte lumlet uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jeremiah awng, kamsaangte tungah ‘ Topa in zona bang hong nei ziam? Topa in bang ci ziam?’ dongh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Amate in ka thupiak sia a ni bua uh a, ‘ Topa ii Vanhngit’ ci kammal a zangh uh le tuasia ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />keima in amate ahizong, amate le a taanghpupite tungah ka piaksa khuapi sia ahizong ka la takpi tu a, ka omna panin a khuala na ah ka vawkkhop tu sia amate tungah son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Bangma hunin a kimangil ngeingawl tu a tawntung maizumna le min paanna amate tungah ka tungsak tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Biakinnpi mai ah a kikoi theinga bawm nii kei hong lak hi. (Hi thu sia Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in Jerusalem khua panin Jehoiakim ii tapa Judah kumpipa Jehoiachin sia thongtaak khatin Judah lampuite, khutthiamte le naseam thiamte theampo taw Babylon khua ah a paipui zawkciang thupiang ahi hi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawm a masa sia sungah a om theingate sia a min pal theinga phate hi a; a dang bawm sia ii sungah a om theingate sia neak tu zong a pha ngawlte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Topa in keima tungah, “Jeremiah awng, bang na mu ziam?” hong ci hi, “Theinga ka mu hi. A phate sia pha mama a, a siate ahile sia leilam ahikom neak thei tu hi ngawl hi,” ci in ka zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in keima tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Keima, Topa Israel mite ii Pathian in Babylon ah a kipaipui mihingte sia hi theinga phate taw kibang a, ka phat vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate ka en tu a, hi ngam ah ka ciapui kik tu hi. Amate ka laamto tu a, ka khiasuk buatu hi; amate ka suan tu a, ka botkeak buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima Topa ka hi hunlam heak nopna thin ka pia tu hi. Tuasia ciang amate sia ka mite hi tu a, keima in a Pathian ka hi tu hi, banghang ziam cile amate in a thin theampo taw ka kung hong zuan kik tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Judah kumpipa Zedekiah atu ahile, a vaihawm pui uliante le hi ngam sungah a om suak Jerusalem khua mi a taanglai teng ahibuale Egypt ngam ah a taite — a vekpi in neak tu in a sia leilam hi thei ngate bangin keima Topa in ka vawt siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate tungah tuabang tuasiatna ka thengsak tu a, leitung minamte theampo patau tu uh hi. Mite in amate sia ciammuina lelin nei a, nunau selno in, amate ka thethaangna mun theampo ah a min uh sia kihaamsiatna in zangh tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate le a taanghpupite tungah ka piaksa ngam sungah amate khat zongh a taang nawn ngawl dongin ngal kidona, kialpi tunna le natna ngilo ka tungsak tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah ii tapa Jehoiakim sia Judah kumpi a sua zawk kum lina hunin, Judah mite theampo taw kisai Topa ii thupuak khat ka nga hi. (Hi hun sia Nebuchadnezzar ii Babylon kumpi a sua a kum khatna hun ahi hi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima in Judah le Jerusalem mite theampo ii tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Amon ii tapa Josiah sia Judah kumpi a sep kum sawm le kum thumna pan kipan tuni ciang dong ma, kum kul le kum thum sung, Topa in ka tungah thu hong son zo a, ama ii a sonte hong son ngawlin ka om ngei bua hi. Ahihang bangma na nadon bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in ama naseam kamsaangte hong puak tawntung hi napi a thu na ngai bua a, na awlmawk bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang le na taanghpupite ii a tawntung na lua tu in Topa ii hong piaksa ngam sungah na teen tan thei natu uh in, na seksolnate le a sia na ngamtatnate panin na kikheal natu uh kamsaangte in no tungah hong son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian dang na biak ngawl natu uh le tuate ii na na sep ngawl natu uh, na vawttawm uh milimte biakna taw Topa na thin uuksak ngawl natu in kamsaangte in no hong son hi. Topa thu na ni uh le, ama in note daan hong pia ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang Topa ama mama in ka thu ngai nuam ngawl nu hi hong ci hi. Tuasia luangin, noma ii milimte taw ama thin uuksak a, daan hong piakna sia noma le noma ii kivawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tuabang a, a thuson na ngai nop ngawl uh manin Vaanglianbelpa Topa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘Keima in saksang ngam ah a om mihingte theampo le ka naseam Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar ka sam tu hi. Keima in Judah le a ngam sungah a teang mihingte theampo le a kiim a paam a om minamte theampo sim tu in amate ka paisak tu hi. Keima in hi ngam le a kiim a paam minamte ka susia tu hi, tuaciang a tawntungin a siacipin ka nusia tu a, a lauhuai le diipkuathuai mun suak tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate lungdam in a au nate, lungdam lawpna le mopoai sung lungdamna awngingte ka thimsak tu hi. Amate in a meiinnte atu in meitui nei ngawl tu uh a, neak tu antang om nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi ngam buppi a siathamin kinusia tu a, a ngamkhing mun suak tu hi, a kiim ah minamte in kum sawmsali sung tawntung Babylon kumpipa ii na seam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Babylon le a kumpipa sia a mawna uh hu in daan ka pia tu hi. Tua ngam ka susia tu a, a tawntung lalcip in ka nusia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jeremiah tungtawn a ka son lai in minamte tungah ka thengsak tu ci a ka tawnna tuasiatnate theampo — hi laibu sungah a kikhum tuasiatnate theampo taw Babylon daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate ii sep sa bangin Babylon te ka thuk kik tu a, minam tam mama le kumpi liante in amate sila in kai tu uh hi, a ci hi,’ ” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa Israel ii Pathian in keima tungah, “Hi lai ah ka thin uukna taw a kidim sapittui hai khat om hi. Kong paisakna minamte theampo kungah tua hai paipui in tua hai sung pan amate in nesak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in tua hai sung pan a neak uh ciang soai vadeng tu uh a, a thin uh amh tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile amate a do tu ngal ka puak hang ahi hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuasia ciang tua hai sia Topa ii khut tung panin ka la a, Topa hong sawlna minamte theampo tungah pia in tua hai sung panin ka nesak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate sennealngam khat, a lauhuai, diipkuathuai mun a sua natu le, mihingte ii ama te min sia haamsiatna in a zak natu in — tu hun dong a kizak lai bangma Jerusalem le Judah ngam khuapite theampo, a kumpite uh le a lampuite uh taw tua hai sung panin kidawnsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua hai sung pan a ne tu a dangte theampo ii min tepteena sia hi bang ahi hi: Egypt kumpipa, a khutnuai uliante le lampuite; Egypt mite theampo le Egypt ngam sungah a om ngamdangmite theampo; Uz ngam ah kumpite theampo; Philistine ngam ah Ashkelon, Gaza, Ekron khuapite ii kumpi theampo le Ashdod khuapi ah a taang laite; Edom, Moab le Ammon mite theampo; Tyre ngam le Sidon ngam kumpite theampo; Mediterranean tuipi hui a om ngamte ii kumpite theampo; Dedan, Tema, le Buz ii khuapite; a sam uh a tomin a meet mite theampo; Arabia ngam kumpite theampo; sennealngam minamte ii kumpite theampo; Zimri, Elam, le Media ngam kumpite theampo; saksang ngam kumpite theampo, a khuala a nai ci om ngawlin, khat zawkciang khat cite ahi hi. Leitung ah a om minam theampo in ne tu uh hi. A khak belin Babylon kumpipa in ne tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in keima tungah, “Mipite tungah son in. Keima, Vaanglianbelpa Topa , Israel ii Pathian in, amate tungah ngal ka thetsak hu in amate kham in a luak dong, pukin a thaw kik zawk ngawl za dong a neak tu in thu ka piak sia son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate in na khut tung panin hai la nuam ngawlin a dawn nuam bua uh le a dawn nanak uh kul lai tu hi, Vaanglianbelpa Topa in a ci sia amate son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Keima khuapi sungah suksiat nasep ka kipan tu hi. Daan thuak ngawl tu in kingaisun uh ziam? Hi ngawl hi, amate sia daan kipia tu hi, banghang ziam cile leitung mite theampo tungah ngal ka thengsak tu hi. Keima, Vaanglianbelpa Topa in ka ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Jeremiah awng, ka son theampo nangma in taangko tu ni hi. Hi mihingte tungah, ‘ Topa in vantung panin hawk tu a, vantung a saangna panin vanto tu hi. Ama in a mite hawksan tu a; sapitnga a cilpa khat bangin ama au tu hi. Leitung ah a om theampo in ama aw za tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />leimong dongin a aw hawl tu hi. Topa in minamte tungah thu vawt khat nei hi. Ama in mihingte theampo thu sit tu in paipui tu a, mi seksolte thisak tu hi. Topa in son zo hi,’ ci in,” son tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in tuasiatna sia ngam khat zawkciang ngam khat ah theng tu a, vuipi suangval khat sia leimong a khuala na munah va tu hi, ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ni in Topa ii thalup sa mithi luangte sia leimong khat panin leimong khat ah kithethaang in om tu hi. Kuama in amate kaa ngawl tu a, a luangte phaam in phum ngawl tu hi. Amate sia ninthuk kiseng bangin lei tungah kiseng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />No lampuite awng, kap vun, ka mite a cing a keamte awng, a ngingin kap vun! Tau in leivui sungah liik vun. Note hong kithalup tu hun hong theng zo a, tuutalte bangin note hong kisem tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Na suatakna tu uh lampi om ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Thinngimin tau in kap vun, banghang ziam cile Topa in a thin uukna taw in na minam hong susia zo a, na ngamnuam uh a siacipsa in nusia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tawpi khat in akua a nusiat bangin Topa in a mite nusia zo hi. A lauhuai ngal kidona le Topa ii a kiitakhuai thin uukna in hi ngam sennealngam suaksak zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah ii tapa Jehoiakim, Judah kumpi a sua zawk po ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in keima tungah, “Biakinnpi huang sungah ding in a, Judah ngam khuapite pan tua munah Pathian bia tu in hong pai mihingte tungah son tu a kong sawlte theampo thangsak in. Kheet nei heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua mihingte in na thu hong ngai tu a, a ngamtat siatnate kheal thei tha tu hi. A kikheal uh le, amate ii seksol ngamtatna hang a, amate suksiat tu in ka tup ka ngaisut sia ka kheal kik tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in mipite tungah son in ci a hong sawlna panin, “Keima, Topa ii kong hilcianna sia na zuina uh taw ahizong
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />note kungah kong paisak nithi ka naseam kamsaangte ii kammalte na nadonna uh taw ahizong, ka thu nong nit tu kisamh hi, ci in hong son zo khi hi. Amate ii a sonte na ni ngei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thu na ni bua lalai uh le, Shiloh khua tungah ka vawt bangin hi Biakinnpi tungah ka vawt tu a, leitung minamte theampo in hi khuapi ii min sia kihaamsiatna in zangh tu uh hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thiampite, kamsaangte le mihing om theampo in Biakinnpi sungah ka son hi thute za uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa ii hong thupiak theampo ka son tu ka man zawkciang amate in kei hong man in, “Hi bang na son hu in thalup tu in kilawm ni hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Banghangin Topa min suangin hi Biakinnpi sia Shiloh khua bang suak tu a, tuaciang hi khuapi kisusia cip in kuama teang ngawl tu hi ci ni ziam,” ci in au keak uh hi. Tuaciang mihonte in kei hong uumci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judah ngam lampuite in hi thu a zaak uh ciang, kumpi inn pan Biakinnpi ah manlangin pai uh a, Kongpi Thak ah omna la uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuasia ciang thiampite le kamsaangte in ngam lampuite le mihonte tungah, “Hisia pa thidaan piak tu kilawm hi, banghang ziam cile ih khuapi siatson hi. Na bil uh taw na za tek zo uh hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaciang keima in, “Hi Biakinnpi le hi khuapi ka siat sonna na zaak uhte theampo sia, Topa in taangko tu a kei hong sawl thute hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na nuntakzia le na sep uhte kheal nanak vun a, Topa na Pathian thu ni vun. Tuabangin na hi uh le, no tungah siatna thengsak tu in a sonsa sia pan Topa in a thin kheal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei ka hile, noma khut sungah ka om hi! Pha na sak, maan na sak uh bang pawpo in ka tungah hong vawt tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang hi thu telcian vun: kei nong that uh le noma le hi khuapi sung mihingte sia a mawbaang ngawl mihing khat that a mawnei na tang tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile hi kidop natu thu, no tungah son tu in hong sawl pa sia Topa ahi hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaciang ngam lampuite le mihonte in thiampite le kamsaangte tungah “Hisia pa in Topa ih Pathian min suangin ei tungah thu hong son hi; ama kithatlum ngawl tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, upate pawlkhat ding to in a kikhawm mipite tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Hezekiah sia Judah kumpi ahi lai in, Moresheth khua mi kamsaang Micah in mi theampo tungah Vaanglianbelpa Topa in hi bangin, ci hi, ‘Zion sia lo khat bangin kitho tu hi; Jerusalem sia ninthuk suak tu a, Biakinnpi dinna mual sia dui suak tu hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hezekiah kumpipa le Judah mite in Micah thatlum ngawl uh hi. Hezekiah in Topa zatak vawtin Topa ii mai pha a nga natu in hanciam zaw lai hi. Amate tungah tuasiatna ka thengsak tu hi a ci sia Topa in a thin kheal kik hi. Tu in eima in a lauhuai tuasiatna khat eima tung ma ah ih thengsak dektak hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />(Kiriath Jearim khua pan Shemaiah ii tapa Uriah a kici midang khat om hi. Ama in Jeremiah bang keak ma in Topa min suangin hi khuapi le minamte son sia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jehoiakim kumpipa le a ngalkapte le uliante in Uriah ii thuson a zaak uh ciang, kumpipa in Uriah a kithalup natu in hanciam hi. Ahihang tua thu Uriah in za hi; tuaciang ama lau in Egypt ngam ah tai a, suakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahizong Jehoiakim kumpipa in Achbor ii tapa Elnathan le midang pawlkhat sia Uriah man tu in Egypt ngam ah paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate in Uriah sia Jehoiakim kumpipa kungah puak kik uh hi. Kumpipa in Uriah thatlumsak in a luang sia nautaang kiphumna thaan sungah vawk hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahihang keima sia Shaphan ii tapa Ahikam in hong panpui ahikom thalup tu in mipite khut sungah thalup tu hong ki aap ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah ii tapa Zedekiah in Judah ngam kumpi a sua tuungin Topa in keima tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />savun khau le thing hakkol khat vawtin ka ngawng ah bul tu in hong sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciang Jerusalem khua ah Zedekiah kumpipa taw kimu tu a hong pai tongciinte tungtawnin Edom, Moab, Ammon, Tyre, le Sidon kumpite tungah thu khat puak tu in Topa in keima hong sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa , Israel ii Pathian, Topa in hi bangin ci hi ci in a kumpite tungah a son natu in a tongciinte thupia tu in kei hong sawl hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ka vaangletna le ka thahatna taw in leitung mihing nam le leitung ah a teang nganhingte theampo ka bitphua a; tuate sia ka piak nop pawpo tungah ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka naseam Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar khutnuai ah hi minamte theampo a koi pa sia Keima ka hi hi, tuaciang ngamsate ngawngawn in ama ii na ka seamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Minam theampo in ama ii na seam tu uh a, ama ngam a bo tu hun a thet mateng in minamte in ama ii tapa le a tupa ii na sepsak tu uh hi. Tua zawkciang ama minam in a thahat minamte le kumpi liante ii na sepsak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ahihang minam khat pawpo, ahibuale kumpi ngam khat in, Nebuchadnezzar ii ukna sungah a tum bua ahile tua minam sia, Nebuchadnezzar ii ka suksiat cipsak mateng in keima in ngal, kialpi le natna taw in daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na kamsaangte ahibuale, mangmatna taw ahizong, mithite ii thaa samna taw ahizong mitbum taw ahizong mailam thupiang tute a sonkhol thei a ci khat pawpo ii thu ngai heak vun. Amate theampo in Babylon kumpipa khutnuai ah na tum ngawl natu in no hong son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in no hong theam a, na ngam uh panin a khuala na ah na paina tu uh hong vawt tu uh hi. Keima in no kong hawlkeak tu a, hong kisusia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang minam khat pawpo in Babylon kumpipa khut sungah tum a, a na a seam le, a ngam ah lotho tu le a teang tu in ka om suaksak tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka ci zo hi,” hong cisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Zedekiah tungah ta bangma in, ka son a, “Babylon kumpipa khutnuai ah tum in. Ama le a mite ii na sepsak in, tua hile na nungta tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Banghangin nang le na mite sia ngal ahibuale kialpi ahibuale natna taw in thi tu nu ziam? Tua thu sia Babylon kumpipa khutnuai ah a tum ngawl minam khat pawpo tungah piang tu hi ci a, Topa ii sonsa thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa khutnuai ah na tum ngawl natu in hong son kamsaangte ii thu ngai heak vun. Amate in no hong theam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kamsaangte sia ka sawl hi ngawl a, keima min suangin leilot thu hong son hi, Topa mama in ci hi. Tua ahikom ama in no hong bengkeak tu a, noma le hi leilot thute hong son kamsaangte kithatlum tu hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa ii hi bangin a ci sia thiampite le mipite tungah ka son hi: “Biakinn sum le vanh manphate Babylon panin kila kik pal tu hi ci a, kamsaangte thuson sia ngai heak vun. Amate in no hong theam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate ii thuson ngai heak vun! Babylon kumpipa khutnuai ah tum vun, tua hile na nungta tu uh hi! Banghangin hi khuapi sia ninthuk suak tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in kamsaang tatakte hi in, ka thupuak a nei uh le, Biakinnpi sung le kumpi inn sungah a om lai sum le vanh manphate Babylon ah a kipuaksak ngawl natu in keima, Vaanglianbelpa Topa tungah hong ngen ta uh hen.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />(Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa in Judah kumpipa, Jehoiakim ii tapa Jehoiachin le Judah ngam le Jerusalem khua lampuite Babylon ah a paipui lai in khuamte, taau tuikuang, leangte le a dang biakinn sum le vanh manpha pawlkhat nusia hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Jerusalem khua sung Biakinnpi sung le kumpi inn sungah a kinusia sum le vanh manphate taw kisai in Keima, Vaanglianbelpa Topa Israel ii Pathian in hi bang kong son sia ngai vun:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuate sia Babylon ah kipua tu a, keima ii ka kat mateng in tua munah om suak tu hi. Tua zawkciang tuate ka la kik tu a, hi munah ka koi kik tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka ci zo hi,” ci in ka son hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zedekiah kumpi a sua zawk a kum lina ii a tha ngana, tua kum sung ma in Gibeon khua mi Azzur ii tapa kamsaang Hananiah in Biakinnpi sungah kei hong paupui hi. Thiampite le mipite om honna ah ama in keima tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa , Israel ii Pathian in “Babylon kumpipa vaangletna ka susia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa ii Babylon ah a paipui biakinn sum le vanh manpha vanh manphate theampo kum nii sungin hi munah ka ciapui kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima in Judah kumpipa, Jehoiakim ii tapa Jehoiachin zongh Babylon ah saltaang a, a pai Judah mite theampo ka ciapui kik tu hi. Hi hi. Keima in Babylon kumpipa vaangletna ka susia tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka ci zo hi,” ci in hong son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuasia ciang thiampite le Biakinnpi sungah a ding mipite theampo ii mai ah, keima in Hananiah tungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Lamdang hi! Topa in hisia seam tu in lamen khi hi! Topa in na sonkholna sia taangtungsak tu a, thongtaakte bangin a kikai mihing theampo le Biakinnpi sum le vanh manpha vanh manphate theampo Babylon panin hong ciapui kik tu hi ci in ka um takpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang nang tung le mipite tungah ka son thu sia ngai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nang le kei ii om hun ma in a om, taanghlai a thuson kamsaangte in minam tam mamate tung le a thahat a kumpi ngamte tungah ngal, kialpi le natna theng tu hi ci in sonkhol zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang kilemna le thinnopna hong theng tu hi ci in a sonkhol kamsaang pa sia, ama ii sonkholnate a taangtung takpi ahile Pathian ii sawl tatak kamsaang in kisaang thei pheang tu hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Hananiah in ka ngawng pan hakkol hong la in, a bebekin thiaktan hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tuaciang ama in mipi mai ah: “Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa ii minam theampo ii ngawng ah a bul hakkol sia hi bangin ka thiaktan tu hi Topa in ci hi; tuaciang ama in hi nasep sia kum nii sung sang seam tu hi,” ci in son hi. Tua zawkciang ka nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hisia zawk tawmvei ciang Topa in keima tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />pai in a, Hananiah kungah hi bang son tan: “ Topa in, thing hakkol khat sia thiaktan zo peu tu ni hi, ahihang thik hakkol khat taw ka laih tu ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa, Israel ii Pathian in hi minamte theampo tungah thik hakkol ka bul tu a, amate in Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar ii na a seam tu uh hi, ci hi. Topa in ngamsate ngawngawn in Nebuchadnezzar ii na ka seamsak tu ci hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Hananiah tungah hi thu ka son zawkciang, “Ngai in, Hananiah awng! Nang sia Topa ii hong sawl na hi bua hi. Hi mite leilot thu na umsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahikom Topa ama mama in nang kong heam tu hi ci hi. Tu kum bo ma in na thi tu hi, banghang ziam cile Topa langpan tu in mipite na son zo hi,” ka ci lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua kum a tha sali tha in Hananiah thi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem khua panin Nebuchadnezzar in Babylon ah thongtaak in a paipui thiampite, kamsaangte, mipi lampuite le a dangte theampo ii tungah lai khat ka thaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hi lai sia Jehoiachin kumpipa, a nu, kumpi inn sung uliante, Judah ngam le Jerusalem lampuite, khutthiam mite le naseam thiamte a saltanna munah a kipaipui zawkciang ka at ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua laithak sia Judah kumpipa Zedekiah ii Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar tungah a thaak hi a Shaphan ii tapa Elasah le Hilkiah ii tapa Gemariah khut tungah ka pia hi. Tua laithak sungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Vaanglianbelpa Topa Israel ii Pathian in Jerusalem panin Babylon ah Nebuchadnezzar ii thongtaakin a paipuisak tua mite theampo tungah hi bangin ci hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘Inn sa vun a teang vun. Huan vawt vun a, a sungah na ciin uhte ne vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kiteang vun a ta nei vun. Ama te zongh ta a nei thei natu in na tate uh kiteangsak vun. Na pungto tu uh a, na kiamsuk buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thongtaak a kong paisakna khuapite ii phattuam natu in naseam vun. Amate taangin ka tungah thu ngen vun, banghang ziam cile amate a nuamsa uh le no zong na nuamsa tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Note sungah a teang kamsaangte in hikale maisang thu ka sonkhol thei hi a ci midangte in hikale na theamsak ngawl natu in Keima, Topa Israel ii Pathian in na kidop natu kong hilkhol hi. Amate ii mangmatte na thudon heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in ka min suangin no tungah leilot thu hong son uh hi. Amate ka sawl bua hi. Keima, Vaanglianbelpa Topa in ka son zo hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“ Topa in, ‘Babylon ah na om zawk uh kum sawmsali a cin ciang no kong thin nopmawkna kong lak tu a, na khua na tui uh ah na cia kik natu uh in ka kamciam ka len tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />No atu in tupna ka neite sia na tuasiat natu hi ngawlin mi nuamsa na sua natu le mai sangah lametna kong piak natu ngealnate ahi hunlam keima bek in ka he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaciang kei nong sam tu uh hi. Kei kung hong zuanin thu nong ngen tu uh hi, tuaciang kong zo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei nong zong tu uh a, nong mu tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile na thinsung theampo taw nong zon tu uh hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hi hi, Kei nong mu tu uh a, na ngam uh ah kong koi kik tu hi, ka ci hi. Note kong thethaangna ngam theampo le mun theampo panin kong kaikhawm kik tu a, saltaang a kong puak ma na omna munah kong ciapui kik tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka ci zo hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“ Topa in Babylon pan kamsaangte note hong pia hi, ci nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />David ii kumpi ngam a uk kumpipa le hi khuapi mite ahi noma taw thongtaak bangin a paikhawm ngawl na mealheakte taw kisai in Topa thusonte ngai vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in, ‘Keima in amate tungah ngal, kialpi le natna ka tungsak tu a, amate sia neak thei ngawl theinga muat bang ka hisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngal, kialpi le natna taw amate ka zuizen tu a, leitung minam theampo in tuasia a mu uh ciang lau tu uh hi. Mun theampo ah amate ka thethaang tu a, amate tung thupiangte hangin mihingte ingh in lau tu uh hi. Mihingte in amate nunau in, a min uh sia kihaamsiatna in zangh tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hi thu sia amate tungah tung tu hi, banghang ziam cile amate in ka naseam kamsaangte tungtawn a ka puak tawntung ahi ka thupuak sia a nit ngawl uh hang ahi hi. Amate in ngai nuam ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Babylon ah saltaang in kong puak note theampo awng, Keima, Topa ii ka son sia ngai vun,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Vaanglianbelpa Topa , Israel ii Pathian in, ama min suangin no tungah leilot thu hong son, Kolaiah ii tapa Ahab le Maaseiah ii tapa Zedekiah te ii thu son zo hi. Topa in amate sia Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar khut sungah aap tu a, ama in noma mu tang ma in thatlum tu hi, ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jerusalem pan Babylon ah thongtaak bangin a kipuak mite in khat pawpo a haamsiat nop uh ciang, ‘Babylon kumpipa ii a hingtang a mei sung a em Zedekiah le Ahab bangin Topa in nang hong vawt tahen!’ ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hi bangin a thuak tu uh ma ahi hi, banghang ziam cile amate in a lauhuai mawna khialnate — palngul mawna vawtin Topa ii min suangin leilot thute son uh hi. Hi thu sia Topa ii dei ngawl ahi hi; ama in amate ii vawt theampo he a, ama sia a langpan tetti khat ahi hi. Topa in ci zo hi,” ci in ki at hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa , Israel ii Pathian in Nehelam mi Shemaiah atu in thupuak khat kei hong pia hi, Shemaiah in ama min mama taw in Jerusalem khua mite theampo le Maaseiah ii tapa thiampi Zephaniah tung le thiampi dangte theampo ii tungah lai khat thaak hi. Shemaiah in Zephaniah tungah a thaak hi lai sungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“ Topa in Jehoiada taangin nangma thiampi in hong koi zo hi, tua ahiciang tu in nang sia Biakinnpi sungah ulianbel na hi hi. Kamsaang khat in a kivawt tawm a mawmaw theampo ii ngawng ah thikkual bulin na khii tu sia nangma vaipuak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Banghangin mipite tungah kamsaang khat bang a thu a son Anathoth khua mi Jeremiah tungah hi bangin vawt ngawl ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama thu son tu sia khaam kul hi, banghang ziam ci le ama in Babylon ah a om mipite tungah, tua munah khuangei ma thongtaak tu uh hi, inn na sa tu a, teangin, huan vawt a, na ciinte na ne tu uh hi, a ci hang ahi hi,” ci in at hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Zephaniah in tua laithak sia kei hong sim hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />tuasia ciang Topa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Shemaiah ii thu taw kisai in Babylon ah thongtaakte theampo tungah hi thu puak in ci in kei hong sawl hi: “Keima, Topa in, Shemaiah le a suan a paalte theampo daan ka pia tu hi. Ama in ka sawl ngawl bulin kamsaang khat bangin no tungah thu hong son in leilot thute no hong umsak uh hi. Ama in no sungah suan le paal nei ngawl tu hi. Ama sia ka mite atu in a pha ka vawt tu nate a mu tu in nungta ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile ka mite ii hong langpan natu in ama in sawl hi. Keima, Topa in ka ci zo hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa , Israel ii Pathian in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />keima tungah: “Kong son theampo laibu khat sungah at in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />banghang ziam cile Israel le Judah ka mite a ngam ka piak kik tu hun hong theng tu hi. A taanghpupite tungah ka piaksa ngam ah ka heak kik sak tu a, amate in tua ngam tang kik tu uh hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in Israel le Judah mite tungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Launa le, patauna aw khat ka za a, thinnopna aw ahi bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu in tawlnga in ngaisun vun! Pasal khat in nau a nei thei ziam? Tua ahile banghangin pasal sim in numei nautun bangin a ngil hum ziam? Banghangin a kuama po a mai daang ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A lauhuai mama ni khat hong theng tu a; nidang taw kitee thei ngawl tu hi — ka mite ii ngimna thuak hun hi tu a, ahihang amate suakta veve tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in: “Tua ni hong thet ciang, a ngawng uh ah a kibul hakkol ka thiaktan tu a, a thikkolte ka vawk tu hi, amate in ngamdangmite ii silate hi nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in Topa a Pathian le, kumpi ka suasak tu David ii suan le paal khat ii na seam zaw tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ka mite awng, lau heak vun; Israel mite awng, patau heak vun. Na thongtaakna a khualana ngam panin kong suatak tu hi. Inn ah nong cia kik tu uh a, thinnuam takin na teang tu uh hi; na ngammuang tu uh a, kuama in no hong lausak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Note kungah kong pai tu a kong ngum tu hi. Kong thethaangna ngammite theampo ka susia tu a, ahihang no kong susia buatu hi. Daan thuak ngawlin no kong omsak buatu hi; ahihang daan kong piak ciang, a kilawm in kong pia tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in a mite tungah, “Na meima uhte kibawl thei ngawl a, Na liammate uh kidamsak thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />No hong ou tu kuama om ngawl a, Na meima bawl natu uh zatui om ngawlin, na dam tu uh sia muanmawk om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na itte theampo in no hong mangil zo a; amate in no hong awlmaw nawn ngawl hi. Keima in note sia ngal khat bangin kong sim a, na mawnate tam a, na seksolna uh lian ahikom na daan thuak uh nasia mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na liammate hangin phuphun nawn heak vun; Na kibawl thei buatu hi. Na mawnate tam a, na seksolna uh lian ahikom hi bangin daan kong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang tu in no hong valhtumte theampo kivalhtum tu a, na ngalte theampo thongtaak tu in kipaipui tu uh hi. No hong zawthawk vawtte theampo kizawthawk vawt tu a, no hong suttolte theampo sutolna thuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />No kong damsak kik tu hi; Na ngalte in, ‘Zion sia a kipuavawk sa khat hi a; kuama in awlmaw ngawl uh hi,’ a ci tazong na liammate ka damsak tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in, “Ka mite a ngam ka pia kik tu a, a innkuan sim tungah hesuakna ka nei tu hi; Jerusalem khuapi kisa kik tu a, a kumpi inn sia a omna ngei ma ah kikoi kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua munah a teang mihingte in pokna lasa tu uh a; lungdam in au tu uh hi. Ka thupha piakna taw amate pung tu uh a; ka thupha piakna in amate upatna ngasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nidang a, a nei vaangletna ka pia kik tu a, a minam kip takin ka phut kik tu hi; amate a zothaw theampo daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate a uk tu sia amate ii minam sung pan ma in hong pai tu a, amate ii kumpitapa sia a minam sung pan ma in hong pai tu hi. Ka sam ciang ama in kei hong zuan tu hi, banghang ziam cile sam ngawlin akua hong pai ngam tu ziam? Amate sia ka mite hi tu uh a, keima in amate ii Pathian ka hi tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa ii thin uukna sia vuipi nguapi hi a, mi seksolte lu tungah kinuaingawp tu hi. Vawt tu in a tup theampo a taangtun siat mateng in ama tawlnga ngawl tu hi. Maisang hun ah a mite in hi thu telthiang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in, “Israel minamte theampo ii Pathian ka hi hun hong theng tu a, amate in ka mite hi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thina pan a suakta tua mite sennealngam sungah hesuakna ka lak hi. Israel mite toithaina a thangai uh ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a khualana pan amate kungah ka kilangh hi. Israel mite awng, no kong it tawntung hi, tua ahikom itna kip kong lak tan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khatvei ma kong pua kik tu hi. Khatvei ma na daalkual khuangnote na la kik tu uh a, lungdam in na laam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khatvei ma Samaria mual tungah sapithuan na vawt kik tu uh a, tua sapit a suante in sapithuan pan a piangte ne tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi hi, ngalvilte in Ephraim mualtung panin, ‘Ih Topa Pathian kung Zion ah paito ka tawng’ ci in a sam tu hun hong theng tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in, “Minamte sung panin a lianbel, Israel atu in lungdamin lasa vun. Pokna lasa vun, ‘ Topa in a mite ngum zo a; a taanglaite theampo suatak zo hi,’ ci vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima in amate saksang pan ka paipui tu a, leimong pan ka kaikhawm tu hi. Mittaw peangbaite, numei naupaaite le nausuak dektakte zongh amate taw hong pai tu uh hi, Amate sia minam lian khatin hong cia kik tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka mite lampui in ka heakpui kik laitak amate kap kawm, thungen kawmin hong heak kik tu uh hi. Tui omna lui ah amate lam ka pui tu a, lam nuamna ah amate lutu ngawl tu uh hi. Keima in Israel te ii pa khat bang ka hi a, Ephraim sia ka tapa lianbel ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in, “Minamte awng, hong ngai tavun a, ka kammalte a khuala na tuipi vaalbo ah thangsak vun. Ka mite ka thethaang hi, ahihang amate ka kaikhawm tu a, tuucing pa in a tuuhon a cin bangin ka keam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel mite ka suaktasak zo a, a thahat minam khat ii khut sung panin ka hun zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate hong pai in Zion mual tungah lungdam in lasa tu uh a, ka letsongte taw lungdam mama tu uh hi — Ka letsongte sia antang, sapittui, olive thau, tuu le khuite ahi hi. Amate sia pha tak a, tui a kibuak husuan khat taw kibang tu a; amate in a kisap theampo nei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaciang ngaknute laam a, lungdam tu uh hi, tuaciang pasal, khangmoi, khanghaam te lawp in om tu hi. Amate ka heeneam tu a, a kaana te thinnopna, a heenate lungdamna ka suaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thiampite an phabel taw ka vaak tu a, ka mite ii a taangsap theampo ka pia tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in, “Ramah khua ah aw khat kiza a, thin nat tatakna taw kaana aw ahi hi. Rachel sia a tate atu in kap hi; a tate om nawn ngawl a, ama sia heenep tu uuk ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kap nawn heak in a, na thituite nawl in. Na tate atu in na sep theampo thaman nga ngawlin na nguaksuak buatu hi; amate sia ngalte ii ngam panin hong heak kik tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na mai sang atu in lametna om hi; na tate inn hong cia kik tu uh hi. Keima, Topa in ka ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Israel mite khuangai in a mau ka za hi, ‘ Topa awng, ko sia a kizual ngawl nganhing khat bang ka hi uh hi, ahihang thu ni tu in kote nong hil hi. Ko hong ciapui kik ta'n; na kungah hong cia tu in kithoai khu hi, Topa kote Pathian awng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangma kung pan ka puapial uh hi, ahihang kong heak kik paih nuam uh hi. Daan nong piak zawkciangin khuangai in ka kun uh hi. Ka no lai a mawna khialna ka vawt uh hu in maizum, minpaan in ka om uh hi’.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Israel awng, nang sia ka thangaibel ka tapa na hi a, ka itbel ka ta na hi hi. Na min ka law simin itna taw kong phawk hi. Nangma kong ngaisun tawntung a; kong hesuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lampi ah lamlaknate phutin, lampi ciamtee in; na nusiat lampi sia zong kik in. Hong heak kik tavun, Israel mite awng, na nusiat uh khuate ah hong cia kik tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bang tanvei haisaang tu nu ziam, upna nei ngawl mihingte awng? A thak le a tumdang na khat ka bitphua zo a, numei khat in pasal khat a sungsiat bangin tumdang hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa Israel ii Pathian in, “Mihingte a ngam ka piak kik ciang, Judah ngamsung le a khuate sungah amate in, ‘ Topa in Jerusalem mual thiangtho, ama teenna mun thiangtho sia, thupha pia tahen’ khatvei ma ci kik tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Judah ngamsung le a khuate theampo sungah mihingte teang tu a, lothote, tuucingte, a tuuhonte taw om tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A ngim a toi mihingte thathak ka nguan tu a, ngilkial in, a tha zawmte theampo an ka vaak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuasia ciang mihingte in, ‘Lum in ka mu a, thathak taw ka khanlaw nuam hi,’ ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Keima, Topa in Israel le Judah ngam sia mihingte le nganhingte taw ka kidimsak tu hun hong theng tu hi, ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kidawm takin amate ka zunglok, ka kaikeak, ka lotthal, ka suksiat le ka lalsak lai bangma in kidawm takin amate ka suan kik tu a ka laamto kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua hun hong thet ciang, mihingte in, ‘Nu le pate in a thuk sapitngate ne a, Ahihang a tate a ha uh khim hi,’ ci nawn ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuabang hi ngawlin, Sapit nga thuk a ne pawpo a hakhim tu a; a kuama po ama ii mawna hangin thi tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Topa in, “Israel mite le Judah mite taw thuciamna thak khat ka vawt tu hun hong theng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua thuciamna sia a taanghpupite a khut uh pan kai in Egypt ngam pan ka pusua pui lai a, a taanghpupite taw ka vawt uh thuciamna lui taw kibang ngawl tu hi. Keima sia amate ii a pasal bang hi napi amate in tua thuciamna zui ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Israel mite taw ka vawt tu thuciamna thak sia hi bang hi tu hi: amate sung sangah ka thukham ka koi tu a, a lungtang tungah tuate ka at tu hi. Keima in amate ii Pathian ka hi tu a, amate sia ka mite ahi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Topa a heak natu uh in amate sia a mipuite kuama ii thu hil kul ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile a nobel pan a lianbel dongin kei hong he siat tu uh hi. Keima in amate ii a mawnate ka maisak tu a, a khialnate ka ciamtee nawn buatu hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Topa in sunin khuavaksak tu in ni hong pia a, zan in a taang tu in tha le aksite hong pia hi. Ama in tuipi kiloksak in hawksak hi; ama ii min sia Vaanglianbelpa Topa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Leitung paizia a kip lai theampo in, Israel sia minam khat in om tu hi ci in, kamciam pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Vantung a kitee thei ni ciang le lei ii a taw dopphate a ki ettel thei hun khat ni khat ni ciang in amate ii a sep a vawt te theampo hu in ama in Israel mite nial pheang tu hi. Topa in ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Topa in, “Hananel Tausaang panin nitumna sang Kiing Kongpi dong Jerusalem khua buppi sia keima ii khuapi in a kisak kik tu hun hong theng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuaciang ngamngi sia tua mun panin nitumna sang Gareb mual dong le Goah kiimkot teng hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Mithi phumna le ninteak vawkna leikuam buppi le Kidron lui tungsia ah lote theampo, nisuana sang Siphu Kongpi ciang dong, keima a tu in mun thiangtho hi tu hi. Khuapi sia kipheltham, kisusia kik ngei nawn ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Zedekiah ii Judah kumpi a sua zawk kum sawm a cin kum, Kumpi Nebuchadnezzar zongh Babylon kumpi a sua zawk kum sawm le kum liat a cin kum in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua hunin Babylon kumpipa ii ngalkaphonpi in Jerusalem sim a, kumpipa innhuang sungah kei hong khacip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zedekiah kumpipa in kei sia tua munah thong hong khum a, Topa ii son bang a ka taangko hu in kei hong mawsiat hi, Topa sonna pan, “Babylon kumpipa in hi khuapi ka lasak tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zedekiah kumpipa suakta ngawl tu hi. Ama sia Babylon kumpipa khut sungah ki aap tu a, ama taw maitang kisi in thuson tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zedekiah sia Babylon ah kipaipui tu a, ama kungah ka kihiil kik mateng tua munah om zii tu hi. Babylon te a do hial zongin, zo ngawl tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka ci zo hi”.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in kei hong sonna panin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ka pano Shallum ii tapa Hanamel sia ka kungah hong pai tu a, Benjamin ngamsung Anathoth khua ah a lo sia hong lei ta'n, banghang ziam cile a lei thei tu sung panin ka mealheak kuungbel nangma na om hi, hong ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, Topa ii hong son bangma in, Hanamel sia ka omna zum huang sung, ka kungah hong pai in tua lo lei tu in kei hong sawl hi. Tua ahikom Topa in keima tungah hong son tatak hunlam ka he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hanamel tung panin tua lo ka lei a, ama atu in khaiteena taw ka tee hi; a man sia ngunntang sawm le sali tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thukimna lai vawtin letmat ka thu a, thu hong heak pui tu in tetti te sam in, sumteena taw sum ka tee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lo kileina lai nii — khat sia tazeik kituum ngawl a, a dang khat sia tazeik kituumin thukimna teng kikhum hi — keima kungah a nii ma in ka la a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mahseiah ii tupa, Neriah ii tapa Baruch tungah tua laite ka pia hi. Tua thukimna laite sia ama tungah Hanamel le lo kilei thukimna lai tungah letmat a thu tetti te le zum huang sungah a to mihingte mai ah ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate theampo mai ah keima in Baruch tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Vaanglianbelpa Topa Israel ii Pathian in hi thukimna laite tazeik kituum sia hikale a kituum ngawl sia hikale a nii ma in la a, kum tampi a omcing thei tu in leibeal sungah na koi natu in thu hong pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa , Israel ii Pathian in hi ngam sungah a om innte, lote le sapithuante kilei kik tu hi, ci zo hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lo kileina lai sia Baruch tungah ka piak zawkciang thu ka ngen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Vaanglianpipa Topa awng, nangma in lei le van sia na vaangletna le na thahatna taw na vawt hi; nang atu in a haksa lei bangma om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihing tul tampi te tungah tawntung itna na lak zo a, ahihang a nu a pate ii mawna khialnate hu in mihingte daan na pia si hi. Nangma in a lian, a vaang nei Pathian na hi a; Vaanglianbelpa Topa na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangma in ngealna phate na nei a, naliante na seam hi; mihingte ii a sep a vawt theampo na mu a, amate ii diannate taw kizui in thaman na pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nidang lai in Egypt ngam ah nalamdang laknate le a tumdang nate na vawt a, tu ciang dongin Israel mite sung hikale minam dangte theampo sungah hikale na vawt lai hi, tuasia hu in, tu in mun theampo ah hong kihe hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ih ngalte a patausak nalamdang le a tumdang nate lakna taw in Egypt ngam panin Israel na mite na paipui natu in na vaangletna le na thahatna na zangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A taanghpupite tungah na kamciamsa bangma in, hi a hau ngam le leipha ngam sia amate na pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahihang amate in hi ngam hong theng a, ngam a nei uh ciangin na thupiak ni ngawl a, na thuhilna bangin ngamta ngawl uh hi; vawt tu a na thupiakte bang mama vawt ngawl uh hi. Tuasia hu in hi suksiatna theampo amate tungah na thengsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Babylon te in khuapi a laak natu in khuapi kiimkot ah leivum ciangin uumci a, tuaciang sim uh hi. Ngal, kialpi le natna in hi khuapi sia amate ii khut sung thengsak tu hi. Na son sate theampo a taangtun na mu thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahizong, khuapi sia Babylon te in a la tu hi zo napi tetti te mai ah lo lei tu a, thu hong pia sia nangma Vaanglianpipa Topa na hi veve hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in keima tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Keima in Topa ka hi a, minam theampo ii Pathian ka hi hi. Kei atu in a haksa lei bangma om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hi khuapi sia Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar le a ngalkaphonpi khut sungah ka pia tu a; amate in la in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />mei taw hal tu uh hi. Kei hong thin uuksak a innkhum tung a Baal atu ngimnamtui a halna le a dang pathian te atu sapittui sungsukin a biakpiakna mun ahi innte haltum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amate taanghthu a kipatciil pan a sep a vawtna uh taw Israel mite le Judah mite in ka thin hong nuamsak ngawl a, ka thin hong uuksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hi khua mite in khuapi a sak ni pan kipan ka thin hong uuksak a hong thangsiasak hi. Tua khuapi sia suksiat tu in ka khensat zo hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />banghang ziam cile Judah mite le Jerusalem khua mite in a kumpite le a lampuite, a thiampite le a kamsaangte uh taw a sia a vawt uh hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amate in kei hong nungngat uh a, ka hil tawntung hi napi hong ngai nuam ngawlin he nuam ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kei hong biak natu a, a kisa Biakinnpi sungah amate in a kiihuai milimte ngawngawn koi a, ninsak zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amate in a tapate le a tanute taw Molech pathian a biakpiak thei natu in Hinnom Kuam sungah Baal a tu biaknataute vawt uh hi. Hi bang a vawt tu sia amate tungah thu ka pia bua hi. Tuabang khat a vawt tu le tuaciang Judah mite mawna vawt a suasak tu sia ka ngaisun tha ngei bua hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Topa Israel ii Pathian in kei tungah, “Jeremiah awng, mipite in, ngal kidona, kialpi le natna in hi khuapi sia Babylon kumpipa khut sungah thengsak tu hi ci uh hi. Tu in kong son tu thudang sia ngai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka thin uuk, ka thinsona taw in ka thethaangna ngamte theampo pan mihingte ka kaikhawm tu hi, hi munah ka ciapui kik tu a, ngam muang in ka teangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate sia ka mite hi tu a, keima sia amate ii Pathian ka hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A nuntakna uh ah tupna khat bek ka pia tu hi: tua tupna sia amate ii phat natu le a suan le a paalte ii phat natu in, a tawntung keima hong zatak vawt tu uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Amate taw a tawntung atu in thuciamna khat ka vawt tu hi. Amate atu in na pha ka vawtte ka tawlnga ngei buatu a, keima kung pan a puapial ngeingawl natu in a thinsung theampo taw keima hong kiitak natu in ka vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Amate atu in naphate ka vawtna ah dik ka sa tu a, hi ngam sungah amate ka teang suaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Hi mite tungah hi tuasiatna ka thetsak bangma in ka khapsa na pha theampo amate ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Mihingte in, hi ngam sia mihing hikale nganhing hikale ii ten ngawlna sennealngam bang hi tu a, tua ngam sia Babylon te khut sungah kipia tu hi, ci uh hi. Ahihang hi ngam sungah a om lote khatvei kilei kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Mihingte in tua lote lei in lo kileina lai tungah min thu, tazeik tuum tu a, tetti nei tu uh hi. Hi thu sia Benjamin ngam, Jerusalem kiim ah khuanote, Judah ngam khuate le tuaciang mualtung ngam, mualpeang ngam le Judah thangsang ngam ah om khuate ah piang tu hi. Keima in mihingte a ngam ah ka teangsak kik tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpi innhuang sungah thongtaak a ka om laitakin Topa ii thupuak sia ka kung hong theng kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leitung a vawt, a piangsak le a omna munah a koi Topa in keima hong paupui hi. A min Topa a kici, ama in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Kei nong sam uh le kong zo tu hi; a thu na heak ngawl lai a lamdangte le thu tumdangte kong son tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima, Topa , Israel ii Pathian in Jerusalem innte le Judah kumpi inn sia ngalte in kiim uum a, a sim hu in siatham tu hi ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihing kimkhatte in Babylon te do tu uh hi, amate in ka thin uuk ka thangsiatna taw ka velvawk tu mithi luangte taw innte dimsak tu uh hi. A mite ii a tatsiatnate hu in hi khuapi ka nungngat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang hi khuapi le a mite ka puuapha kik tu hi, ciidamna amate ka pia kik tu hi. Amate a kicing thinnopna le ngammuanna ka lak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Judah mite le Israel mite ka nuamsasak tu a, nidang a om ngei bangin ka pua kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima tungah hong vawt mawna khialnate panin ka thiansua tu a, amate ii mawna khialnate le hong langpannate ka maisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jerusalem sia kei atu in lungdamna, patoaina le kiphatsakna ii kipatna hi tu hi; leitung ah minam om theampo in Jerusalem atu na pha ka vawtnate le hi khuapi atu nopsakna ka piakna thute a zaak uh ciang, lau in liing tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in, “Mihingte in hi mun sia, mihing zongh nganhing zongh ii teen ngawlna senneal ngam taw kibang hi ci uh hi. Amate ci bang hi peu hi; Judah khuate le Jerusalem khua lampite awngthong a; tua munah mihing zongh nganhing zongh teang ngawl hi. Ahihang hi munte ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lungdam thinnuam in au nate, tuaciang mopoai ngualnopna awngingte na za kik tu uh hi. Mihingte in ka Biakinnpi ah lungdamko biakpiaknate pia in la a sak na za tu uh hi; amate in, ‘Vaanglianbelpa Topa tungah lungdamko vun, banghang ziam cile ama pha a, ama ii hong itna kip tawntung hi,’ ci tu uh hi. Hi ngam sia nidang bangma in ka nuamsasak kik tu hi. Keima Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in, “Mihing nganhing a teang ngawl sennealngam bang ahi, hi ngam sungah nganthana tu mun om kik tu a, tua munah tuucingte in a tuute cing tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mualtung ngam, mualpeangte le, Judah ngam thangsang, Benjamin ngamsung khuate, Jerusalem kiim a khuanote le Judah ngamsung khuate ah tuucingte in a tuute phakza khatvei ma sim kik tu uh hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in, “Israel le Judah mite tungah kamciam ka piak sia ka taangtunsak tu hun hong theng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua hun ciang David ii suan le paal sung pan thumaan thutang khat kumpi in ka teal tu hi. Tua kumpipa in ngamsung theampo ah thudik le thutang in a maan sia seam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Judah mite le Jerusalem mite sia kisuatak tu a, ngam muangin teang tu uh hi. Tua khuapi sia ‘ Topa , Eite Ngupna’ kici tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keima, Topa in Israel kumpi tu in David suan le paal khat om tawntung tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Levi minam sung pan meihal biakpiaknate, antang taw biakpiakna le sangaw biakpiaknate vawtna ah ka na a seam tu in thiampite om tawntung tu hi ci sia kong kamciam hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in keima tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“A hun tek a tun simin hong pai tawntung thei natu in sun hun le zan hun taw thuciamna ka vawt zo hi; tua ahiciang tua thuciamna kiphel tan thei ngeingawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuasia bangma in a suan khat kumpi a hi tawntung natu sia ka naseam David taw thuciamna khat ka vawt zo hi, tuaciang Levi minam sung pan a thiampite taw zong ka na hong sepsak tawntung natu in kiciamna khat ka vawt zo hi; tua thuciamnate kiphel tan thei ngeingawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Van ah aksite le tuipivaal ah sennealte a kisim zawk ngawl bangma in amate phakza sim zawk ngawl ahi natu in keima in ka naseampa David ii suan le paalte le Levi minam sung panin thiampite ka pungsak tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in keima tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Ka tealsa innkuan nii, Israel le Judah te sia keima in niil zo hi ci a mihingte ii a son na phawk ziam? Tua ahikom amate in ka mite nomu a minam khat in ngaisun nawn ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahihang keima Topa in sun le zan taw thuciamna khat ka vawt zo a, lei le van a uk thukhamte ka vawt zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hi nate ka vawt takpi bangma in, Jacob ii suan le paalte le ka naseam David taw ka vawt thuciamna sia ka len nginge tu hi. Abraham, Isaac le Jacob ii suan le paalte a uk tu in David ii suan le paalte khat ka teal tu hi. Ka mite ka hesuak tu a, ka nuamsasak kik tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar, ama ngalkaphonpi le amate a hu a khutnuai ah a om minamte theampo ii ngalkapte in Jerusalem le a naina khuate a sim uh lai in Topa in keima hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa Israel ii Pathian in Judah kumpipa Zedekiah kungah pai in hi bangin son ta'n, “Keima, Topa in hi khuapi sia Babylon kumpipa khut sungah ka aap tu a, ama in haltham tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na suakta buatu hi; hong kiman tu a, ama tungah hong ki aap tu hi. Nangma in ama na mu tu a, maitang kisi in na paupui tu hi, tua zawkciang Babylon ah na pai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zedekiah awng, nangma taw kisai thu kong son sia ngai in. Nang sia ngal sungah hong kithatlum ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thin nuam takin na thi tu hi, tuaciang nangma mai ah kumpite ahi, na taanghpupite a kiphum uh ciang mihingte ii ngimnamtui a hal bangma amate in nang atu in ngimnamtui hal tu uh hi. Amate in, ‘Ih kumpipa thi thong ei!’ ci in nang hong kaa tu uh hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi” ci in hong sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaciang hi thu sia Jerusalem khua sung Zedekiah kumpipa kungah ka puak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tua hun sia Babylon kumpipa ii ngalkaphonpi in tua khuapi a sim laitak ahi hi. Tua ngalkaphonpi in Judah ngam sungah a taanglai kulh taw a ki uum khuapi dang ahi Lachish le Azekiah zongh sim uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kuama in Israel a mipuite sila in a nei ngawl natu in Zedekiah kumpipa le Jerusalem mite in pa ahizong numei ahizong Hebrew a mipui silate a suatak natu in thukimna khat vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mipite le a lampui theampo in a silate a suatak tu uh le sila a, a kai kik nawn ngawl natu thukim uh hi. Amate in a silate suaktasak uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ahihang nungsang ciang amate in a thin kheal kik a, sila suak tu ma in kai kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Topa
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel ii Pathian in mipite tungah thuson tu in keima hong sawl na pan in: “Keima in na taanghpupite uh a sila kaaina Egypt ngam pan ka suatak lai in amate taw thuciamna khat ka vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima in Hebrew sila khat pawpo sia kum luk sung na na uh hong sepsak zawkciang kum sali a cin simin na suaktasak tu uh hi ci in amate tungah ka son hi. Ahihang na taanghpupite in ka thu hong nadon bua uh a ka sawl bang hong mang bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu nung hiat ma in na thin na kheal uh a, ka diksakte nong seam uh hi. Na vekpi ma in Israel na mipuite sia suataksak tu na thukim uh a, keima hong kibiakna Biakinnpi sung ka mai ah thuciamna khat na vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang na thin uh na kheal leleau uh a, ka min nong daisak uh hi. Amate ii uukna bang a na suataksak sa uh silate sia note theampo in na la kik uh a, sila in na kai kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahikom keima, Topa in ka thu nong ni bua uh hi kong ci hi: na Israel mipuite suatakna na pia bua uh hi. Tua ahile pha mama hi, suatakna kong pia tu hi: tua suatakna sia ngal, natna le kialpi taw thina ahi hi. No tungah kong vawtna taw leitung mite theampo ka lausak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Judah te le Jerusalem uliante in kumpi inn sungah uliante, thiampite le lampuite theampo taw kikopin amate ii tum nii a sua khuital khat ii a phel niite kilaklaw ah lampaina taw in keima taw thuciamna khat a vawt uh hi. Ahihang amate in tua thuciamna palsat in thuciamna sung thu omte mang ngawl uh hi. Tua ahikom amate ii khuital tung a vawt bangin hi mite tungah ka vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate sia amate a thatlum nuam a ngalte ii khut sungah ka aap tu a, a luangte sia vacimte le ngamsate in ne tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Judah ngam Zedekiah kumpipa le a uliante zongh amate a thatlum nuamte ii khut sungah ka aap tu hi. Amate sia noma hong simna pan a tawlnga Babylon ngalkaphonpi khut sungah ka aap tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Keima in thu ka pia tu a, hi khuapi ah amate hong heak kik tu uh hi. Amate in tua khuapi simin la tu a, mei taw haltham tu uh hi. Keima in Judah ngam khuate sia kuama ii teen ngawlna sennealngam khat bang ka suaksak tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah ii tapa Jehoiakim sia Judah ngam ah kumpi a sep lai in, Topa in keima tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Rechab ii bee le phungte kungah va pai ta'n a paupui ta'n. Tuaciang Biakinnpi sung inndoi khat ah amate paipui in sapittui pia in,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciang Rechab ii bee le phungte a vekpi — (Habazziniah ii tapa ahi a dang Jeremiah ii tapa) Jaazaniah le a suapuipate theampo le a tapate theampo —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Biakinnpi ah ka paipui hi. Igdaliah ii tapa kamsaang Hanan ii nungzuite ii inndoi sungah amate ka paipui hi. Hi inndoi sia Biakinnpi sungah ulian thupi khat ahi, Shallum ii tapa Maaseiah ii inndoi tungah om a, ulian dangte ii inndoite taw zong kinai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciang sapittui taw a kidim hai le kuangte sia Rechab mite mai ah ka lui a, amate tungah, “Sapittui ne vun,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang amate in, “Sapittui ne ngawl khu hi. Ka taanghpupi uh Rechab ii tapa Jonadab in eima ih hizong ih suan ih paalte ahizong sapittui peuma ih ne ngei buahet tu hi hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in inn sa heak vun, lotho heak vun, sapithuan vawt heak vun ahibuale tuate lei heak vun hong ci lai hi. Kote khualmi bangin ka teenna uh hi ngam sungah ka om suak thei natu in puanbuk sungah ka ten tawntung natu thu hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jonadab ii kote thu hong hilna theampo ka zui uh hi. Koma mama in sapittui ka ne ngei bua uh a, ka zite, ka tapate, ka tanute zongh in a ne ngei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ko ten natu in inn ka sa bua uh a — puanbukte sungah teangin — sapithuante, lote, ahibuale an zongh ka nei bua uh hi. Kote taanghpupi Jonadab ii hong sawl theampo ka seam siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa in hi ngam a sim ciang Babylon le Syria ngalkaphonpite a pial tu in Jerusalem khua zot tu ka khensat uh hi. Tua hu in Jerusalem ah ka teang uh hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaciang Vaanglianbelpa Topa , Israel ii Pathian in, va pai ta'n a Judah mite le Jerusalem mite tungah “Keima, Topa in, banghangin ka thu ngai nuam ngawl a kong thupiakte mang nuam ngawl nu ziam ci in no kong dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sapittui neak ngawl natu in Jonadab ii a thupiak sia, a tu a tate in zui a, tuni ciang dong kuama in ne ngawl hi. No tungah kong sawson hangin, ka thu nong ni bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka naseam kamsaangte theampo kong puak tawntung zo a, na ngamtatna a siate kheal in a maan sia nasep natu hong son zo uh hi. Noma le na taanghpupite tungah kong piaksa ngam sungah na ten top thei natu uh in, pathian dangte bia ngawl, a na seam ngawlin na kidop natu uh thu hong hil khol hi. Ahihang note in ka thu nong ngai nuam bua uh a nong awlmawk bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jonadab ii tu le tate in a taanghpupite ii thupiakna mang uh hi, ahihang note in ka thu nong ni bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahikom tu in, Keima, Vaanglianbelpa Topa , Israel ii Pathian in no, Judah mite le Jerusalem mite tungah ka kamciamsa suksiatna theampo kong tungsak tu hi. Hi bangin note kong vawt tu hi, banghang ziam cile thu kong son ciang nong ngai bua uh a, kong sam ciang nong zo bua uh hi,” a ci teng a son tu in kei hong sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaciang, Vaanglianbelpa Topa, Israel ii Pathian in Rechab bee le phung tung ah, “Na taanghpupi Jonadab ii hong thupiak sia na mang zo uh a; hong thuhil nate theampo zui in, hong sawl theampo na seam zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahikom, Keima, Vaanglianbelpa Topa , Israel ii Pathian in a na a seam tu sia Rechab ii tapa Jonadab suan le paal pa khat nei tawntung tu in kong kamciam hi,” ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah ii tapa Jehoiakim ii Judah ngam kumpi a sua zawk a kum lina kumin, Topa in keima tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Laizial khat la in a tua tungah Israel le Judah le minamte theampo ii thu kong sonte at in. Josiah kumpi a sep lai in, na tungah kong son masak phit pan kipan tuni dong kong sonte theampo at in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah mite in amate susia tu a ka sawmna thute theampo a zaak uh ciang, a tatsiatnate panin kikheal tha tu uh hi. Tuasia ciang a seksolna le a maw a khialnate ka maisak tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Neriah ii tapa Baruch samin Topa ii ka tungah hong son te theampo at tu in ka khaw hi. Tuaciang Baruch in laizial sungah at siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciang keima in Baruch tungah a nuai ah kihilnate ka pia hi: “Keima in Biakinnpi sungah pai thei natu thu ka nga nawn bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang mipite ii antan kik hun ciangin tua munah nangma pai lete kong oai hi. Topa ii hong sonte le keima ii nang tungah kong khawte theampo amate ii a zaak thei natu in tua laizial sia nging takin nong sim tu hi. Mihing theampo, a khua tek pan hong pai Judah mite zongh ii hong zaak thei natu munah sim in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in a lauhuai thin uukna le a thinsona taw hi mihingte tawng zo ahikom amate in Topa tungah thu ngenin, a tatsiatnate panin kikheal thei tha tu uh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaciang Baruch in ka sawl bang tatak ma in Biakinnpi sungah Topa ii kammalte sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jehoiakim ii Judah kumpi a sep zawk a kum ngana, a tha kua tha in mihingte in Topa maipha nga nuam in antang uh hi. Jerusalem khua ah a teang theampo le Judah khuate pan hong pai theampo antang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua zawkciang mihingte theampo ii a ngai laitakin, laizial sungah a kikhum ka thusonte theampo Baruch in sim hi. Biakinnpi sung, Shaphan ii tapa, zum thuzeakpa Gemariah ii inndoi panin Baruch in sim hi. Ama inndoi sia Biakinnpi tumna Kongpi Thak kung a zum tung dawl ah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Baruch ii laizial sung pan Topa kammal a sim sia Gemariah tapa Shaphan ii tupa Micaiah in za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaciang Micaiah sia kumpi inn sung thuzeakpipa ii zum inndoi ah ulian theampo kikhop laitakin pai hi. Zum thu zeakpipa Elishama, Shemaiah ii tapa Delaiah, Achbor ii tapa Elnathan, Shaphan ii tapa Gemariah, Hananiah ii tapa Zedekiah le a dang uliante theampo tua munah om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Baruch ii mipite tungah a sim thu teng Micaiah in a zaak theampo amate tungah son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciang uliante in Jehudi (Nethaniah tapa, Shelemiah ii tupa le Cushi ii tu selawn) sia Baruch kungah paisak a, mipite tungah a sim laizial sia hong paipui natu in sonsak hi. Baruch in tua laizial sia amate kungah paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“To in a tua laizial sia ko hong sim ta'n” amate in ci uh hi. A ci bangin Baruch in sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Baruch in tualai a sim zawkciang amate patau a khat le khat ki en in Baruch tung ah, “Kumpipa munah hi thu ka son uh kul tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate in, “Tu in hong son ta'n, hite theampo bangbangin at thei ni ziam? Jeremiah in hong khaw ziam?” ci in Baruch dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Baruch in, “Jeremiah in kammal theampo hong khaw a, keima in hi laizial tungah laitui taw ka at hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate in Baruch tungah, “Nang le Jeremiah sia na buk uh kul tu hi. Na omna uh kuama in hesak heak vun,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Uliante in tua laizial sia zum thuzeakpa, Elishama ii inndoi sungah koi in, kumpipa zum ah pai in tua munah a thu a vekpi in kumpipa tungah ko uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuasia ciang tua laizial la tu in kumpipa in Jehudi sawl hi. Ama in Elishama ii a inndoi panin tua laizial la a, kumpipa le a kiim ah a ding uliante theampo a sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua hun sia phalbi hun lai hi a, kumpipa sia a phalbi kumpi inn sungah mei oai in to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jehudi in lai khawk thum khawk li bang a sim zawk po ciang, kumpipa in naamno khat taw tua laizial attan in meikhuk sungah lawn hi. Laizial buppi a kaktum dongin ama in meikhuk sungah hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahihang kumpipa ahizong hi thute theampo a za siat a uliante ahizong launa heena lim lak ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Elnathan, Delaiah le Gemariah in laizial a hal ngawl natu in hesuak ngen hi napi, kumpipa in amate bangma awlmawk ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua zawkciang kumpipa in keima le ka thuzeakpa Baruch man tu in kumpipa tapa Jerahmeel sia Azriel ii tapa Seraiah le Abdeel ii tapa Shelemiah taw zongh thupia khawm hi. Ahihang Topa in ko hong phual hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Baruch tungah ka khaw bangin a ki at laizial sia Jehoiakim kumpipa in a haltum zawkciang Topa in, keima
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />laizial dang khat la in, a masa laizial sungah a omte theampo tuasia sungah at tu in hong sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Topa in kumpipa tungah hi bangin ci ta'n ci in kei hong sawl hi, “Laizial na haltum zo hi, tuaciang Jeremiah tungah, Babylon kumpipa hong pai tu a, hi ngam susia in a mite le a ngannote thatlum tu hi ci in banghangin at ni ziam ci in dongh zo ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ahikom Topa Keima in tu in nang Jehoiakim kumpipa tungah David ii kumpi ngam sia na suan na paalte kuama in uk ngeingawl tu hi kong ci hi. Na luang sia sunin nisa, zanin daaitui thuak tu in kivawk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na vekpi na vawt uh mawna khialnate hu in nangma, na suan na paalte le na uliante daan kong pia tu hi. Nang na hi zong, Jerusalem le Judah mite ahizong, kidop natu kong son te nong nadon bua uh hi. Tua ahikom kong tawnkhol sa tuasiatna sia na vekpi tungah kong tungsak tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuaciang laizial dang khat la in ka thuzeakpa Baruch tungah ka pia a, ka khaw theampo ama in at hi. Laizial masa sia sungah a om sate theampo le ama tungah ka khaw a kibang thute zongh ama in khum siat hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in Josiah ii tapa Zedekiah sia Jehoiakim ii tapa Jehoiachin taangin Judah ngam kumpi in koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahihang Zedekiah, a uliante le mipite in Topa ii ka tungah thu hong piak sia mang nuam ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ih minam luangin Topa ih Pathian tungah keima sia thungen tu hong sawl tu in, Zedekiah kumpipa in Shelemiah ii tapa Jehucal le Maaseiah ii tapa thiampi Zephaniah hong paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualai hunin thong sungah kei hong kikhum ngawl lai a, mihonpite sungah ka vak kawkoai thei lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Babylon ngalkaphonpi in Jerusalem kiim uum zo uh hi, ahihang Egypt ngalkaphonpi in Egypt ngamngi kaantan zo hi ci thu a zaak uh ciang amate nungkin kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Topa , Israel ii Pathian in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zedekiah tungah son tu in hi bangin keima hong sawl hi, “Egypt ngalkaphonpi sia nangma hong hu tu in hong pai a, ahihang a ngam ah heak kik tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Babylon te hong pai kik tu a, Jerusalem khuapi simin, la in, mei taw haltum tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Babylon te hong pai kik nawn ngawl tu hi ci a na ngaisut thak ngawl natu, noma le noma na kitheam ngawl natu, Keima, Topa in kidop natu thu kong hilkhol hi, banghang ziam cile amate hong pai kik nanak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Babylon ngalkap buppi na zo zong, a taanglai a liamte bekma puanbuk sungah lum lai ahi hial uh zong, tuate ma hong thoto veve tu a, hi khuapi haltum tu uh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Egypt ngalkaphonpite hong nai hu in Babylon ngalkaphonpi sia Jerusalem pan nungkin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka inn kuan neisa teng sung pan ka nga tu ka tel la tu in Jerusalem khua pan dingin Benjamin ngam ah ka pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang Benjamin Kongpi ka thet ciang tualai ah kongpi cing ngalkapte a uk bupa, Shelemiah ii tapa, Hananiah ii tupa Irijah in ka pai tu hong khaam a, “Babylon te kungah a taiku hi ngawl ni ziam?” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tuabang hi ngawl hi! Tai ku ngawl khi hi,” ci in ka zo hi. Ahihang Irijah in ka thuson hong ngai bua hi. Ama in kei hong manin uliante kungah hong paipui zawsap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate ka tungah thin uuk mama in hong saatsak in zum thuzeakpa Jonathan ii inn, thonginn a, a kivawt inn sia sungah hong khum in taw hong kalhcip uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Leinuai inndoi khat sungah kei hong khum a, tua munah khuangei hialma hong koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Zedekiah kumpipa in keima hong sam a, kumpi inn sungah ama in, “ Topa kung panin bang thu hong pai ziam?” ci in kei hong dongh tuam hi. “Thu om hi” ci in ka zo a, “Nang sia Babylon kumpipa khut sungah hong ki aap tu hi,” ci in ka son belap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua zawkciang keima in, “Thong sungah nong khum natu in nangma tungah ahizong na uliante tungah ahizong, hi mipite tungah ahizong bang khialna lian vawt khi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa in nang le hi ngam hong sim ngawl tu hi ci a, nang tungah hong son, na kamsaangte bang tat ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu in Kumpipa awng, ka thu son nong ngai natu le kong nget sia nong vawtsak natu in hesuak kong ngen hi. Nong hesuakna in Jonathan ii inn thong sungah hong puak kik heak in. Nong puak kik ahile, tua munah thi takpi tu khi hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahikom Zedekiah kumpipa in kumpi innhuang sungah kei hong kikhum natu in thu hong pia hi. Tua munah ka om a, khua sungah anluum a bo siat dong ni simin anluum lum khat veu anluum vawtna panin kei hong kipia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mattan ii tapa Shephatiah, Pashhur ii tapa Gedaliah, Shelemiah ii tapa Jehucal, le Malchiah ii tapa Pashhur te in mipite tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in, “Khuapi sungah a om suak peuma ngal taw ahibuale kialpi taw, ahibuale natna taw in thi tu uh hi. Ahihang pusuak in Babylon te khut sungah a tum pawpo kithatlum ngawl tu a; a nuntakna beak peuma suatak tu hi, ci hi,” ci a ka son sia za uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in, “Keima in hi khuapi sia Babylon ngalkaphonpi khut sungah ka pia tu a, amate in la tu uh hi,” a ci sia zongh amate tungah ka son si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua zawkciang uliante sia kumpipa kungah pai in, “Hisia pa thisak kul tu hi. Hi bang a, a pau hu in khuapi sungah a om ngalkapte le khuapi sungah a taanglai midangte theampo sia thin kiamsak uh hi. Ama in mihingte hu tu hanciam ngawl a; nasak nuam bek hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zedekiah kumpipa in, “Tua ahile pha mama hi. Na vawt nop bang po in ama vawt vun; hong khak thei ngawl khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaciang amate in kei hong paipui a, kumpi innhuang sungah a om, kumpipa tapa Malchaiah ii tuikhuk sungah khau taw hong khiasuk uh hi. Tuikhuk sungah tui om ngawlin, buan bek om a, tua buan sungah ka tumsuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahitazong, kumpi inn sungah na a seam Ethiopia mi cilnge sa Ebedmelech in amate ii tuikhuk sungah hong khiak thu za hi. Tua laitakin kumpipa sia Benjamin Kongpi ah thukhen a, a to laitak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahikom Ebemelech sia tua munah pai in kumpipa tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Kumpipa awng, hi mihingte ngamta khial hi. Amate in Jeremiah sia tuikhuk sungah khia uh a, tua munah ngilkial in thi tu hi, banghang ziam cile khua sungah an om nawn ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaciang kumpipa in Ebedmelech sia mihing thum taw paikhawmsak a, ka thi ma in tuikhuk sung pan keima hong laak kik natu in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua hikom Ebedmelech sia tua mihingte taw kumpipa inn sung vanh kholna inndoi ah pai a puansia pawlkhat la in, keima omna tuikhuk sungah tuate khau taw hong khiaksuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khau ii hong hiat ngawl natu in ama in ka lenuai ah puansia dapin hong sawl hi. Hong sawl bangin ka vawt a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tuasia ciang amate in tuikhuk sung panin kei hong kaito in hong pusua hi. Tua zawkciang kumpi innhuang sungah kei hong keam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khatvei ciang in Zedekiah kumpipa in Biakinnpi tumna a thumna sia ah hong sam a, ama in “Thu khat kong dongh tu a, thumaan sia hong son siat lete ka oai hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima in, “Thumaan sia hong son leng, nong that tu a, ngaisutna hong pia leng le, nong ngai buatu hi,” ci in ka zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Zedekiah kumpipa in, “Nang kong that buatu a, nang hong that nuam mite khut sungah kong aap buatu hi ci in eite nuntakna hong pia Pathian, a nungta Pathian min taw ka kiciam hi,” ci in hong kamciam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Zedekiah tungah Vaanglianbelpa Topa Israel ii Pathian in, “Babylon kumpipa ii uliante khutnuai ah na tum le, na nuntakna hong kikhoaikhe tu a, hi khuapi kihaltum ngawl tu hi. Nangma le na innkuanpuite kikhoaikhe khawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahihang na tum bua le, hi khuapi sia Babylon te khut sungah ki aap tu a, amate in haltum in amate ii khut sung panin na suakta buatu hi,” a ci teng ka son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahihang kumpipa in, “Babylon te kungah a tai ih ngammite ka kiita hi. Amate ii khut sungah kei hong ki aap thei tu a, hong vawtsia tu uh hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keima in, “Nang sia amate khut sungah hong ki aap ngawl tu hi. Topa ii thupuak sia na nit natu in hesuak kong ngen hi; tua hile na theampo nang atu in pha tu a, na nuntakna hong kikhoaikhe tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahihang a khutnuai ah na tum nuam buale bang hong piang tu ci sia Topa in ka mukholna sungah hong lak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ka mukholna ah Judah kumpi inn sungah a kinusia numeite theampo Babylon kumpipa ii uliante kungah a kipaipui ka mu hi. Amate a pai kawmin, a thusonte ngai vun: ‘Kumpipa ii lawm phabelte in ama lampui khial a, amate in ama zothaw hi. Tuaciang tu in ama peangte buan sungah tumsuk zo a, a lawmte in ama nusia zo uh hi,’ ci uh hi.” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua zawkciang keima in, “Na zite le na tate theampo sia Babylon te kungah kipaipui tu a, nang zongh na suakta buatu hi. Nang sia Babylon kumpipa in thong hong taksak tu a, hi khuapi sia mei taw kihaltum tu hi,” ka ci lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zedekiah in, “Hi ih kipaupuina thute kuama in hesak heak in, tua hile na nuntakna lauhuai ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nang taw thu ka son hunlam uliante in hong za thong le, amate hong pai in ih thusonte hong dongh tu uh hi. A vekpi in nong son le kong that buatu hi ci in amate in hong kamciam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thong sungah a thi tu in hong puak kik ngawl natu in ka ngen hi ci bek po in,” ci in hong zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua zawkciang uliante theampo hong pai in thu hong dongh a, kumpipa hong sawl bang tatak ma in amate tungah ka son hi. Amate ii vawt thei tu bangma dang om ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile ka kipaupuina hong za ku kuama om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jerusalem khua a kilaak ni dong kumpi innhuang sungah kei hong keam hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zedekiah ii Judah kumpi a sua zawk a kum kuana, a tha sawm tha in Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar sia a ngalkap buppi taw hong pai in Jerusalem sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zedekiah ii kumpi a sua zawk kum sawm le kum khatna, a tha li tha, ni kua ni in khuapi luphungte kisulet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />(Jerusalem khuapi a kilaak ciang Babylon kumpipa ii uliante theampo hong pai in Kongpi Laita ah mun hong la uh hi. Tuate sungah Nergal Sarezer, Samgar Nebo, Sarsechim le Nergal Sarezer dangkhat kihel hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zedekiah kumpipa le a ngalkapte theampo in a piang thu a mu uh ciang zanlai in khuapi pan a suatak natu hanciam uh hi. Amate sia kumpi huan sung lam tawnin luphungte ngeal kikawnna kongpi lam tawnin, Jordan Kuam sangah suakta uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang Babylon ngalkaphonpi in delin Jericho khua nai zaangtam ah Zedekiah man uh hi. Tuasia ciang amate in Zedekiah sia Hamath ngamsung Riblah khua ah a om Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa kungah paipui uh a, tua munah Nebuchadnezzar in ama tungah thukhen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Riblah khua ah Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa in Zedekiah ii mu tang ma in a tapate thatlum a, Judah ngam kumpi uliante zongh thatlumsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Zedekiah ii mittangte khelsak a, Babylon ah paipui tu in kol bulsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua hun sung ma in Babylon te in kumpi inn le mipite ii innte haltum a Jerusalem khua luphungte sutham uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A khakbel in ngalkap hon ukpa, Nebuzaradan in khuapi sungah a taanglai mite sia ama kung a zuan teng taw Babylon ah thongtaak tu in paipui khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in bangma nei ngawl a, a zawngkhalbel mihing pawlkhat sia Judah ngam ah nusia in sapithuante le lote pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa in a nuai a thute a piak natu in ngalkap hon ukpa, Nebuzaradan tungah thupia hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Pai in Jeremiah na mu ciang pha takin keam in. Vawtsia heak in, a dei pawpo vawtsak in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahikom Nebuzaradan in kumpi uliante Nebushazban le Nergal Sarezer le Babylon kumpipa ii ulian dangte theampo taw
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />kumpi innhuang sung panin kei hong la uh hi. Amate in Shaphan ii tupa, Ahikam ii tapa Gedaliah kungah, keima inn ah ngam muang takin hong thet natu le pha tak hong kep tu in hong aap uh hi. Tuabangin tua mun ah om mite sungah ka teang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpi innhuang sungah thong hong kitaaksak lai in, Vaanglianbelpa Topa , Israel ii Pathian in hi bangin a ci teng sia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ethiopia mi Ebedmelech tungah a son tu in Topa in kei hong sawl hi. “Ka vawt tu hi ka ci bangin hi khuapi tungah nopsakna ahi ngawl siatna ka tungsak tu hi. Hi bangin hong pian ciang a mu tu in tua munah na om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahihang Keima, Topa in nang kong dal tu a, na kiitak mihingte khut sungah hong ki aap ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang sia kong keamcing tu a, hong kithatlum ngawl tu hi. Kei hong muang na hikom na nuntakna suakta tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka ci zo hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngalkap mangpa Nebuzaradan in Ramah khua ah kei hong suatak zawkciang, Topa in kei hong paupui hi. Keima sia kol bul sa in, Babylon ah luangta tu in a kipaipui Jerusalem le Judah pan midangte theampo taw tua mun ah hong kipaipui khawm zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngalkap mangpa in keima hong sam tuam a, “Na Topa Pathian in hi ngam sia suksiat tu in tawng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ama in ka vawt tu hi a ci sia tu in vawt zo hi. Na mite in Topa tungah mawna vawtin a thu ni ngawl a hi hu in hite theampo piang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu in na khut ah a kibul kolte kong suutsak tu a kong thaa tu hi. Keima taw Babylon ah na pai nuam le na pai thei a, nang kong keam tu hi. Ahihang na pai nuam buale pai kul ngawl hi. Hi ngam buppi sungah na uukna mun teal in, na uukna po ah pai thei ni hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangma zo kik ngawl a ka om ciang, Nebuzaradan in, “Babylon kumpipa ii Judah ngam khuate uk tu in a koi ngamkhen ukpa Shaphan ii tupa, Ahikam ii tapa Gedaliah ii kungah pai kik ta'n. Ama taw om ta'n a, a mite sungah teang thei ni hi, tua ahibuale na pai nopna mun po ah pai thei ni hi,” hong ci hi. Tua zawkciang ama in letsong khat le nguai an hong henin ka pai nopna ah hong paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mizpah ah Gedaliah taw om tu in ka pai a, ngam sungah a taanglai mite sungah ka teang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Judah ngalkapmang pawlkhatte le ngalkapte sia a ngalte khut sungah tum ngawl uh hi. Babylon kumpipa in Gedaliah sia ngamkhen ukpa tu in koi zo a, Babylon ah a kipaipui ngawl theampo — ngamsung pan a zawngbel mite teng uk tu in a kikoina thu amate in za uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Nathaniah ii tapa Ishmael, Kareah ii tapa Johanan, Tanhumeth ii tapa Seraiah, Netophah pan Ephai ii tapate le Maacah pan Jezaniah sia a mite taw Mizpah khua ah a om Gedaliah kungah pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gedaliah in amate tungah, “Babylon te nuai ah na tum tu uh sia lau kul ngawl hi kong ci hi. Hi ngam sungah teangin Babylon kumpipa ii na seam le uhte no atu in pha siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima mama Mizpah ah ka teang tu a, Babylon te hi munah hong pai ciangin noma taangmi ka hi tu hi. Ahihang sapittui, thingnga le olive sathaute khawmin khol vun a, na laak uh khuate ah teang vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuasia hunin Moab ngam, Ammon ngam, Edom ngam le ngamdangte ah a om Israel te theampo in Babylon kumpipa ii Israel te pawlkhat Judah ngam sungah a teen suaksakna thu le Gedaliah sia a ngam khen ukpa in a koina thu za uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahi manin, amate sia a kithethaang na ngamte nusia in Judah ngam ah cia kik uh hi. Amate Mizpah khua Gedaliah kungah pai in, tua munah sapittui le thingnga tam mama khawmtua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hisia zawkciang a tum nuam ngawl Johanan le ngalkapte ii lampuite sia Mizpah khua Gedaliah kungah pai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ama tungah, “Ammon kumpipa Baalis in nangma hong suam tu in Ishmael hong paisak sia he ngawl ni ziam?” ci hi. Ahihang Gedaliah in tua thu um ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Johanan in ama tungah, “Keima hong paisak ta'n a Ishmael hong thatsak ta'n, tua hile a that sia pa kuama in he ngawl tu hi. Banghangin ama in nang hong suam thei thong tu ziam? Nang hong kisuam le tua in na kiim ah hong kikhawm Jew mite theampo kithethaangsak tu a, Judah ngam ah a taanglai mite theampo ii tungah tuasiatna thengsak tu hi,” ci ku hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang Gedaliah in, “Tua sia hi heak in! Ishmael thu na son sia maan ngawl hi!” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua kum a tha sali tha in, kumpi innkuan sung pan le kumpipa ii a ulianbelte sung pan khat ahi, Elishama ii tupa, Nethaniah ii tapa Ishmael sia mihing sawm taw Mizpah ah Gedaliah taw kimu tu in pai uh hi. Amate teng an a neakkhop laitakin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ishmael le tua mihing sawmte in a namsau uh dokin Gedaliah thatlum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ishmael in Mizpah khua Gedaliah kungah a om Israel mite theampo le Babylon ngalkap tua munah a omte zongh thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A zing ciang, Gedaliah a kisuamlupna thu kuama heak ma in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Shechem, Shiloh le Samaria panin mihing sawmliat hong theng uh hi. Amate sia a khamul uh meetin a puan uh eaukeak in, amate le amate tetek kiliamsua ngawp uh hi. Amate in Biakinnpi ah piak tu in antang le paaknamtui keng uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom Ishmael sia amate muak tu in Mizpah panin kap kawkawm in pai hi. Amate kung a thet ciang Ishmael in, “Gedaliah en tu in hong tum ka ve vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khuapi sung a tum po uh ciang, Ishmael le a mite in amate thatin a luang uh tuikhuk khat sungah vawk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang amate ii pawlsung panin mihing sawm in Ishmael tungah, “Ko hong that heak in! Zungtaang, mangtaang, olive thau le khuaitui lo lai ah phual ku nei khu hi,” ci hi. Tua ahikom Ishmael in amate khoaikhe hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ishmael ii thalup mithi luangte a vawkna tuikhuk sia Israel kumpipa Baasha ii Asa kumpipa a sim lai a, Asa kumpipa ii taw tuikhuk lian khat sia ahi hi. Ishmael in tua tuikhuk sia mithi luang taw kidimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Gedaliah ii kep tu in ngalkap maang pa Nebuzaradan ii a koi, kumpipa tanute le Mizpah khua ah a om lai mite theampo sia Ishmael in thongtaaksak hi. Ishmael ii thong a taaksak tua mite Ammon ngam sang zot pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Johanan le ama taw a omkhawm ngalkap lampuite theampo in Ishmael ii khialna lian a vawtna thu za uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuasia hu in amate sia a mite taw ama del a Gideon tuili pui hui ah pha uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ishmael ii mat thongtaakte in Johanan le ama taw hong paikhawm ngalkap lampuite a mu uh ciang a lungdam in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />amate sang kiheak in tai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang Ishmael le a mihing liatte sia Johanan khut sung panin tai in, Ammon ngam ah suakta uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Ishmael ii Gedaliah a thalup zawkciang Mizpah pan thongtaak a, a paipuite — ngalkapte, numeite, patangte le kumpi inn naseam, numei uk pasal cilnge sate sia Johanan le ama taw a om ngalkap lampui te in uk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa ii ngamkhen uk in a koi Gedaliah sia Ishmael in suamlum ahikom amate in Babylon te kiita uh hi. Tua ahikom amate sia Babylon te taw a kipeal thei natu in Egypt ngam ah tai uh hi. Amate sia a paina lampi Bethlehem khua hui Chimham ah tawlnga uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ngalkap lampuite theampo, Kareah ii tapa Johanan le Heshaiah ii tapa Azariah le mihonte a lian a no ka kungah hong pai uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Kong nget uh sia hong vawtsak ta'n! Topa ih Pathian tungah kote atu in thu hong ngetsak ta'n. A nungta lai kote theampo atu in thu hong ngetsak ta'n. Khatvei lai in mihing tam mama ka hi uh a; tu ahile nangma nong mu bangin mihing tawmno bek ma ka taang lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kote pai natu lampi le ko ii sep tu nate Topa ih Pathian in hong lak natu in thu hong ngetsak ta'n,” hong ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima in, “Tua ahile pha mama hi. Nong nget uh bangin Topa ih Pathian tungah thu ka ngen tu a, ama ii hong ci babang kong son tu hi. Bangma kong iim buatu hi,” ci in ka zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuasia ciang amate in keima tungah, “Ko atu a Topa ih Pathian ii hong thupiakte theampo ka ni bua uh le Topa sia ko ii lang ah thumaan le thutak tetti hi tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Koma dik ka sa a dik ka sa bua uh zong ama ii tungah thungetsak tu in kong sawl uh Topa, ih Pathian ii thu ka ni tu uh hi. Ama ii thu ka ni uhle ka mai uh vangin pha tu hi,” hong ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ni sawm zawkciang Topa in kei hong paupui hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tua ahikom keima in Johanan, a ompui ngalkap lampui te theampo le mihing dang teng taw ka sam khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keima in amate tungah, “A kungah hesuak ngetna taw nong puak na pa ahi Topa Israel ii Pathian in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘Hi ngam ah na teang suak nuam uh le, kong laamto tu a, kong lalsak buatu hi; kong phut tu a, kong phaikeak buatu hi. Siatna kong thetsak sia in hong heesak mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa kiita nawn heak vun. Noma kong ompui a, ama khut sung panin kong suatak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keima sia a hesuak thei pa ka hi manin, ama in no tungah hesuak theina ka neisak tu a, na inn le lo ah hong ciasak kik tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ahihang Judah ngam sungah a taanglai note in Topa na Pathian na nial buatu uh a, hi ngam ah ten tu na nial peuma buatu uh hi. Noma in, ‘Hi ngawl hi, ngal kido nawn ngawlna, ngalsim tu kithotna aw zaak nawn ngawlna ahibuale ngilkial ngawlna mun ahi, Egypt ngam ah pai in ka teang tu uh hi.’ na ci bua het tu uh hi. Hi bangin na ci uh le Vaanglianbelpa Topa , Israel ii Pathian in, ‘Egypt ah pai in teen tu na tum tatak uh le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />na kiitak uh ngal in no hong pha tu a, na kiitak uh kialpi in hong zui in, tua mun Egypt ah na thi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Egypt ngam ah tai a, teen tatak tu a sawm mihingte theampo sia ngal ahibuale kialpi ahibuale natna taw thi tu uh hi. Khat zongh nungta ngawl tu a, amate tungah ka thetsak tu tuasiatna sia taw khat zong kipeal thei ngawl tu hi,’ hong ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“ Topa , Israel, ii Pathian in, ‘Ka thin uukna le ka thinsona Jerusalem khua mite tungah a kibuak bangma in, Egypt ngam ah na pai uh le ka thinsona sia note tungah hong kibuak tu hi. Midangte ii hong muna ah a cizathuai na suak tu uh hi; Mite in note ciammuina in hong nei tu a na min uh sia haamsiatna in zang tu uh hi. Hi mun sia na mu kik ngei nawn buatu uh hi,’ ci hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaciang ka zomto lai a, “ Topa in Judah ngam ah a taang lai note, Egypt ngam ah na pai ngawl natu in hong son zo hi. Tua ahikom tu in na kidop natu uh pan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />na pai uh ahile thithei natu dongin a khial na hi tu uh hi. Noma atu in Topa ih Pathian tungah thungetsak tu in nong sawl uh a, ama ii hong thupiak theampo seam tu in kamciam nong pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tu in no tungah kong son zo hi, ahihang Topa ih Pathian in hong sonsak theampo na ni bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahikom, hi thu ciamtee vun: noma pai nopna le ten nopna ngam ah ngal ahibuale ngilkialna, ahi buale natna taw in na thi tu uh hi,” ci in ka son hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa , amate ii Pathian in amate tungah a vekpi a son tu in hong thataak keima in mipite tungah ka son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaciang Hoshaiah ii tapa Azariah le Kareah ii tapa Johanan le a kisa thei midangte theampo in kei tungah, “Leilot ni hi. Topa ih Pathian in kote Egypt ngam ah pai a ka teen ngawl natu uh hong son tu in nang hong sawl ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Babylon te in ko hong zothaw tu a, hong that thei ahibuale Babylon khua ah hong paipui thei natu in Neriah ii tapa Baruch in ko hong langpan in, nang hong thawn hi,” hong ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahikom Judah ngam sungah om tu a Topa ii thupiak sia, Johanan hikale ngalkapbu te hikale mipite hikale khat zongh in ni ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciang Johanan le ngalkapbu te theampo in Judah ngam ah a taanglai teng peuma sia, a kithethaang na ngamte pan hong heak kik mihingte theampo taw Egypt ngam ah paipui uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tua hong heakkikte sia pasalte, numeite, patangte le kumpipa ii tanute ahi uh hi. Amate in ngalkap hon ukpa Nebuzaradan ii Gedaliah kep tu a, a nusiat mihingte theampo le Baruch le keima zong hong paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in Topa ii thupiak sia ni ngawlin Egypt ngam Tahpanhes khua ciang dong pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua munah Topa in ka tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Suangtum lian pawlkhat la in a, hi khuapi sung kumpi zum inn tumna mai lampi hui a, a kipha suang ii nuai ah phum in; tuabang na vawt sia Israel mi pawlkhat in musak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, Vaanglianbelpa Topa Israel ii Pathian, keima in, ka naseam Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar sia hi munah kong puak tu a, ama in tua na phum suangtumte tungah a kumpi tokhum koi tu hi, a kumpi puanbuk sia tuate ii tung ma ah phalh tu hi, ci sia amate tungah son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar hong pai tu a, Egypt zo tu hi. Natna taw thi tu in a see sa tua mihingte sia natna taw thi tu a, thong a tak tu in a kisee sate thongtaak tu a, tuaciang ngal sungah kithat tu in a kisee sate, ngal sungah kithat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Egypt te pathiante ii biakinn teng mei taw ka hal tu a, tuaciang Babylon kumpipa in a pathiante mei taw hal, ahibuale pua in paipui tu hi. Tuucing pa in a puan tung pan khate vawkin a thiansak bangin, Babylon kumpipa in Egypt ngam thiangsak tu a, tua zawkciang ngalzo in cia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in Egypt ngam Heliopolis khua a, khansuang thiangthote susia tu a, Egypt pathiante ii biakinnte haltum tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Egypt ngamsung Migdol, Tahpanhes, Memphis khuapite le Egypt ngam thang sangah a teang Israel te theampo taw kisai in Topa in kei tungah thu hong son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa Israel ii Pathian in, “Jerusalem khuapi tung le Judah ngam khuapi dangte theampo ii tungah suksiatna ka thetsak sia noma mama in na mu zo uh hi. Tua khuapite sia tu dong ma in siacip lai a, kuama teang ngawl hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />banghang ziam cile tua khua mite in a sia vawtin ka thin hong uksak uh hi. Amate ahizong noma na hi uh zong, na taanghpupite ahizong ii biak ngeingawl pathian dangte tungah amate in biakpiakna pia in a na seam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka naseam kamsaangte note kungah tatsat ngawlin kong paisak a, amate in ka ngaimawk a lauhuai, hi na sia na vawt ngawl natu in note hong son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang note in ngai ngawlin nadon ngawl nu hi. Pathian dangte tungah a sia biakpiakna na vawt uh sia na kheal nuam bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom ka thin uukna le ka thinsona sia Judah ngam khuate le Jerusalem lampite tungah ka buak a, tuate sia mei taw ka hal hi. Tuni a na mu uh bangma in tuate sia a kisiacip in om a, a lipkhaphuai suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tua ahikom Vaanglianbelpa Topa , Israel ii Pathian keima in, banghang tuabang thusia khat noma le noma tungah vawt nu ziam ci in tu in kong dongh hi. Na mite kuama a kikheet ngawl natu in, pasal, numei, patang le nausente tungah siatna thengsak nuam nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A teang tu in na thetna uh hi Egypt ngamah, na milim biakna le a dang pathiante tungah na biakpiakna uh taw in banghangin kei hong thin uuksak nu ziam? Leitung minam theampo in no hong nunau natu le kihaamsiatna in na min a zak natu in noma le noma na kisiatsak natu bekin hisia vawt nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Judah ngam khuate sung le Jerusalem khua lampi tungah na taanghpupite, Judah kumpite le a zite, noma le na zite ii a sia theampo na vawt uh sia mangil zo nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahihang tuni dong ciang noma le noma na kiniamkhiak bua uh hi. Keima zatakna nong nei bua uh a, noma le na taanghpupite tungah kong piak thukham theampo bangin na nungta bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tua ahikom, Vaanglianbelpa Topa Israel ii Pathian keima in, note kong langpan tu a Judah ngam theampo ka susia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A taanglai Judah mite, Egypt ngam ah pai in teen tatak tu a thin khensat teng sia ka lalcipsak siat tu hi. A lian a no amate a vekpi in Egypt ngam ah ngalsung ahibuale kialpi taw in thi tu uh hi. Amate sia mihingte muna ah a lauhuai suak tu uh hi, amate kinunau tu a, a min uh kihaamsiatna in zangh tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem daan ka piak bangma in Egypt ngam ah a teang mihingte ngal, kialpi le natna taw in daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Judah mi a taanglai, Egypt ngam ah teang tu a hong paite kuama suakta ngawlin nungta ngawl tu uh hi. Khatvei a ten kik nopna mun Judah ngam ah kuama heak kik ngawl tu uh hi. Ngaltai tawmno simngawl kuama heak kik ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaciang a zite in pathian dangte tungah biakpiakna a nei hunlam a he pasal theampo le tua munah a ding numei theampo a kipan Egypt ngam thang sangah a teang Israel te — tua mihonpi in — keima tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“ Topa min suangin thu nong sonte hong ngai nuam ngawl khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vawt tu ka cite theampo ka vawt tu uh hi. Koma le ka taanghpupite, kumpipa le lampuite in Judah ngam khuate le Jerusalem khua lampite ah ka vawt ngei uh bangma in, kote numeipathian Vantung Kumpinu tungah sangaw biakpiakna pia in, ama tungah biakpiakna sapittui ka buak tu uh hi. Tuasia ciang an hau in, nuamsa in, ngimna ka nei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahihang Vantung Kumpinu tungah sangaw biakpiakna nei nawn ngawl a, biakpiakna sapittui ka buak nawn ngawl uh hun pan kipan bangma ka nei nawn bua uh hi, ka mite sia ngal le kialpi taw in thi uh hi,” hong ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaciang numeite in, “Vantung Kumpinu ii lim taw kibang moh vawt a, biakpiakna pia in sapittui ama tungah ka buak uh ciang koma ngamtatna sia ka pasalte a lungkim uh hi,” ci lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ka pauna hi bang a hong zo kik pasalte le numeite theampo ii tungah keima in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Noma le no ii taanghpupite, kumpipate le lampuite, ngamsung mipite vawt Judah khuate le Jerusalem khua lampite tungah na biakpiakna uhte Topa in he ngawl ahibuale a mangilin ngaisun nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuni mama in na ngam uh sia a lalcip sa in om a, a sungah kuama teang ngawl hi. Na seksolna uh le a sia na vawtna uhte Topa in thuak zo nawn ngawl ahikom na ngam uh sia a lipkhaphuai mun suak a mihingte in a min sia kihaamsiatna in nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa ii hong thupiakte theampo ni ngawlin ama tungah na maw uh hang le milim pathian dangte tungah biakpiakna na piak uh hu in hi bang tuasiatna no tungah hong theng hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Keima in mihingte theampo, a tuan in numeite tung ah, Egypt ngamsung a teang Judah mite tungah Vaanglianbelpa Topa , Israel ii Pathian ii a ci sia ka son hi: “Noma le na zite in Vantung Kumpinu kungah a ciliap huai kamciamte na pia zo uh hi. Ama ii tungah sangaw biakpiaknate le biakpiakna sapittui na buak natu in na kamciam zo a, tua kamciam len tu in na kamciam zo uh hi. Tua ahile, pha hi! Na kamciam uh len vun! Noma kamciam bangin seam vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahihang Keima, Topa in Egypt ngam ah a teang no Israel mite theampo tungah a vaanglian ka min taw kamciam ka piak sia, tu in ngai vun: ‘A nungta Vaanglianpipa Topa taw ka kiciam hi!’ ci in note khat pawpo kiciam natu in ka min kong zanghsak kik ngei buatu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Note a nuamsa ngawlin kong vawt tu hi, bek dom ngawlin kong susia tu hi. Note khat zongh kikhe ngawlin, ngal taw ahizong, natna taw ahizong na lalcip tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahihang note tawm bek thina pan na suakta tu uh a, Egypt ngam panin Judah ngam ah na heak kik tu uh hi. Tuasia ciang a nungta laiteng in akua ii kammal sia taangtung zo a maan ziam, keima kammal maw, amate ii kammal, ci sia he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi munah daan kong pia tu a, tuaciang note tungah siatna kong thengsak tu hi ci a ka kamciam sia a taangtun takpi na Keima, Topa in note kong lak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Judah Kumpipa Zedekiah sia ama a thatlum nuam a ngalpa Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar tungah ka aap bangma in, Egypt kumpipa Hophra sia ama a thatlum nuam a ngalte khut sungah ka aap tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah ii tapa Jehoiakim ii Judah ngam kumpi a sua zawk a kum lina kum in Baruch in ama tungah ka khaw bangin lai at hi. Tuaciang keima in ama tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa Israel ii Pathian in hi bangin ci hi, “Baruch awng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘kei paw cimaw zo ing! Topa in ka haksatnate khuangaina taw hong belap hi. Ka tatauna taw ka ngim zo a ka toi thai thei ngawl hi!’ na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ahihang, Keima, Topa in ka sak sate ka baltham tu a ka phu sate ka botkeak tu hi. Leitung buppi sia hi bangin ka vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang atu a tuam vilvel a hong kivawt natu zong na hi ziam? Zong heak in! Mihing nam buppi tungah siatna ka thengsak tu a, ahihang nang sia na paina po ah thi ngawlin na suakta valiai tu hi. Keima Topa in ka ci zo hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />5 Topa in minamte ii thu ka tungah hong son a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Egypt ii thu taw in hong pan hi. Jehoiakim ii Judah kumpi a sua zawk a kum lina kumin Eupharates ngunhui Carchemish ah Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar ii a zaw Egypt kumpipa Neco ii ngalkaphonpi thu sia Topa in hi bangin ci hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Egypt ngalkapbu te au in, ‘Na lumte kinging vun a, ngalsim na ah kuan vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na siphute kamkhau thua vun a, a tungah to vun! A ngui in kingual vun a na thik lukhute khu vun! Na teite taat vun! Na thik puante silh vun!’ ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in “Ahihang keima in bang mu khi ziam?” ci in dongh hi. “Amate lau in heak kik uh hi. A ngalkapte kinot kik hi; a ngalte kiita mama ahikom a ngang thei zaza in tai a, a nungsang en kik ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A manlang a taite zongh taisuak thei ngawl a; a ngalkapte suakta zo ngawl uh hi. Saksang, Euphrates ngun hui ah amate lutu in puk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nile ngun bangin khang a, ngunvaal leet a, a pawm bang ahi sia akua ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nile ngun bangin khang a, ngunvaal leet bang a, a pawm sia Egypt ahi hi. Egypt in, ‘Ka khangto tu a, leitung ka khuum tu hi; khuapite le khuapi sungah a teang mihingte ka susia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Siphute a pai natu le siphu ngalleangte a mui a pei natu thupia vun! Ngalkapte kuansak vun: Ethiopia le Libya pan lum toaite le, Lydia mi thalkaap thiamte kuansak vun’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuni sia Vaanglianpipa Topa , Vaanglianbelpa ii ni hi: tuni in ama in phula tu hi; tuni in ama in a ngalte daan pia tu hi. A namsau in a kham dong amate ne tu a, a lungkim dong a chi dawn tu hi. Tuni in Vaanglianbelpa in saksang Euphrates ngunhui ah a ngalmatte biakpiakna in nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Egypt mite awng, Gilead ah pai vun a zatui zong tavun! Na zatuite theampo kimanna nei ngawl a; bangma in no hong damsak thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Minamte theampo in na maizumna za zo a; na kaana mihing theampo in za zo hi. Ngalkapte khat le khat kituan tha a, a nii in lei ah puk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar sia Egypt sim tu in hong pai ciang, Topa in kei hong paupui hi. Ama in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Egypt ngamsung khuate Migdol, Memphis le Tahpanhes ah thangsak in: ‘Noma le noma a kihu tu in kinging vun; noma neisa theampo ngal kisimna sungah kisusia tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Banghangin a thahat note pathian Apis taaksuk zo ziam? Topa in ama saat vawk hi!’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Noma ngalkapte lutu in puk zo hi; amate khat le khat ii tungah, ‘Manlang vun! Ih mite ii inn ah cia in ngalte namsau pan suakta tawng!’ kici uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Egypt kumpipa min thak khat vaw vun — ‘Kiphatsak Kam bebek pau a, a Hunpha a Taanpa’ ci vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa Keima sia kumpipa ka hi hi. A nungta Pathian ka hi hi. Mual dangte sangin Tabor mual a saan zawk bangin, Carmel mual sia tuipi tungah dawk to in a saan bangma in, No hong sim sia pa ii thahatna zongh lian tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Egypt mite awng, luangta tu in kinging vun! Memphis khua sia sennealngam kisuaksak tu a, kisiacip in kuama teang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Egypt ngam sia saksang panin hong leang thataa ii a pe khuipui limci khat taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A cialsa ngalkapte ngawngawn khuinote bangin cimaw uh hi. Amate in nang kenkon in do ngawl a; nungkin in tai siat uh hi. Amate ii a lal ni le a siat hun hong theng zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A ngalte ii ngalkapte in a neak vaial uh ciang, Egypt sia ngul khat a haam bangin haam in taikeak hi. Thingphuk thei mite in taam ngam a sukthap uh bangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />amate in tua ngam sia hei taw sim uh hi. A mite sia sim zawk ngawl tu za in tam lei a, a ngalkapte sia khaumawte sangin tamzaw uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Egypt mite sia maizum ngasak a; saksang mite in amate zothal uh hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa, Israel te ii Pathian in, “Thebes te pathian Amon sia Egypt le a pathiante sia a kumpipate taw daan ka pia khawm tu hi. Egypt kumpipa le ama a muang theampo ka la tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />amate a that nuam Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar le a ngalkaphonpi khut sungah ka aap tu hi. Ahihang hun khat ciang, nidang hun a ten ngei bangma in Egypt ngam ah mihingte teang kik tu uh hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ka mite awng, lau heak vun, Israel mite awng, patau heak vun. Na thongtaakna uh ngam khuala na pan kong suatak tu hi. Note na inn na lo ah na cia kik tu uh a thinnuam in na teang tu uh hi; note ngam muangin na om tu uh a, hong lausak kuama om ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Note kungah kong pai tu a kong ngum tu hi. Note kong thethaang na ngam theampo ka susia tu a, ahihang no kong susia buatu hi. Daan piak ngawlin note kong tha thong buatu hi; ahihang a kilawm za in daan kong pia tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Egypt kumpipa in Gaza khua a sim ma in Philistia mite taw kisai in Topa in keima tungah thu hong son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in: “En in! Sak sangah tui khang a, nguntui pawm bangin luang tu hi. Tua tuite in leitung le a tungah a om na theampo, khuapite le a sungah a teang mihingte khuum tu hi. Mihingte in hu ngenin au tu uh a; lei tungah om theampo in nasia takin kap tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in, siphu khuasuan ngingte, siphu ngalleang ngingte, a mui ngingte za tu uh hi. Nute pate sia a tate en kik tu in hong heak kik ngawl tu uh a; amate ii khutte a pangh ah kaai suk niingniang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Philistia suksiat tu hun, Tyre le Sidon pan a, a nga sun hunate theampo khatan tu hun hong theng zo hi. Keima, Topa in Crete tuikulh pan a hong pai Philistia te theampo ka susia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gaza mite tungah heena lian theng zo a, Ashkelon ii mite dai dide in om uh hi. Philistia mi a om laiteng bang tanvei kap tu uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘ Topa ii Namsau awng! Bang tanvei vaat lai tu ni ziam? Na paai zuan kik in a, tua munah om in tawlnga in!’ ci in na au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang a sep tu nasep ka piaksa ahiciang, bangbangin tawlnga thei tu ziam? Ashkelon le tuipi hui ah a teang mite sim tu in thu ka pia zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in Moab ngam taw kisai hi bangin ci hi: “Nebo khua mite hesuak vun — a khua kisusia hi! Kiriathaim khua kila zo a, a kulh lianpi kipheltham zo hi, a mite maizum kingasak zo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moab ngam ii a hoina teng bo zo hi. Ngalte in Heshbon la zo a, Moab minamte suksiat tu sawm ku uh hi. Madmen khua kithimsak tu a; ngalkaphonpi in tuanhcil tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Horonaim mite in, ‘Ngoltolna! Kisuksiatna!’ ci in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Moab sia kisusia zo hi; patangte kaana aw ngai vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Luhith mual kaatona lam tawntung ah amate naangin a kaana awte, Horonaim khuapi paisukna lampi ah ngimin khamin a kaana awte ngai vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘Manlang vun, na suatak natu uh in tai vun! Sennealngam a om ngam laate bangin tai vun!’ amate in ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Moab awng, na hatna le na hauna na suang hi, ahihang tu in nang ngawngawn hong kizo tu a; na pathian Chemosh sia a kumpi tapate le a thiampite taw saltaang khawm tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khua khat beak zongh suksiatna pan suakta ngawl tu a; mualkuam le zaangtam zong kisiasak khawm tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moab atu in thaansuang khat phut vun; hai ngawlin kisia tu hi. A khuate a sia in kinusia tu a, tuasung ah kuama teang kik ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />(A thin theampo taw To pa ii na a seam ngawl pa sia haamsiat vun! Mihing a vaattan ngawl, a that ngawl pa haamsiat vun!)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in, “Moab sia thin muangin om tawntung a, ngamdang ah sal kitangsak ngeingawl hi. Ama sia beal khat pan beal khat sungah a kisung ngeingawl a omcing sapittui taw kibang hi. A ngim lal ngeingawlin lim tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tua ahiciang tu in sapittui bang a Moab mite a sungkeak tu in mihingte ka paisak hun hong theng tu hi. Amate in a sapit beal hawmsak tu a, tua zawkciang sutham tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Israel mite ii up le muan Bethel pathian a upkhialna pan a maan mu uh a, a thinkiam bangma in Moab mite zongh, Chemosh a pathian huvau in a thinkiam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Moab mite awng, banghangin ngalhangte ka hi uh a, ngalsim thiam ngalkapte ka hi uh kici nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moab le a khuapite kisiasak zo a; a tangval a taktaibel teng kithatlum zo hi. Keima sia kumpipa, Vaanglianbelpa Topa ka hi hi, tuaciang keima in ka ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Moab ngam ii lal tu nai zo a; a siat natu hong theng pal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A nai ah a teangte le a minthanna a he mihingte theampo awng, Tua ngam atu in khuangai vun. ‘A nasia mama a ngamukna vaang bo zo a, a minthanna le a vaangletna om nawn ngawl hi,’ ci vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />No, Dibon khua ah a teangte awng, na minphatna mun panin hong tuaksuk tavun a leivui sungah hong to tavun; Moab a siasak pa sia hi sungah om a, a kulhte siacip in nusia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aroer khua ah a teang note awng, lamhui ah dingin ngak vun; a taikeak mihingte tungah bang thu piang ziam ci sia dongh in he vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />‘Moab puk zo hi, tuasia atu in kap vun; mindaina thuak hi. Moab ngam kisiatna thu sia Arnon ngundung ah taangko vun!’ ci in amate in hong zo tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mual zaangtam tungah a om khuapite; Holon, Jahzah, Mephath,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dibon, Nebo, Beth Diblathaim,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kiriathaim, Bethgamul, Bethmeon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kerioth le Bozrah te tungah thukhenna theng zo hi. A khuala le a nai a om Moab ngam khuapite theampo ii tungah thukhenna theng zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Moab ii thahatna kisucip zo a; a vaangletna kisiasak zo hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa in, “Moab vaisak vun, banghang ziam cile ama in kei hong langpan hi. Moab sia ama luak sungah leiliik tu a midangte nui tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Moab awng, Israel mite na nunau sia phawk in. Mihing suamte pawl taw a kiman khawm bangin amate na vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“No, Moab ngam ah a teang mite awng, na khua uh nusia vun! Pai in liangtung ah teang vun! Liangmai ah bu a vawt vakhu sia taw kibang tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moab sia kiphasak mama hi! A mite kiphatsakna, a kisak theina, a kiletsakna le bang zata amate le amate kithupi ngaisut ziam ci thute ka za zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Keima, Topa in amate ii a kihisakna thu ka he hi. Amate ii kisuantaakna sia bangma penh zo ngawl a, a vawtnate sia ngei kho ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ahikom Moab ngamsung a om mi sim atu le Kir Heres mite atu in ka kap tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jazer mite atu sangin Sibmah mite atu in ka kaana nasia zaw tu hi. Sibmah khuapi awng, nangma in a baakte Tuipi Thi kaantan a, Jazer ciang dong a zaam sapitkung khat taw na kibang hi. Ahihang tu in na khaal thingngate le na sapitngate kisusia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lungdamna le thinnopna sia Moab ngam leiphana panin kila zo hi. Sapit ngoaina panin sapittui a luan ka tawpsak hi; sapit um a lungdam in a au tu kuama om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Heshbon khuamite le Elealeh mite kap uh a, a kaana aw sia Jahaz ciang dongin kiza thei hi; tua kaana aw sia Zoar khua mite in za thei uh a Horonaim le Eglath Shelishiyah khuate dongin kiza hi. Nimrim lui ngawngawn kang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Moab mite sia a biakna munte ah meihal biakpiaknate le a pathiante tungah a sangaw biakpiaknate a piak ngawl natu in ka khaktan tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Tua ahikom mithi vuina taamngai a tum khat bangin Moab atu le Kir Heres mite atu in ka khuangai hi; banghang ziam cile a neisa theampo a bo siat hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amate a vekpi a sam le a khamulte meet uh hi. Amate a vekpi in a khut ki at uh a, mi simin khau-ip puan silh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Moab ngamsung innkhum theampo le taangpi khawlmun theampo ah khuangaina ci ngawl bangma dang om ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile kuama dei ngawl thambeal khat bangin Moab ka sutham zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Moab ngam kitamhtham zo hi! Kap vun! Moab kimaimawlsak zo hi. Moab kisiacip zo a, a kiim a paam minamte theampo in nuisan uh hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A tha a phalh muvanlai khat bangin minam khat sia Moab ngam tungah hong suktun tu hi ci in Topa in kamciam zo hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />tuaciang a khuate le a kulhte kila tu hi. Tua ni in Moab ngalkapte sia numei nausuak tu khat bangin patau tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Moab sia kisusia tu a, minam khat suak zo nawn ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile ama in kei hong langpan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Patauna, dumte le thaangte in Moab mite ngak nginge hi. Topa in ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A patauna pan suatak tu a hanciam pawpo dum sungah taak tu uh a, dum sung panin a kaato pawpo thaang sungah kiman tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile Moab mite lal natu in Topa in hun ciangtan zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A cimaw ngaltaite in Sihon kumpipa ii khatvei a uk ngei na Heshbon khuapi sungah bel natu zong in hanciam uh hi, ahihang tua khuapi sia mei in kaanghtum hi. Ngalsim a kin Moab mite ii ngamngi sang teng le mualsaangte sia mei in kaanghtham zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Moab mite hesuak vun! Chemosh a bia mite kisusia zo a, a tapate le a tanute thongtaak tu in kipaipui zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ahihang mailam sangah Topa in Moab sia nuamsasak kik tu hi. Hite theampo sia Moab tungah a piang tu thu Topa ii sonsa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ammon thu Topa in hi bangin son hi: “Israel pasalte koisungah om ziam? A ngam a hung tu kuama om ngawl ziam? Banghangin Gad minamte ii ngam sia Molech pathian a bia mihingte in lasakin tua munah teangsak ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahizong Rabbah khuapi ah a teang mihingte in ngal kidona aw ka zaaksak tu hun hong theng tu a, a khuapi kisiacip in a khuanote kihaltum tu hi. Tuasia ciang Israel in a ngam hong laaksak mite kung pan a ngam la kik tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Heshbon mihingte awng, au in kap vun! Ai sia kisiasak zo hi! Rabbah numeite awng khuangai in kap vun! Khau-ip puan silhin kap vun! Lungmangin tai kawkoai vun. Na pathian Molech sia a thiampite le a kumpi tapate taw saltaang tu in kipaipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thumaan ngawl mihingte awng banghangin kisathei nu ziam? Na thahatna kiam susuk hi. Banghangin na thahatna uh suangin kuama in ko hong sim ngam buan te ci nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na kiim na paam panin launa kong thengsak tu hi. Na taikeak siat tu uh hi. Na suatak natu in na tai tek tu uh a, na ngalkapte a kaikhawm kik tu kuama om ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ahihang nidang ciang Ammon sia ka nuamsasak kik tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka ci zo hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in Edom te ii thu hi bangin son hi: “Edom mite in a thumaan a khen thei na sia bosua zo ziam? Ngaisutna a pia theite in a vawt tu bangin son thei nawn ngawl ziam? A pilna theampo bosua zo ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dedan mite awng, kiheak vun a tai vun! Buu vun! Esau ii suan le paalte ka susia tu hi, banghang ziam cile amate daan ka piak tu hun hong theng zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mihingte in sapitnga a law uh ciang a kung tungah tawm khe a, tuaciang ngutate zanin hong pai ciang amate dei teng bek la uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahihang Esau ii suan le paalte a puan ka suutsak siat zo a tuaciang a buk thei nawn ngawl natu in a bukna munte ka kilanghsak zo hi. Edom mite a vekpi in kisusia zo hi. Khat zongh taang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na tangate ka kungah hong nusiat tavun. Keima in amate ka keam tu hi. Na meingongte in kei hong bealh thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Daan piak tu a, a kilawm ngawl mite ngawngawn in daan thuakna hai pan dawn tu ahile no, daan piak ngawlin om tu in ki um nu ziam? Hi ngawl hi, tua hai pan dawn hamtang tu nu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bozrah khuapi sia a lipkhaphuai mun le senneal ngam suak tu hi ci in keima mama in ka kiciam zo hi; mihingte in tua khua sia ciammuina in nei in, a min sia kihaamsiatna in zangh tu uh hi. A nai a om khuanote theampo a tawntungin kisiacip tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka ci zo hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima in, “Edom awng, Topa kung panin thu khat ka nga zo hi. Minamte in a ngalkaphonpi a khoptua natu le nang hong sim tu in a kingin natu thu a son tu in Topa in ama te kungah kamtai khat paisak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in nang hong thazawmsak tu a, kuama in nang hong zakta ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na kiphatsakna in nang hong theam zo hi. Amate in nangma hong kiita tu na upza in kuama in nang hong kiita ngawl hi. Nang sia suangliang tung le mualdawn saangna ah na teang a; muvanlai khat bangin a saangna ah na ten hangin Topa in nang hong khiasuk veve tu hi. Topa in son zo hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in, “Edom tungah a theng tu suksiatna sia nasia mama tu a, a kaantan theampo lau in ingh tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sodom khua, Gomorrah khua le a kiim a khuate a kisiatsak lai bangin Edom khua kisiasak tu hi. Tua munah kuama teang kik ngeingawl tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tawpi in ngam tawnghtol sung pan hong pusuak a, lopa hingna Jordan ngundung zui in a pai bangin, keima kong pai tu a, Edom mite a ngam uh panin thakhat thu in ka taikeaksak tu hi. Tuasia ciang keima ii teal lampuipa in ngam uk tu hi. Kei taw kitee ngat thei tu akua om ziam? Akua in kei hong thato ngam tu ziam? Kei hong nalh zo tu ukpa akua om ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahikom Edom mite suksiat natu ka tupna le Teman khuapi mite tungah vawt tu ka tupnate ngai vun. A patangte uh ngawngawn kikaikeak tu a, a kuama po liinglawng tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Edom a siat ciang leitung buppi kiliing tu za in a nging khat om tu a, patau auna le kaana awte sia Aqaba tuipi dok dongin kiza tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Muvanlai in a tha phalhin a suktun taw kibangin ngalte in Bozrah sim tu hi. Tua ni in Edom ngalkapte sia nausuak tu a tun numei bangin thin patau in om tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in Damascus ii thu hi bangin son hi: “Hamath le Arpad khuapite sungah a teang mihingte sia thusia a zaak uh manin patau a, thinngimin om uh hi. A patauna te tuipi bangin amate tungah kiliim a, thim om thei ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Damascus mite sia a tha zawm a lau in taikeak uh hi. Numei nausuak tu a tun bang keakin na sa in ngim thuakin om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua a minthang, a lungdam bul khuapi sia kinusia cip zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ni in a tangvalte sia khuapi sung lampi tungah kithat tu a, a ngalkapte theampo kimaimot tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Damascus luphungte mei taw ka hal tu a, Benhadad ii kumpi innte sia ka haltum tu hi. Keima, Vaanglianbelpa Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar ii a zaw Kedar minam le Hazor ii uk ngamkhennote taw kisai in Topa ii cina pan: “Kedar mite sim vun a, nisuana sangah a om minam sia susia vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A puanbukte le a tuu honte, a buk kongkha puankhaite le a buk sungah a om nate theampo laksak vun. A kalaoh te la vun a, a mite tungah, ‘Na kiim na paam theampo ah launa om hi’ ci in son vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Hazor mihingte awng, a khuala na ah tai vun a buu vun ci in keima, Topa in kong sonkhol hi. Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in no hong thasawm a, ama in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />‘Hong pai tavun! Ngammuang a kisa mite ih sim tu hi! A khuapi in kongpi le nei ngawl, tawkalh natu tawbu le nei ngawl a, kidal vet ngawl hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“A kalaoh te le nganno a hul a khoaite theampo la vun! A sam uh a tom in a meet mihingte sia mun theampo ah ka thethaang tu a, mun theampo pan amate tungah tuasiatna ka thengsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hazor ngam sia a tawntungin sennealngam kisuaksak tu a, ngiate bek tua munah teang tu hi. Tua munah kuama teang kik ngeingawl tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Zedekiah ii Judah kumpi a sua zawk po ciang, Vaanglianbelpa Topa in Elam ngam thu ka tungah hong son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama in, “Elam ngam a thahatsak mama thalkaap thiamte theampo ka that tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mun theampo panin Elam ngam sia vui in ka seamsak tu a, a ngaltai mite a thet ngawlna ngam khat beak om ngawl dongin a mite mun theampo ah ka thethaang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amate a that nuam a ngalte Elam mite in ka kiitasak tu hi. Ka thin uuk mama na taw in Elam mite ka susia tu a, ka lalcipsak dongin amate a do tu in ngalkaphonpi ka puak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A kumpite le a lampuite ka susia tu a, tua munah ka kumpi tokhum ka nga tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ahihang nidang ciang Elam mite ka nuamsasak kik tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babylon khuapi le a mite taw kisai in Topa in hi bangin a thupuak sia ka tungah hong son hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Minamte tungah hi thu son in! Hi thu thangsak in! Limlakna pia in a, a thu taangko in! Thuku in koi heak in! Babylon taak zo hi! A pathian Marduk kisemtham zo hi! Babylon ii milimte kimaizumsak zo hi; a kiihuai a milimte kisutham hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Saksang panin minam khat Babylon sim tu in hong theng zo a tua sia sennealngam suaksak tu hi. Mihing le nganhingte taikeak tu uh a, tua munah kuama teang ngawl tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in, “Tua hun hong thet ciang, Israel le Judah mite kap kawmin hong paikhawm tu uh a, amate ii Pathian, keima hong zong tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in Zion lampi dongh tu uh a, tua zawkciang tua sang ah pai tu uh hi. Amate in keima taw a tawntung kiciamna khat vawt tu uh a, bangma hunin palsat ngeingawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ka mite sia tuucingte ii mualtung tengah a bosua tuute taw kibang hi. Amate sia tuute bangin mual khat pan mual khat ah vakthap kawkoai uh a, a inn omna mun mangil zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate sia a mute theampo in sim uh hi. A ngalte in, ‘Amate sia Topa tungah maw uh hi, tua ahikom hi bang a amate tungah ih vawt sia kikhial ngawl hi. A taanghpupite in Topa muang hi, tua ahiciang amate mama sia Topa tungah a thumaan top tu uh ahi hi,’ ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Israel mite awng, Babylon panin taikeak vun! Hi ngam nusia vun! A nusia phitbel hi vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sak sangah a om ngam thahat pawlkhat ka thawn tu a Babylon ka simsak tu hi. Amate in tua ngam sim tu in a thuangin kingual tu a, zo tu uh hi. Amate sia thal taw muiliim savai thiamte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Babylon khuapi kiphuul tu a, a phuulte in a dei theampo la tu uh hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in, “Babylon mite awng, ka minam na suttol uh hi. Note lungdam in na kipaak uh a, khuipui an cicil ahibuale a hahaam siphu khat bangin vak kawkoai nu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ahihang na khuapi lian uh sia a vaang kibosak tu a, kimaizumsak tu hi. Babylon sia ngam theampo sung panin a thupi ngawlbel ngam suak tu a, a kongaw le tui om ngawl sennealngam suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka thin uukna hu in Babylon ah kuama teang ngawl tu hi; a siacip in kinusia tu a, tua mun kaantan in a paite theampo in ingh in lamdang sa tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Thal toaite awng, Babylon sim tu in kingual vun a kiim uum vun. Na thaltang theampo uh taw Babylon kap vun, banghang ziam cile ama in keima Topa tungah hong maw zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khuapi kiimkot ah ngal thotna aw taw au vun! Tu in Babylon in ngallel zo hi. A khuapi luphungte sulet zo a cimhtham zo hi. Keima in Babylon te tungah phu ka la hi. Tua ahikom amate tungah phulam vun a, midangte tungah a vawt uh bangin amate tungah vawt vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ngam sungah thaicii kituu heak hen a, an kila heak hen. Tua munah a teang ngamdangmite theampo in Babylon a sim ngalkaphonpi sia kiita tu a, a inn a lo ah cia kik tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in, “Israel mite sia tawpite in delmang a, a kithethaang tuute taw kibang uh hi. A masabel in amate sia Assyria kumpipa in sim a, tua zawkciang Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in a ngu khimtham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahikom, Keima, Vaanglianbelpa Topa , Israel ii Pathian in, Assyria kumpilianpa daan ka piak bangma in Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa le a ngam daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel mite a ngam ah ka teangsak kik tu hi. Amate in Carmel mual tung le Bashan ngam sungah a ciin ante ne tu uh a, Ephraim le Gilead ngamte sungah a piang ante theampo a du bangin in ne tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua hun a thet ciang, Israel ngam ah mawna khialna kimu ngawl tu a, Judah ngam ah seksolna om ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile a nuntakna ka kheet lai mihingte ii mawna ka maisak tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in, “Merathaim mite le Pekod mite sim vun. That vun a susia vun. Kong thupiak theampo seam vun. Keima, Topa in ka ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hi ngam ah ngal kisimna aw kiza a, suksiatna nasia takin om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Babylon in leitung buppi sek taw seaktham a, tu in tua sek sia taltan zo hi! Tua ngam ah a piang thute minam theampo in lamdang sa in ingh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Babylon awng, kei nong do hi, na heak ngawl hang bek hi a, thaang kong siana sungah na awk zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka ngalhiamte koina mun ka hong zo hi, ka thin uuk in tua ngalhiamte ka pusua keak zo hi, banghang ziam cile Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa , Vaanglianbelpa in Babylon ah nasep tu ka nei hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mun theampo pan sim vun a, a antang kholna munte hong keak vun! Na suttol vanhte antang sen bangin seng to vun! A ngam susia vun! Bang mama khe heak vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A ngalkapte theampo that vun! Amate mon vun! Babylon mite a lal a hi uh hi! Amate daan piak tu hun hong theng zo hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />(Ngaltaite Babylon pan suakta in Jerusalem theng uh a, Babylon te ii a Biakinnpi tungah a vawt nate hu in Topa ih Pathian in bangbangin phula ci sia amate in son uh hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Babylon sim tu in thalkaap thiamte son vun. Thal le thaltang a zangh thiamte theampo kuansak vun. A khuapi kiim uum vun a khat zongh suaktasak heak vun. A sep a vawt theampo thuk kik vun, midangte tungah a vawt bangin a tungah vawt vun, banghang ziam cile a kiphatsakna taw diang in Israel ii a Thiangtho Pa, hong langpan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ahikom a tangvalte sia khuapi sung lampi tungah kithatlum tu a, a ngalkapte theampo sia tua ni in kilalcipsak tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Babylon awng, nang sia kiphatsakna taw kidim ni hi. Tua hu in Vaanglianpipa Topa Vaanglianbelpa, Keima in nang kong langpan hi! Nang daan kong piak tu hun hong theng zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A kiphasak na ngam sia lutu in puk tu a, kuama in nang hong phongto ngawl tu hi. Na khuapite ka hal tu a, a kiim ah a om theampo kaanghtum tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in, “Israel mite le Judah mite in zawthawk vawtna thuak uh hi. Amate a mante theampo in amate hi cinten in cingin pusuaksak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahihang amate a suatak tu pa sia thahat a — ama min sia Vaanglianbelpa Topa ahi hi. Ama mama in amate vai teng vaansak tu a, leitung ah kilemna thengsak tu hi, ahihang Babylon mite tungah ngimna thengsak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Topa in, “Babylon ah thina theng hen! A mihingte, a ukte le a mipilte tungah thina theng hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Leilot kamsaangte tungah thina theng tahen — bang ka mawmawt uh ci ziam! A ngalkapte tungah thina theng tahen — bangza in lauhuai ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A siphute le a siphu ngalleangte susia vun! A cial ngalkapte tungah thina theng tahen — bangza in zawm ziam! A sum a paaite susia vun, suttol in laksak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A ngam ah nguatui hangsak vun a, a ngunte kangsak vun. Babylon sia a kiitakhuai milim biakna ngam hi a, tua milimte in mihing mawmawte suaksak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Tua ahikom Babylon sia doaite, tha ngilote le vacim thiangtho ngawlte teenna ngam suak tu hi. Tua munah bangma hun in mihing teang kik ngei nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Sodom khua, Gomorrah khua le a nai a khuate ka suksiat bangin Babylon ka susia tu hi. Tua munah kuama teang kik ngeingawl tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Sak sang ngam panin a khuala ah a om a thahat minam khat hong pai hi; kumpi tam mamate ngal do tu in kithoai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amate in a thal le namsaute toai uh hi; Amate sia ngilo a ngual hesuakna nei ngawl uh hi. A siphute tung a to uh ciang, tuipi hawk bangin nging hi. Babylon sim tu in amate kithoai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa in tua thu za a, a khutte zaw vanek hi. Ama in numei nautun a nat bangin thinngimna le tak ngimna thuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Jordan ngundung taam thuk sung pan pusuak in, lopa hingna munah a pai to tawpi khat bangin Keima, Topa kong pai tu a, Babylon te a khuapi uh pan thakhatthu in ka taikeaksak tu hi. Tuasia zawkciang lampui ka tealpa in ngam uk tu hi. Kei taw kitee ngat thei tu akua om ziam? Akua in kei hong thato ngam tu ziam? Hong langpan ngam tu kumpi akua bang om ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tua ahikom Babylon khuapi suksiat natu ka tupna le a mite tungah ka vawt tu zia ka sawmna teng hong ngai tavun. A patangte ngawngawn kikaikeak tu a, mihing theampo patausak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Babylon a bo ciang, awnging nasia tu ahikom leitung buppi liing tu hi. Patau in a auna awte minam dangte in za tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in, “Babylon le a mite a lalsak vuipi khat ka vasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vuipi in taangphaw a seamkeak bangin Babylon susia tu in ngamdangmite ka puak tu hi. Tua suksiatna ni a thet ciang, amate in mun theampo pan sim tu a, a ngam sia a kolh in nusia tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ngalkapte a thalkaap tu le a thik puan a silh tu hun pia heak vun. A tangvalte khoaikhe heak vun! A ngalkap buppi mon vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate sia a khuapi sung lampi tungah kiliamsak tu a, thi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in Israel ii a Thiangtho Pa, Keima tungah hong maw zo ahitazong Keima, Topa Pathian Vaanglianbelpa in Israel le Judah ka taisan bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Babylon panin tai vun! Na suatak natu in tai vun! Babylon ii mawna khialna hangin thalup thuak heak vun. Keima in tu in phu ka la a, a kilawm bangin daan ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Babylon sia leitung buppi a vai sak ka khut sungah a om khamh hai khat taw kibang hi. Minamte in a sapittui ne in a thin ciim ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Babylon sia thakhat thu pukin kisiacipsak hi! Tuasia khuangai pui vun! A liamma bawl natu in zatui la vun; dam thei lai tha tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua munah a teang ngamdangmite in, ‘Babylon hu tu in ka hanciam uh hang hai lei zo hi. Tu in nusia in ih inn ih lo zuan kik ka tawng. Pathian in Babylon sia a tha neiza theampo taw daan pia zo a, siasak dipdeap zo hi,’ ci uh hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in, “Ka mite au a, ‘ Topa in a maan ih hinate lak zo hi. Pai in Topa ih Pathian ii nasepte Jerusalem mite tungah son ka tawng’ ci uh hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in Babylon suksiat tu a sawm hu in Media kumpite thawn zo hi. A Biakinnpi a suksiat hu in ama in hi bangin phulam tu ahi hi. Ngal a sim ngalkapmangte in, “Na thaltang hiamsak vun! Na lum uh la in kithoai vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Babylon ii luphungte sim tu in lim lak vun. Phualcingte belapin thahatsak vun! Ngalvilte koi vun! A suam tu mite koi vun!” ci in thupia hi. Topa in Babylon mite tungah ka vawt tu hi a ci sia vawt zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ngam in ngun tam mama nei a, nei le lamh hau mama hi, ahihang a hun bo zo a, a nuntakna khauzam sia kisaattan zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in Babylon sim tu in mihing tam mama, khaumaw honpui bangin paipui tu a, ngalzawna taw amate au tu uh hi ci in a nuntakna taw kiciam zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in a vaangletna taw lei vawt a; ama ciimna taw leitung bitphua in vantungte phalh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama ii thupiakna taw van ii tungsia ah a om tuite hawk a; ama in leimong panin meeite paipui hi. Ama in nguatui sungah khua lengsak a, a bumngua kholna inn panin vui vasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hisia a mu uh ciang, mihingte khuaphawk ngawlin mawmaw kisa uh hi; Milim a vawtte a thinkiam uh hi, banghang ziam cile amate ii vawt pathiante sia, a maan hi ngawl a, nuntakna nei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuate sia manh nei ngawl a, no mu tu ahi hi; Topa ii amate taw kisi tu hong pai ciang amate kisiasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jacob ii Pathian sia amate bang hi ngawl hi; Ama sia na theampo a vawtpa hi a, ama mi tatak tu in Israel teal zo hi. Ama min sia Vaanglianbelpa Topa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in, “Babylon awng nang sia ka sek na hi a, ka ngalhiam na hi hi. Minamte le kumpi ngamte sukcip natu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Siphu le a tung tote seakthap natu, Siphu ngalleang le a hawlte seakthap natu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />pasalte le numeite thalup natu, Khanghaamte le khangmoite thalup natu, tangvalnote le ngaknunote thalup natu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tuucingte le a tuu honte thalup natu, lothote le a siphute thalup natu, ngamukte le uliante sukcip natu in nang kong zangh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa in, “Jerusalem tungah siatna a vawtte theampo hu in Babylon le a mite tungah ka thuk kik sia na mu tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Babylon awng, nang sia leitung buppi a susia mual khat taw na kibang hi, ahihang Keima, Topa sia na ngal ka hi hi. Nang kong man tu a, lei taw kim in vut sungah kong nusia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na siatnate a kikholna sung panin suang khat zongh inn sak natu in kizangh kik ngeingawl tu hi. A tawntungin sennealngam khat bang na hi tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ngalsim natu in heaksakna lim pia vun! Minamte ii zaak thei tu in lemle tum vun! Babylon sim tu in minamte kithoaisak vun! Ngalsim tu in Ararat ngam, Minni ngam le Ashkenaz ngamte son vun. Ngalsim lampui tu in ngalkap mang khat see vun. Khaumaw honkhat bangin siphute keng vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Babylon sim tu in minamte kithoaisak vun. Media kumpite, a lampuite le a uliante le amate ii uk ngamte theampo ii ngalkaphonpite vaitha vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Leitung sia lau in liing hi; banghang ziam cile Babylon ngam sia kuama ii ten ngawlna sennealngam suaksak tu a, Topa in a ngealna a taangtutsak hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Babylon ngalkapte ngalsim nawn ngawlin a kulh sungah om uh hi. Amate a thin uh no in numeite bang hi zo hi. A khuapi kongpite taltan zo a, a innte kaangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama ii khuapi sia a pangh theampo panin kisutham zo hi ci in Babylon kumpipa tungah ko tu in kamtai khat zawkciang khat tai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ngalte in ngun kaantanna mun sia la zo a ngalpanna kulh teng hal zo hi. Babylon ngalkapte patau khat sua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Khuangeingawlin ngalte in ancilna munah taangcil bangin amate saat vawkin tuanhcil tu uh hi. Keima, Vaanglianbelpa Topa Israel ii Pathian in ka ci zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa in, Jerusalem sia saattan in ne hi. Ama in thambeal khat bangin khuapi hawm suaksak a; ngulpui khat bangin ama in valh hi, ama in a dei teng la in a dang teng vawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Zion mite in, “Hong ngoltol vawtna hangin Babylon in mawpu tahen!” ci ta uh hen. Jerusalem mite in, “Koma ii thuakna hu in Babylon in mawsiat thuak tahen!” ci ta uh hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ahikom Topa in Jerusalem mite tungah, “Na thu kong panpui tu a no tungah hong vawtna hu in na ngalte ka thuaksak tu hi. Babylon te ii tuinaak le a ngunte ka kangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua ngam sia ngamsate teenna ninthuk suak tu hi. Tua mun sia thaadam huai mun hi tu a; kuama teang ngawl tu hi, a mute theampo in lau tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Babylon te theampo sia tawpite bangin hawk tu a, tawpi note bangin thuum tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Amate duhop uh ziam? Amate atu in anneakpoai khat ka vawt tu a, zukham lungdam in ka omsak tu hi. Amate mu tu uh a khanglo ngeingawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuunote, kealte le tuutalte bangin amate thalup tu in ka paipui tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Topa in Babylon thu hi bangin son hi; “Leitung buppi ii pok khuapi sia kila zo hi! Minamte atu in Babylon sia a thaadam huai suak zo hi!.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuipi sia Babylon khua tungah kinil zo a, tuihual te hawk in khum zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Khuate thaadam huai suak zo a, kuama teen ngawl, khualhaw ngawlna, tui om ngawl sennealngam bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Babylon ii pathian Bel sia daan ka pia tu a, a vanh nguk teng ka pia kiksak tu hi; minamte in ama bia nawn ngawl tu uh hi. “Babylon ii luphungte cimh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Israel mite awng, tua mun panin tai vun! Na nuntak natu in ka thin uuk tutna pan tai vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Kamleang na zakte hu in na thin uh kiamsak heak vun a, lau heak vun. Kum simin a kibang ngawl kamleang — ngamsung le kumpi khat le khat kidona, ngongtatna vai kamleangte kizel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tua ahikom Babylon ii milimte daan ka piak tu hun hong theng hi. A ngam buppi kimaizumsak tu a, a mite theampo kithatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Saksang pan a susia tu in hong pai mite khut sungah Babylon a taak ciang lei le van ah a omte theampo lungdam in au tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Babylon in leitung theampo a mihingte thisak hi, Israel te tam mama thisak ahikom tu in Babylon bo tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Topa in Babylon a om a mite tungah: “Thina panin suakta zo nu hi! Tu in pai vun! Ngak heak vun! Inn taw kikhuala na hi uh hangin Keima na Topa hong ngaisun tavun a Jerusalem phawk vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Note in, ‘Ih min hong kidaisak zo a hong kimaizumsak zo hi; Ngamdangmite in Biakinnpi sung a thiangtho na munte la zo ahikom cimaw cip ka kisa uh hi,’ na ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tua ahikom Babylon khua a milimte tungah daan ka piak tu hun le ngamsung theampo ah a liamte a tau tu hun hong theng tu hi ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Babylon sia van ah kaato thei in, tua munah kulh kho khat a vawt thei hial zongin tua kulh susia tu in mihing ka puak veve tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Topa in, “Babylon khua sungah kaana aw le, ngamsung kisuksiatna hu in khuangaina aw ngai vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Babylon ka susia tu a, ka ngamkhingsak tu hi. Ngalkaphonpite in tuihual bangin del in a nging tatakin au in sim uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Amate Babylon susia tu in hong pai zo hi; a ngalkapte kiman a, a thalte kithiaktan hi. A ngilote daan a pia sia Pathian Keima ka hi a, a kiphu bangin Babylon daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />A ngamukte — mipilte, lampuite le ngalkapte ka vaisak tu hi. Amate mu in khanglo ngeingawl tu uh hi. Keima kumpipa in ka ci zo hi; Keima in Vaanglianbelpa Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />A thahat Babylon luphungte lei ah kilawnsuk tu a, A saang khuapi kongpite kihaltum tu hi. Minamte ii nasepna sia bangma in kimang ngawl hi; a hanciamnate kaanghtum hi. Keima, Vaanglianbelpa Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Zedekiah kumpipa a hu pa sia, Mahseiah ii tupa, Neriah ii tapa Seraiah ahi hi. Zedekiah ii Judah kumpi a sua zawk a kum lina kumin, Seraiah sia ama taw Babylon ah paikhawm hi, keima in Seraiah tungah thu pawlkhat ka hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Babylon tungah a theng tu suksiatna thu theampo le Babylon taw kisai hi thudangte theampo laibu khat sungah ka ciamtee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Keima in Seraiah tungah, “Babylon na thet ciang hi laibu sungah a ki at thute theampo mipite tungah a ngingin sim in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, hi bang thu na ngen in, ‘ Topa awng, hi mun sia a nungta, mihing hikale nganhing hikale a om ngawlna tu le a tawntung sennealngam bang ahi natu in ka susia tu na ci zo hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Seraiah awng, hi laibu sia mipite tungah na sim zawkciang, suangtum khat tungah khit in a, Euphrates ngun sungah vawk in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />tuaciang, ‘Hi bangin Babylon tungah tung tu hi — Babylon sia tui sungah tumsuk tu a lawtto kik ngeingawl tu hi. Banghang ziam cile Topa in suksiatna sia Babylon tungah a thetsak tu hang ahi hi,’ ci in,” ka ci hi. Jeremiah ii kammalte sia tu teng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zedekiah sia Judah kumpi a sua lai in kum kul le kum khat pha a, Jerusalem ah kum sawm le kum khat uk hi. A nu ii min sia Hamutal hi a, Libnah khuapi ah a teang Jeremiah ii tanu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jehoiakim kumpipa ii mawna khialna a vawt bangma in Zedekiah kumpipa in Topa tungah maw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa sia Jerusalem le Judah mite tungah thin uuk mama ahikom a mit muna pan hawlkhia hi. Zedekiah in Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar leedo hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tua ahiciang Zedekiah ii kumpi a sua zawk kum kua kum, a tha sawmna ni sawm ni in Nebuchadnezzar in a ngalkapte theampo taw pai in Jerusalem sim uh hi. Amate in khuapi pua sangah ngiaphual saatin, khuapi kiimkot ah ngal uumci na luphung vawt a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuaciang Zedekiah kumpipa maan zawk kum sawm le kum khat a phak dong tua khuapi uumci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua kum a tha lina ni kua ni in kialpi nasia mama a, mite neak tu bangma taang nawn ngawl ahikom,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />khuapi uumna luphungte kisulet hi. Babylon te in khuapi uumci hi napi, tua ngalkapte theampo zan lai in suakta uh hi. Amate sia kumpi huan paina lam zui in luphung te ni ii a kikawnna kongpi sia kaantan in Jordan Kuam sang zuanin tai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang Babylon ngalkaphonpi in Zedekiah kumpipa delkot in Jericho khua nai zaangtam ah man uh hi, a ngalkapte theampo in Zedekiah taisan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zedekiah sia Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa kungah kipaipui hi, tualai in Nebuchadnezzar sia Hamath ngam Riblah khuapi ah om a tua munah Nebuchadnezzar in ama tungah thukhen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Riblah ah Nebuchadnezzar in Zedekiah ii tapate sia a pa ii mu tang ma in that hi, tuaciang ama in Judah uliante zongh thatsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, ama in Zedekiah ii mittangte khelsak a kol thaakin Babylon ah paipui hi. Zedekiah sia a thi ni dong Babylon thong sungah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar ii Babylon kumpi a sep zawk kum sawm le kum kua kum a tha ngana, ni sawm ni in, kumpipa tungah ngaisutna a pia pa le a ngalkaphonpi ukpa Nebuzaradan sia Jerusalem khua ah tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in Biakinnpi, kumpi inn le Jerusalem khua sungah mi thupi theampo ii innte mei taw haltum hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuaciang a ngalkapte in khuapi luphungte sutham uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaciang Nebuzaradan in khua sungah a taanglai mite, khutthiam mi a taanglaite le Babylon te kungah hong taite Babylon ah paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang ama in nei le lamh a nei ngawl, a zawngbel mihing pawlkhat, Judah ngam sungah nusia in sapithuan le lo sungah naseam tu in koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Babylon te in Biakinnpi sungah a om taau khuamte le khuileangte le taau tuikuang lian sia sutham hi, tuaciang taaute theampo amate in Babylon ah paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in kawkeaute, biaknatau thianthosakna a, a kizangh vut kuangte, meiinn puuana a, a nazakte, sangaw biakpiakna chi donna kuangte, ngimnamtui halna kuangte le biakinn kikhopna a, a kizangh taau taw a kivawt nate theampo zongh la uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in khamh ahibuale ngunn taw a kivawt nate theampo la uh hi: tuate sia kuangnote, meikam toaina bealpeute, sangaw biakpiakna a chi donna kuangte, vut kuangte, meiinn ngaknate, ngimnamtui halna kuangte le sapittui sunna biakpiakna haite ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa ii Biakinnpi a tu a vawt taau vanhte — khuam niite, khuileangte, tuikuang lian sia le, a nanna khuital sawm le niite — sia khaitee tu in ngit leih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A khuam niite sia kibang linlian hi: khat sia metre 8 saang a, a kiimkot metre 5.3 pha hi. Tuate sia a sung hawm a, a thik sia millimetre 75 saa hi. Khuam dawn ah taau taw a kivawt a tungkhu khat veve om a, metre 2.2 saang hi, a kiimkot sia talee thingnga lim taw a kizeam thikpaona om a, a vekpi in taau taw kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khuam khat sim ii tungkhuna theampo tungah talee nga zakhat veu om a, sawmkua le luk sia lei panin kimu thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua bek dom ngawlin ngalkaphonpi ukpa, Nebuzaradan in Thiampi Lianbelpa Seraiah, thiampi dom Zephaniah le a thupi biakinn ulian dang thum te thongtaak tu in paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khuapi sung panin ngalkapte a uk ngalkap mangpa, khua sungah a taanglai, kumpipa ngaisutna a piate sung pan mihing sali, ngalkap zum lai a keam, ngalkapmang pa a hupa le a dang mihing thupi sawmlukte ama in paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nebuzaradan in amate sia Riblah khuapi ah a om, Babylon kumpipa kungah paipui hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tua khuapi sia Hamath ngam sungah om hi. Tua munah kumpipa in amate saatsak in thatlum hi. Tua ahikom Judah mite sia a ngam panin saltaang tu in kipaipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hisia in Nebuchadnezzar ii thongtaak a, a paipui mite teng kitepteena ahi hi: Ama ii kumpi a sep zawk a kum sali kum in ama in mihing 3,023 paipui hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />a kum sawm le kum liat kum in, Jerusalem panin 832;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />tuaciang a kum kul le kum thum kumin, 745 — Nebuzaradan in paipui hi. A vekpi in mihing 4,600 kipaipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Evilmerodach sia Babylon kumpi a sua kumin, ama in Judah kumpipa Jehoiachin sia thong panin a pusuasakna taw a dik na lak hi. Hi bang a suataksak ni sia Jehoiachin thongtaak a, a kipaipui zawk kum sawmthum le kum sali kum, a tha sawm le tha niina ni kul le ni nga ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Evilmerodach in Jehoiachin phat vawt a, Babylon ah ama taw saltaang khawm kumpi dangte sangin a vaang piakna lian zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ahikom Jehoiachin sia a thong puante kilaihsakin a nuntak lai teng kumpipa ii sabuai ah an kinesak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A nuntak sung ni sim a kisap na ah a zak tu in ama sia dangka kipia tawntung hi.
  </para>
</usx>
